<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUKE-NA I-ba Aphaba Pao</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKE-NA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Aphaba Pao</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">Pakhonchatpa Paulgi mateng pangkhiba amasung Pakhonchatpasinggi Thabakki lairiksu ikhiba Dr. Luke-na lairik asi chaorakna Christtagi chahi 59-63 gi manungda Rome-dagi ikhiba oiramba yai haina thajanei. Aphaba Paogi lairik asida Ibungo Jisubu Mapu Ibungona wasakpiramba Israel-gi Kanbiba Mapu amadi mipum khudingmakki Kanbiba Mapu oina utli. Lairik asida Jisubu chap chaba mioi amagi matou adusu utli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mapu Ibungona mipum khudingmakpu nungsi amasung Ibungo Jisuna mangkhrabasing adubu thinaba amadi kanbinaba lakle haiba asisu lairik asigi maru oiba wa amani (19:10). Hairiba wapham asimak eikhoina: Aphaba Samaria-gi migi pandam wari (10:25-37), Mangkhraba yaogi wari (15:1-7), Mangkhraba lupagi sel mayekki wari (15:8-10) amasung mangkhraba oktaba machanupagi pandam warida (15:11-32) uba phang-i. Amaromda swargadutsinggi esei, yaosenbasingna Jisu poklaba matungda thijaba, angang oiringeida Jisuna Mapugi Sanglenda leirambagi wari, Jihudisingna tukkachanaraba kanggat khombagi yumda leiba, sigadouraba huranba amada swargada leiminnagani haina Ibungona washakpibagi wari, hairiba pumnamaksing asi atei Aphaba Paogi lairikta yaodaba lairik asigi top-toppa masak amani. Aduga lairik asina haijabagi maramda, Thawai Asengbagi maramda, Jisuna Mapu Ibungo thougal toubagi maramda nupisinggi thoudang amasung Mapu Ibungona ayol-aran kokpibagi maramda akanba ithil pi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Wahoudok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Baptize toubiba John amadi Jisu pokpa amasung makhoina angang oiringeigi matam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5–2:52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Baptize toubiba John-na Mapugi thougal touba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Jisuna baptize louba amasung Satan-na Ibungobu themdoknaba hotnaba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21–4:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Galilee-da Jisuna miyamda Mapugi thougal touba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14–9:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">6. Galilee-dagi Jerusalem-da chattuna Mapugi thougal touba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 9:51-27">9:51–9:27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">7. Jisu-na thawai thadringei, aroiba chayolda Jerusalem amadi manak nakpa maphamsingda thokkhibasing <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28–23:56</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">8. Jisu-na sibadagi hinggatpa, miyamda uhanbiba amasung Ibungobu swargada loukhatkhiba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Nungsijaraba Theophilus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Eikhoigi irakta thunghanbikhraba thoudoksing adugi paodam adubu inanaba mioi kaya amana kanna hotnakhi. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Ahoubadagi houna thoudoksing asibu mamitmakna uhoubasing amasung Mapugi waheigi thougal toubasing aduna eikhoida phongdokpirambasing adu makhoina ikhi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Aduga, he ikai khumnaraba Theophilus, pumnamaksing adu eihakna ahoubadagi houna changkhonna thijillaba maramna, thoudoksing adu mathang manao naina nahakki naphamda iba phagani haina eihaknasu ningle. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Nangonda tambikhraba pumnamaksing adugi mapungphaba achumba adu nahakna khangnanaba eina masi naphamda ibani.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baptize toubiba John pokkadaba mangjounana phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Mi 24:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Herod-na Judea leibakki ningthou oina pallingei matamda, Abijah-gi purohit kanglupta Zechariah kouba purohit ama leirammmi. Mahakki nupigi maming Elijabeth kou-i; aduga Elizabeth-su purohit Aaron-gi charon suron oirammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Makhoi animakna Mapu Ibungogi yathangsing amadi pathap pumnamaksing mapungphana ngakchaduna Tengban Mapugi mityengda chumna chatchaba punsi mahing amada hinglammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Adubu makhoi macha amata leiramde maramdi Elizabeth chaboktabi oirammi aduga makhoi animak ahalsu yamna oirammi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Nongmagi numitta Zechariah-gi purohit kangbuna thougal toubagi palli taraduna mahakna Mapugi Sanglenda purohit ama oina Tengban Mapugi thougal tourammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Aduga latnapungda mengkruk thanaba purohitsinggi chatnabi matung inna changyengnabada mangonda tare. Maram aduna mahakna Mapu Ibungogi sanglen manungda changle. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Amasung mengkruk chukhatpagi pungpham aduda tilliba miyam aduna mapanda haija nijaduna leirammi.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Adudagi Mapu Ibungogi dut amana mengkruk thariba iratpung adugi yet thangbada leptuna mangonda uhanbirammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zechariah-na mahakpu ubada masada thukatpa amadi akiba phaorammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Adubu swarga dut aduna mangonda hairak-i, “Kiganu, Zechariah! Nahakna haijaba adu Tengban Mapuna tabire. Nahakki nupi Elizabeth-na nachanupa ama poklagani aduga nahakna mahakki maming John haina thongadabani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Mahak pokpa matamda nahakna kayada haraoba amadi nungaiba oigadaba! Amasung mi kayana kayada harao nungaiba oigadaba! <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Masing 6:3</ref></char></note>Maramdi Mapu Ibungogi mityengda mahak matik chaogani. Mahakna yu amadi mayai kaba mahi amata thakloi, aduga mama puknungdagi houna mahak Thawai Asengbana than-gani. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Amasung mahakna Israel macha kayabu makhoigi Tengban Mapu, Mapu Ibungoda hallak-han-gani. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:5">Mic 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MIC 4:6">6</ref></char></note>Mahakna Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpa maichou Elijah-gi machat amadi matikka loinana Ibungogi mang thana chatkani. Mahakna misingbu Ibungona lenglakkadaba adugidamak thourang langhannaba mapasingbu machasingga amuk yasinnahangani amasung haiba indabasingbu achumba chatpasinggi lousing aduda hongdokpigani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Adudagi Zechariah-na dut aduda hairak-i, “Masi soidana thokkani haibasi eihakna kamdouna khanggadage? Eidi ahal oiraba mini aduga eigi nupisu ahal oire.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda dut aduna khumlak-i, “Ei Grabriel-ni. Nangonda wa hainanaba amasung aphaba pao asibu tamnanaba eibu thabirakpa Tengban Mapugi mangda eina lepli. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Adubu achaba matamda soidanamak thoklagadaba eigi wasing asi nahakna thajade. Aduga nahakna thajadabagi maramna eina nangonda haikhibasing asi thoktriba numit adu phaoba nahak wa ngangba thokloi aduga wa amata ngangdana tumminna leigani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Cheirak aduda mising aduna Zechariah-bu mapanda ngaiduna leirammi amasung mahakna karigi Mapugi Sanglen manungda matam asuk kuina leiribano haina makhoi ngaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Amasung mahakna mapanda thorakpa matamda, mahakna makhoida wa ngangba ngamkhide. Aduga mahakna Mapugi Sanglen manungda uhanbiba ama ukhre haiba makhoina khanglammi, maramdi mahakna makhoida ingit touduna nganglammi adubu wa ngangbadi adumak ngamkhide.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Aduga Mapugi Sanglenda mahakki thougal toubagi numitsing adu loirabada Zachariah mayumda amuk halaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Matam kharagi matungda Elizabeth mironlaklammi aduga mahakna tha manga yumdagi mapan thoklamde. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Mahakna haikhi, “Houjik mameithangda Mapu Ibungona eibu pangbire. Miyam mangda eina ikaiba nanglamba adu Ibungona louthokpire!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu pokpagi maramda mangjounana phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elizabeth-na mironba tha taruk surakpada Tengban Mapuna swargadut Grabriel-bu Nazareth kouba Galilee-gi khungangda tharakle. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat 1:18</ref></char></note>Mahakna Mary haina koubi, David ningthougi chada-naoda oiriba Joseph kouba nupa amada luhongnaba waroinakhrabi leisabi asengbi amagi pao puduna laklammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Aduga dut aduna mangonda laktuna hairak-i, “Khurumjari, thoujal phanglabi! Mapu Ibungona nahakpu loinabiri; nupisinggi maraktagi nahakti yaipahabini.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maryna dut adugi wahei aduda yamna cha-ngaknarammi amasung mahakki waheising aduna kari phongdoklibano haiduna khallammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Maduda dut aduna hairak-i, “Kiganu Mary, Tengban Mapudagi nahakna thoujal phangjare. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat 1:21</ref></char></note>Nahakna mironduna nacha nupa ama pokkani aduga nahakna mahakki maming Jisu thongadabani. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32,33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Samu 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref></char></note>Mahak matik chaogani aduga Wangthoiraba Mapu Ibungogi machanupa kougani. Mapu Ibungo Tengban Mapuna mangonda mapa David-ki phambal adu pibigani, <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Aduga mahakna Jacob-ki chada-naodasinggi ningthou oina matam pumbagi oina pan-gani, amadi mahakki leibak adu lomba nairoi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Adudagi Mary-na dut aduda hairak-i, “Eihakti luhongdribi leisabini, adu oirabadi masi kamdouna oithokkadouribano?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Dut aduna khumlak-i, “Thawai Asengbana nahakki nathakta lengthabirakkani aduga Wangthoiraba Ibungo adugi panggalna nahakpu lumsinbigani. Maram asina pokkadouriba asengba angang adubu Tengban Mapugi Machanupa kougani. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Yengu, nahakki mari mata Elizabeth-su ahal oiraklaba matamsida macha ama phangjagadoure, chaboktabi hainarambi mahakna houjikti tha tarukki angang naopure. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Meihou 18:14</ref></char></note>Maramdi Tengban Mapugi maphamda oithoktaba kari amata leite.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maduda Mary-na hairak-i, “Eihak Mapu Ibungogi manainupini; nahakna haikhibagum masi eingongda thokpa oirasanu.” Adudagi dut adu mahakpu thadoktuna chatkhre.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maryna Elizabeth-ki manakta chatpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Madugi matung ikui kuidana Mary-na thourang touraduna chinggi lamdamda leiba, Judea-gi apikpa sahar amada thuna chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Amasung mahakna Zechariah-gi yumda changduna Elizabeth-pu khurumjarammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Aduga Mary-na khurumjabagi khonjel adu Elizabeth-na tabada mahakki pibuknungda angang aduna chonglammi. Amasung Elizabeth Thawai Asengbana thallammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Aduga mahakna khonjel wangna hairak-i, “Nupilaktagi nahakti khwaidagi henna yaiphabini, amasung nahakna naopugadouriba angang adu yaiphabani! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Eigi Ibungogi imana eigi inakta lengbiraktuna eibu asuk ekai khumnabiriba asi karamnano? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Maramdi nahakna khurumjabagi khonjel adu eina hek tabaga eigi pibuknunggi angang asina haraoduna chongkhatli. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Mapu Ibungona mahakki maphamda haikhrabasing adu thunghanbigani haina thajaribi mahak adu yaiphabini!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mary-gi thagat isei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Samu 2:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maduda Maryna hairak-i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Eigi thawaina Mapu Ibungobu thagatchei,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Eigi thawaina eigi Kanbiba Mapu, Tengban Mapuda haraojei,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Maramdi mahakna tollabi manainupi eihakpu ningsingbire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Houjiktagi houduna miron khudingna kougani eibu yaiphabi;<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Maramdi toubire Pangallaba mahakna, eigidamak achouba thabak kaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Ibungo mahakki minglendi asengbani;<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Mahakpu kina chatchabasingda, utpi mahakna chanbiba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">miron miron khudingda.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Toubire mahakki pambomna, matik leiba thabak kaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">aduga chaikhaire mahakna, mathamoida napal touba misingbu.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char>
    </note>Chingthakhi mahakna matik leiba ningthousingbu makhoigi ningthou phambaldagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">aduga thanggatpikhi mahakna nollukpasingbu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Thalhanbikhi mahakna aram-khourangbasingbu aphabana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">adubu thakhi inakhunbasingbu khut hangna.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Ngakkhi mahakna sakkhiba washaktu, eikhoigi ipa-ipusingda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">aduga lakkhi pangbinaba mahakki manai Israel-bu.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Meihou 17:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ningsingbikhi mahakna, matam pumnamakta chanbiba utpigani haibadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Abraham amadi mahakki charon suronsingda!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Adudagi Mary-na tha ahummuk Elizabeth-ka leiminnaramlaga mayumda hankhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baptize toubiba John pokpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elizabeth-ki angang unabagi matam oiraklabada, mahakna machanupa ama pokkhi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Aduga mahakki keirol-leikaisingna amadi mari-matasingna Mapu Ibungona mahakpu kayada chanbibage haibadu tare amasung makhoi pumnamakna mahakka loinana haraominare.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levi 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Angang aduna numit nipanni subada makhoina mahakpu un kakpa lakle, amasung makhoina angang adubu mapagi maming louduna Zechariah thonnaba tourammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Adubu Elizabeth-na makhoida haikhi, “Natte, mahakki maming John haina thongadabani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Maduda makhoina mangonda hairak-i, “Nakhoigi sagei natei marakta ming adu kouba mi amatasu yaode.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Adudagi makhoina angang adugi mapa Zechariah-da ingit touduna, mahakna angang adugi maming kari thonba pambage haiduna hanglammi.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Maduda mahakna mangonda inanaba korbak ama pinaba hairammi, aduga maduda mahakna “Mahakki maming John kou-i” haina ire. Maduda makhoi pumnamak pumngak ngakle. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Khudak adumaktada Zechariah amuk hanna wa ngangba ngamle aduga mahakna Tengban Mapubu thagatchaba houre. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Aduga thokkhibasing asina maram oiduna mahakki keirol-leikai pumnamak akibana thallammi, amasung thoudok pumnamak asigi paona Judah-gi chinggi lamdam adu sinba thungna sandokkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Amasung pao adu taba mi khudingmakna, madugi maramda wakhal touraduna hanglak-i, “Angang asina kari oirakkadaba?” Maramdi Mapu Ibungogi pangalna mahakki mathakta lei haiba makhoina khanglammi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zechariah-na Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Amasung John-gi mapa Zechariah Thawai Asengbana thallammi aduga mahakna Tengban Mapugi wa phongdoktuna hairak-i:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Eikhoina Israel-gi Tengban Mapu, Mapu Ibungobu thagatlasi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Mahakna mahakki misingbu pangbinaba lakle amasung makhoibu handokpire!<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Mahakna mahakki manai David-ki charon surondagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">Pinabire eikhoigidamak matik leiba Kanbiba Mapu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek-ki ariba lairikta aran-khubhamgi machi haina i.</char></note> ama.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Mahakna mamangngeida mahakki wa phongdokpiba asengba maichousingi mapanna washakpikhi,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Kanbigani haina Mahakna, eikhoibu eikhoigi yeknabasingdagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">amadi eikhoibu yengthiba pumnamakki makhuttagi.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Haibikhi mahakna eikhoigi ipa ipusingda, chanbiba utpigani haina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">aduga mahakki asengba warepnaba adu mahakna ningsingbikhi.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Wasakpikhi mahakna Ipa Abraham-da,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>Kanbigani haina Mahakna eikhoibu yeknabasingi makhuttagi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">aduga ngamhanbigani haina eikhoibu akiba leitana mahakpu thouganjaba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Punsi chuppa eikhoina Mahakki mangda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">asengba amadi achumba chatpa oinaba.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mic 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga, eigi ichanupa, nahakpu wangthoiraba Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou haina kougani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Ibungogi lambi thourang tounaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Chatkani nahakna Ibungogi mang thaduna.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Ibungogi misingda hainanaba, makhoigi papsingdu kokpibagi mapanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">Makhoibu kanbigani haina.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Maramdi eikhoigi Tengban Mapudi chanbiheibani amadi nungsiheibani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Thok-hanbigani Mahakna, aran-khubamgi langlaba ayukki korou mangal adu eikhoida.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ngalhannanaba korouthaktagi, asibagi mamlaba mamida leiriba pumnamakki mathakta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">Chingbinanaba eikhoigi khongthangbu, ingthabagi lambida.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Adudagi angang adu hakchang amadi thawaida chaokhatlaklammi. Aduga mahakna masabu Israel-gi miyamda phongdoktringeigi matam adu phaoba lamjao lamhangda leirammi.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu pokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Matam aduda Rome-na panba leibak punamakta mikok thinabagidamak Caesar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rome gi Ningthourel</char></note> Augustus-na yathang ama thokkhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Masigi ahanba mikok thiba asi Quirinius-na Syria-gi leingak mapu oiringei matamda thokkhibani. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Matam aduda mipum khudingmakna masa masagi hourakpham saharda maming ikhatnaba chatnarammi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Aduga Joseph-su David ningthougi charon-suron oiba maramna Galilee-gi Nazareth sahar thadoktuna Judea-da leiba David ningthougi sahar Bethlehemda chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Amasung mahakka luhongnabagidamak waroinakhrabi Mary-ga loinana mahakna mapham aduda ming ikhatnabagidmak chatminnarammi. Mary mirollibini. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Aduga makhoina Bethlehem-da leiringeida Mary-gi angang unabagi matam adu yousillakle. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Aduga mahakna mahakki ahanba machanupa ama pokle. Amasung mahakna angang adubu phina yomsinbiraga sabam amada hiphallammi, maramdi makhoina mithungsang aduda leinanaba mapham amata phanglamde.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaosenba amasung Swargadutsing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Lamdam adumaktada yaosenba kharana ahing aduda loubuk lamhangsingda makhoigi yao sanggusing sennaduna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Adudagi ikhang khanghoudana Mapu Ibungogi dut amana makhoigi mamangda thoraklammi amasung Mapu Ibungogi matik mangalna makhoigi akoibada ngallammi. Maduda makhoi adukki matik kirammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Adubu swarga dut aduna makhoida hairak-i, “Kiganu! Eina mi pumnamakki oigadaba yamna harao nungngaibagi aphaba pao nakhoida purakli. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Ngasigi numitta David-ki saharda nakhoigi kanbiba mapu pokle; mahakti Ibungo Christtani. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Aduga khudam asigi mapanna nakhoina mahakpu khanggani; madudi phina yomsillaba angang ama sabamda hiplamba nakhoina thengnagani.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Aduga ikhang khanghoudana swarga dut aduga loinana masing yamlaba swarga dut kanglup ama thoraktuna Tengban Mapubu thagatladuna hairak-i,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Oirare wangthoiraba swargada, Tengban Mapugi maphamda matik mangal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">aduga pibire malemda, magi apenba oiriba misinggi mathakta ingthaba!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Adudagi swarga dutsing aduna makhoibu thadoktuna swargada amuk kakhrabada, makhoi masel amaga amaga hainarak-i, “Houjik eikhoina Bethlehem-da chattuna Mapu Ibungona eikhoida hairamba thokkhraba thoudok adu yenglusi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Adudagi makhoina thunamak lakle amasung Mary amadi Joseph-pu phangjaduna sabamda hipliba angang adubu uba phangjare. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Amasung yao senbasing aduna angang adubu uraba matungda swarga dut aduna angang adugi maramda hairambasing adu Mary amadi Joseph-ta tamle. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Aduga yaosenbasing aduna tambadu tabada tariba pumnamak ingak ngakkhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Adubu Mary-nadi masi pumnamaksing asi ningsingjadunata leijakhi amasung thoudoksing adugi maramda munna wakhal toujakhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Aduga yaosenbasing aduna makhoida hairamba aduga chap mannana, makhoina takhiba amadi ukhiba pumnamaksing adugidamak Tengban Mapubu matik mangal pijaduna amadi thagatchaduna hankhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi ming thonba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levi 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref></char>
    </note>Numit nipanni subada, angang adugi un kakpa matam laklabada, mahakna pibuknungda mitamdringei mamangda swarga dut aduna thollambagumna mahakki maming Jisu haina tholle.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu Mapugi Sanglenda pukhatpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Adudagi Moses-ki wayel yathang matung-inna makhoigi sengdokpagi thouram pangthoknaba matam adu laklammi. Aduga Joseph amadi Mary-na Jisubu Mapu Ibungoda katchanabagidamak Jerusalem-da puraklammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Khong 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note>Madu Mapu Ibungogi wayel yathangda ikhiba, “Ahanba pokpa machanupa khudingmak MAPU IBUNGO<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehovah</char></note>-gidamak tonganna khaidoktuna thamjagadabani” haiba adugi matung-innani. <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Aduga makhoina Mapu Ibungogi wayel yathang matung-inna lamkhunu pungba ama nattraga khunu macha ani iratpot oina katnanabagidamaktasu chatlammi.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Matam aduda Simeon kouba achumba chatpa, Mapu Ibungobu chetna ningjaba nupa ama Jerusalem-da leirammi. Mahakna Israel-bu kanbigadaba adubu khourangna ngaijaduna leirammi. Aduga Thawai Asengbana mahakka loinarammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Amasung Mapu Ibungona wasakpikhraba Christta adubu udriba phaoba mahak siroi haiduna Thawai Asengbana mangonda phongdokpirammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Adudagi Thawaina chingduna Simeon-na Mapugi Sanglenda laklammi. Amasung Mary amadi Joseph-na angang oiriba Jisubu wayel yathanggi matung inna mahakkidamak toupham thokpasing adu tounanabagidamak Mapugi Sanglenda purakpa matamda, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeon-na mahakpu pamladuna Tengban Mapubu thagatcharak-i:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Mapu Ibungo, nahakna wasakpikhibagi matung-inna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">Houjikti, nanai eihakpu nahakna ingthana thadokpire.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Maramdi eigi imit makna nahakki aran-khubham adu ujare,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Nahakna madu mi pumnamakki mamangda thourang toubire:<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char>
    </note>Jihudi nattaba phurupsingda nahakki aningba phongdoknaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">amadi nahakki mi Israel-gi maphamda matik ma-ngal puraknaba ma-ngal ama.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Ibungogi maramda Simeon-na hairibasing asi tabada Ibungogi mapa amadi mama ngaktuna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Adudagi Simeon-na makhoibu yaipha-thoujal pibiraduna Ibungogi mama Mary-da hairak-i, “Angang asi Israel-gi mi kaya amabu tuhannaba aduga kaya amabuna hougat-hannaba Tengban Mapuna khandokkhrabani. Aduga mahak mi kaya amana maiyokta nganggadaba Tengban Mapudagi lakpa khudam ama oigani. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Masi mi kayagi thamoigi wa adu phongdoknabani. Aduga awabana, thouraba thangsanggi matougumna nasamakki thamoida thin-gani.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Aduga Anna koubi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpi amasu Mapugi Sanglenda leirammi. Mahak Asher salaigi Phanuel-gi machanupini amasung mahak yamna ahal oirammi. Mahakki mapuroiba adu luhonglaba matung chahi taretkhak mahakka leiminnaramlga sikhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Adudagi mahakna masagi chahi mariphumari suba phaoba lukhrabi ama oina leirammi. Mahakna Mapugi Sanglenbu keidounungda thadoklamde adubu mahakna ahing nungthil animakta Tengban Mapubu khurumjaduna, chara henduna amadi haijaduna mapham aduda leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Aduga pungpham adumaktada mahaksu laktuna Tengban Mapubu thagatcharammi amasung Jerusalem-bu handokpiba ngaijariba makhoi pumnamakki maphamda angang asigi maramda wa nganglammi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nazareth-ta halakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat 2:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga Joseph amasung Mary-na Mapu Ibungogi wayel yathanggi matung-inna toupham thokpa pumnamak pangthokpa loiraba matungda makhoina Galilee-da leiba masamakki apikpa sahar Nazareth-ta halaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Amasung angang adu asum chaokhatlaklammi amasung pangal kallaklammi. Mahak lousingna thallammi aduga Tengban Mapugi thoujalna mahakki mathakta leirammi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Mapugi Sanglenda leithahouba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Khong 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Aniwa 16:1-8</ref></char>
    </note>Aduga chahi khudinggi Ibungogi mama-mapana lanthokpibagi chakkhangba kumheigidamak Jerusalem-da chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Amasung Ibungona chahi taranithoi suba matamda mahousagumna Jerusalem-da chakkhangba yaoba chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Adudagi makhoina lanthokpibagi chakkhangba kumhei loiduna yumda hallabada, angang oiriba Jisudi Jerusalem-da leithahourammi. Adubu Ibungogi mama mapanadi madu khanglamde. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Adudagi makhoina Ibungobu makhoiga chatminnariba khongloising adugi marakta yaoramgani haina khanduna numit chuppa chatlaba tungda makhoina Ibungobu mari-matasinggi marakta amadi marup-mapangsinggi marakta thiba hourammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Aduga makhoina Ibunggobu thiba phangdrabada mahakpu thinabagidamak Jerusalem-da amuk hallammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Amasung numit humnigi matungda makhoina mahakpu Mapugi Sanglenda Jihudi ojasinggi marakta phamduna makhoina ngangba taduna amadi mahakna makhoida wahang hangduna leiramba adu thengnare. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Amasung Ibungona ngangba tariba makhoi pumnamakna mahakki lousing amadi paokhum aduda ingak-ngaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Aduga Ibungogi mama mapana Ibungobu uba matamda ingak-ngaklammi, amasung Ibungogi mamana Ibungoda hairak-i, “Icha-nupa, nahakna eikhoida asumna touribasi karigino? Napaga eigana kayada pukning wana nahakpu thirakli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Maduda Ibungona khumlak-i, “Nakhoina eibu karigidamak thiribano? Eina eigi Ipagi yumda leipham thok-i haiba nakhoina khangdabra?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Adubu Ibungona makhoida hairiba adu karino haiba makhoina khangba ngamkhide.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Adudagi Jisuna mama mapaga loinana Nazareth-ta hallaklammi amasung mahakna makhoina haiba illammi. Aduga Ibungogi mamana thokhiba pumnamaksing adu mathamoida lengdana thamjarammi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Samu 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Pao 3:4</ref></char></note>Amasung Jisuna hakchang amadi lousing animakta chaokhatlaklammi amadi Tengban Mapu amadi misingdagi chanbiba phangjarammi.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Baptize toubiba John-na Ibungogi lambi thourang touba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Caesar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rome gi Ningthourel</char></note> Tiberius-na panba chahi taramangasuba chahida Pontius Pilate-na Judea-gi leingak mapu, Herodna Galilee-gi leingakpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tetrarch: Lam amagi saruk mari thokpagi amagi leingakpa.</char></note> amasung manaonupa Philipna Iturea amadi Trachonitis-ki leingakpa; Lysanias-na Abilene-gi leingakpa, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Amasung Annas amadi Caiaphas-na athoiba purohitlen oiringeida lamjao-lamhangda leiriba Zechariah-gi machanupa John-gi maphamda Tengban Mapuna wa ngangbirammi. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Maram aduna pap kokchanabagidamak pukning hongbagi baptize lounabagi pao miyamda sandoktuna John-na Jordan turelgi akoibada leiba lam pumnamakta chatlammi.<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40:3-5</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Masi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou Isaiah-gi lairikta ikhibagumbani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Kanagumba amana lamjao-lamhangda laori:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘MAPU IBUNGO-gi lambi thourang tou;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Ibungona chatnaba lambi chumhallu!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Tampak khudingmak thongatkani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Ching amadi chingjao khudingmakpu temthokkani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Akhoiba lambisingbu chumhangani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Akut atong leiba lambisingbu nalhangani.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Aduga mi pumnamakna Tengban Mapugi aran-khubham uba phangjagani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi mangonda baptize touhannaba lakliba miyam aduda John-na hairak-i, “He lilgi chada naodasa, lakkadouriba Tengban Mapugi asaoba adudagi chennaba nakhoida kanana haibage? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jn 8:33</ref></char></note>Nakhoina paptagi pukning hongbagi matik chaba mahei yallu. Aduga ‘Eikhoigi ipa Abraham lei’ haina nakhoigi napukningda haijaganu. Maramdi, eina nakhoida hairi madudi nungsing asidagisu Tengban Mapuna Abraham-gi machasing thokhanba ngammi. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref></char></note>Houjiksu upalsing asigi maruda singjang thaduna lei amasung aphaba mahei pandaba upal pumnamakpu kakthattuna meinungda langsingani.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Maduda miyam aduna John-da hanglak-i, “Adu oirabadi eikhoina kari tougadage?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Mahakna makhoida khumlak-i, “Phurit ani leiba mahak aduna amata phaoba leijadaba mahak aduda ama pisanu aduga chananaba chinjak leiba mahak adunasu matou adugumna tousanu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk 7:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adudagi kanggat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khajna </char></note> khomba kharasu baptize lounaba laklammi amasung makhoina Johnda hanglak-i, “Oja Ibungo, Eikhoina kari tougadage?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Mahakna makhoida khumlak-i, “Loupham thokpa adudagi henna nakhoina louganu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Adudagi lanmi kharanasu mangonda hanglak-i, “Aduga eikhoinadi kari tougadage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Mahakna makhoida khumlak-i, “Mi kanadagisu nam-haduna sel louganu aduga kanadasu aranba maral thangjinganu. Amasung nanggi nanggi asuman aduda apenba oiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Aduga mi pumnamakna Christtana lakkadaba adu ngaiduna leiba maramna John-bu Christta adu oigadara haina makhoigi thamoinungda hangjarammi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Maram aduna John-na makhoi pumnamakta hairak-i, “Einadi nakhoibu isingda baptize toubi, adubu eingondagi henna matik leiba kanagumba ama lenglakli aduga eidi Ibungo magi sandal mari louthokpa phaoba matik chade. Mahaknadi nakhoibu Thawai Asengbada amasung meida baptize toubigani. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Ibungona mahei marong yeipham adu sengdoktuna gehusing adubu keida peisinnaba makhutta mahakki phou-inthok paiduna leiri; adubu mahakna mahamsing adubudi mutpa naidaba meida thajingani.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Aduga John-na khetnaba mawong matou kaya amada mising aduda Aphaba Pao sandoklammi amasung makhoigi lambi adu hongdoknaba thougatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19,20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mrk 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char></note>Adubu mahakna Galilee-gi leingakpa Herod-pu manaonupa Philip-ki nupi Herodias-pu loubagidamak amasung mahakna toukhiba phattaba thabak pumnamak adugidamak cheirammi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Aduga Herod-na John-bu keisumsangda thamjinduna amukka henna tamthiba pap langsinjarammi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu baptize touba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Nongma John-na miyam amabu baptize touringei matamda Jisubusu baptize tourammi. Aduga Ibungona haijaringeida swarga hangdoktuna, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Meihou 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Isei 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char></note> Thawai Asengbana hakchang oina khunugi mawongda Ibungogi mathakta lengtharaklammi. Aduga swargadagi khonjel amana hairak-i, “Nahak eigi nungsijaraba Ichanupani, eina nangonda yamna pelle.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi pari puri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-7">Mat 1:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Jisuna thougal touba hourakpa matamda masagi chahi kunthramuk surammi. Ibungodi, misingna khanbagum Joseph-ki machanupani. Joseph-ti Heli-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Heli-di Matthat-ki machanupani, Matthat-na Levi-gi machanupani, Levi-na Melki-gi machanupani. Melki-na Jannai-gi machanupani, Jannai-na Joseph-ki machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Joseph-na Mattathias-ki machanupani, Mattathias-na Amos-ki machanupani, Amos-na Nahum-gi machanupani, Nahum-na Esli-gi machanupani, Esli-na Naggai-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Naggai-na Maath-ki machanupani, Maath-na Mattathias-ki machanupani, Mattathias-na Semein-gi machanupani, Semein-na Josech-ki machanupani. Josech-na Joda-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Joda-na Joanan-gi machanupani, Joanan-na Rhesa-gi machanupani, Rhesa-na Zerubbabel-gi machanupani, Zerubbabel-na Shealtiel machanupani, Shealtiel-na Neri-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri-na Melki-gi machanupani, Melki-na Addi-gi machanupani, Addi-na Cosam-gi machanupani, Cosam-na Elmadam-gi machanupani, Elmadam-na Er-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Er-na Joshua-gi machanupani, Joshua-na Eliezer-gi machanupani, Eliezer-na Jorim-gi machanupani, Jorim-na Matthat-ki machanupani, Matthat-na Levi-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Levi-na Simeon-gi machanupani, Simeon-na Judah-gi machanupani, Judah-na Joseph-ki machanupani, Joseph-na Jonam-gi machanupani, Jonam-na Eliakim-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakim-na Melea-gi machanupani, Melea-na Menna-gi machanupani, Menna-na Mattatha-gi machanupani, Mattatha-na Nathan-gi machanupani, Nathan-na David-ki machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>David-na Jesse-gi machanupani, Jesse-na Obed-ki machanupani, Obed-na Boaz-ki machanupani, Boaz-na Salmon-gi machanupani, Salmon-na Nahshon-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashon-na Amminadab-ki machanupani, Amminadab-na Admin-gi machanupani, Admin-na Arni-gi machanupani, Arni-na Hezron-gi machanupani, Hezron-na Perez-ki machanupani, Perez-na Judah-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Judah-na Jacob-ki machanupani, Jacob-na Isaac-ki machanupani, Isaac-na Abraham-gi machanupani, Abraham-na Terah-gi machanupani, Terah-na Nahor-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahor-na Serug-ki machanupani, Serug-na Reu-gi machanupani, Reu-na Peleg-ki machanupani, Peleg-na Eber-gi machanupani, Eber-na Shelah-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Shelah-na Cainan-gi machanupani, Cainan-na Arphaxad-ki machanupani, Arphaxad-na Shem-gi machanupani, Shem-na Noah-gi machanupani, Noah-na Lamech-ki machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lamech-na Methuselah-gi machanupani, Methuselah-na Enoch-ki machanupani, Enoch-na Jared-ki machanupani, Jared-na Mahalaleel-gi machanupani, Mahalaleel-na Kenan-gi machanupani. <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenan-na Enosh-ki machanupani, Enosh-na Seth-ki machanupani, Seth-na Adam-gi machanupani, Adam-na Tengban Mapugi machanupani.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu themba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mrk 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Adudagi Jisu Thawai Asengbana thalladuna Jordan-dagi hallakle amasung Thawai Asengbana mahakpu lamjao-lamhangda chingbirammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Aduga mapham aduda Devil-na<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satangi atoppa mamingni.</char></note> Ibungobu numit niphuni themkhi. Numitsing aduda Ibungona karigumba amata charamde amasung numitsing adu loirabada Ibungo mabuk lamlaklammi.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Adudagi Devil-na Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahakna Tengban Mapugi machanupa oirabadi nung asida tal ollu haina yathang piyu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Aniwa 8:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adubu Jisuna mangonda khumlak-i, “Mapugi puyada masi iduna lei, ‘Tal khaktagi mapanna mioibana hingloi, adubu Tengban Mapugi wahei khudinggi mapanna hinggani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Adudagi Devilna Ibungobu awangba chingthak amada pukhattuna mikup amada taibangpanbagi ningthou leibak pumnamakpu uhalle. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Aduga mahakna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Eina nangonda pumnamak asigi mathakta panbagi matik amadi masigi matik mangal pumnamak nangonda pigani; maramdi masi eingonda sinnakhrabani aduga eina pamba kanagumba amada masi amuk piba ngammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Karigumba nangna eibu khurumlabadi pumnamaksing asi nahakkini.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Aniwa 6:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Mapugi puyada masi iduna lei, ‘Nangna nanggi Tengban Mapu, MAPU IBUNGO mahak khaktabu khurumjagadabani amadi thouganjagadabani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Adudagi devilna Ibungobu Jerusalem-da puraduna Mapugi Sanglen matonda lephallaga Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahakna Tengban Mapugi macha oirabadi mapham asidagi chongthajou. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Maramdi Mapugi puyada masi iduna lei, ‘Nahakpu ngak-senbinabagidamak Tengban Mapuna mahakki swargadutsingda yathang pigani, <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Aduga nahakki khongna nungda yeisindanaba makhoina nahakpu pamkhatpigani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Aniwa 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maduda Jisuna mangonda khumlak-i, “Mapugi puyada asumna hai, ‘Nahakna nahakki Tengban Mapu, Mapu Ibungobu changyengpharoi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Adudagi Devilna Jisubu themba pumnamak loirabada mathanggi khudongchaba laktriba phaoba Jisubu thadoktuna chatkhre.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Galileeda mahakki thougal houba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrk 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Adudagi Jisuna Thawai Asengbagi panggalga loinana Galilee-da halaklammi. Aduga Ibungogi paona lam sinbathungna sangdokkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Ibungona synagogue-singda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jihudisinggi Mapu Ibungobu khurumpham, wayenpham amasung wayel yathang tambipham </char></note> tambirammi amasung mipum khudingmakna mahakpu thagatlammi.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nazareth-ta Jisubu yadaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakki hourakpham Nazareth-ta lakle. Aduga mahousagum mahakna Potthaba Numitta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabbath numit </char></note> synagogue-ta chatlammi amasung Mapugi puya pananaba lepkhatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Amasung Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou Isaiahgi lairik makol adu Ibungoda pirabada mahakna hangdoktuna parak-i,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18,19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“MAPU IBUNGO-gi Thawaina ithakta leibirare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Maramdi lairabasingda Aphaba Pao sandoknabagidamak mahakna eibu khandokpire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Thamoi kairabasingbu phahannaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Lanpha oirabasingda ningtamba laothoknanaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mit tangbasingbu uhanbinaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Otpi neibiba phanglabasingbu maning tamhannaba,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Aduga MAPU IBUNGO<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehovah</char></note>na mahakki misingbu kanbinaba matam adu lakle haina laothoknaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">Mahakna eibu thabire.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Adudagi Jisuna lairik makol adu konsilladuna thougal touriba nupa aduda amuk piraga phamtharammi. Amasung synagogue aduda leiriba mi pumnamakna Ibungoda pukning changna yenglammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Aduga Ibungona makhoida haiba hourak-i, “Nakhoina houjik takhraba Mapugi puyagi wahei adu ngasidi achumba oina thoklare.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Aduga mi pumnamakna Ibungogi maramda thagatnaduna ngangnarammi amasung Ibungogi chinbaldagi thorakpa thoujalgi waheising adu tabada makhoi ngaklammi. Amasung makhoina hainarak-i, “Mahak asibu Josephki machanupa nattra?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina eingonda soidana paorou asi haigani, ‘Laiyengba mi, nahak nasabu phahallu! Aduga Capernaum-da nahakna toukhi haina eikhoina takhibasing adu nahakki naramdam asidasu tou.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char></note>Ibungona makha tana hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingbu keidoungeida masagi maramdamda lousinbide.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Ning 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Adubu yeng-u, achumba adu eina hairi, Elijah-gi matamda chahi ahum makhai nongdon atiya thingkhiduna leibak pumnamakta achouba chak tangba thokpa matamda Israelda lukhrabi mayam ama leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Ning 17:8-16</ref></char></note>Adumakpu makhoi kana amatagi manakta Elijah-bu thakhide adubu Sidon lamdamgi Zarephath-ta leibi lukhrabi amagi manakta thabikhi. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Ning 5:1-14</ref></char></note>Aduga Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou Elisha-gi matamda Israel lamdamda kiningngai oiba unsagi lainana naba mi kaya ama leirabasu makhoi kana amatabu phahanbikhide adubu Syria-gi Naaman khaktabu phahanbikhi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Madu tabada synagogue aduda leiriba mi pumnamak mei houna saorammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Amasung makhoina hougattuna Ibungobu sahar adudagi chingthoktuna chingcheptagi hunthanabagidamak sahar adu leiriba ching adugi chingdonda purakle. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Adubu Ibungona miyam adugi marakmaktada phaoraduna chatkhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Phattaba Thawai tanthokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Adudagi Jisuna Galilee-gi Capernaum-da chatlammi amasung potthaba numitsingda miyamda tambirammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note>Aduga Ibungogi tambiba matou aduda makhoi pumnmak ingak ngaklammi maramdi Ibungona matik leina nganglammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Matamduda synagogue aduda phattaba thawai changba nupa ama leirammi. Aduga mahakna khonjel houna laorak-i, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“He Nazareth-ki Jisu, eikhoiga nangga kari mari leinabage? Nahak eikhoibu mang-hannaba mapham asida laklibra? Nahak kanano haiba ei khang-i: nahak Tengban Mapuna thabirakpa Asengba Mahak aduni.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Maduda Jisuna thawai aduda yathang pirammi, “Tumin leiyu aduga mangondagi thokkhro.” Adudagi lai phattaba aduna nupa adubu makhoi pumnamakki mamangmaktada inthuramlaga karisu sokhanba touramdana mangondagi mapan thokkhre.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Maduda mi pumnamak ngakladuna makhoi masel amaga amaga hainarak-i, “Nupa asigi waheising asi kayada matik amadi panggal leiriba! Phattaba thawai phaobana mahakna haiba illi aduga mahakki yathang tabada chelli.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Amasung Ibungogi paona akoibada leiba mapham khudingmakta sandokkhre.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna anabasingbu phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mrk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Adudagi Jisuna synagogue adu thadoktuna Simon-gi yumda chatlammi. Matam aduda Simon-gi manembok arum kanna houduna leirammi amasung makhoina Ibungoda mahakki anaba adubu phahanbinaba haijarammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Maduda Jisuna mahakki manakta nontharaduna mahakpu thadoktuna chatkhinanaba arum aduda yathang pikhi. Amasung maduda arum houramba adu phajaduna mahakna khudak aduda hougatlaga makhoibu thougal toujare.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Numit tasillaklabada misingna makhal makha kayagi lainana naraba anaba kaya amabu Jisugi manakta purakle. Amasung Ibungona makhoi khudingmakki mathakta khut thambiraduna anaba pumnamakpu phahanbirammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Adugisu mathakta, mioi kaya amadagi lai phattabasing aduna “Nahakti Tengban Mapugi Machanupa Christa aduni” haina laoramlaga thokkhirammi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Adubu Jisuna lai phattabasing aduda cheiraduna makhoibu wa nganghallamde, maramdi makhoina Ibungobu Christani haiba khanglammi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Synagogue-singda pao sandokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mrk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Nongngallabada Jisuna mapham adu thadoktuna achikpa mapham amada chatlammi. Aduga miyam aduna Ibungobu thiba hourammi amasung makhoina Ibungobu thengnarabada makhoibu thadoktuna chatkhidanaba kanna hotnarammi. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Adubu Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Eihakna Tengban Mapugi leibakki Aphaba Pao adu atoppa saharsingdasu sandokpa tai, maramdi thabak adugidamak eihakpu tharakpani.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Asum touna Ibungona leibak adu sinba thungna synagogue synagogue-singda pao sandoklammi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mahakki ahanba Tung-inbasingbu kouba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mrk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mat 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mrk 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nongma Jisuna Gennesaret-ki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galilee patki atoppa maming ama.</char></note> pat mapanda pao sandoklammi. Amasung yamlaba miyam amana Tengban Mapugi wa tananaba Ibungogi manak tanna changsinnanaba innarammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Matamduda pat mapan aduda hi anikhak thangduna leiba Ibungona ure aduga nga phabasing aduna hising adudagi khumthaduna makhoigi insing adu chamduna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Ibungona hi adugi maraktagi amada haibadi Simon-gi hida tongduna Simon-da hi adu pat mapan adudagi khajiktang inthoknaba hairammi. Adudagi Ibungona hi aduda phamduna miyam adubu tambirammi.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Amasung Ibungona ngangba loirabada Simon-da hairak-i, “Houjik hi asi aruba maphamda hondoktuna nga khara phananaba nakhoina insing adu hunlu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Maduda Simonna khumlak-i, “Eikhoina ahing chuppa kanna hotnajarabani adubu nga amata phaba ngamdre. Adumakpu Ibungona asumna takpirabanina eina in amuk hunjage.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Adudagi makhoina in hunlammi amasung yamlaba ngayam ama phare. Aduga ngasing adu yammankhibana makhoigi in adu segaiba houre. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Maram aduna makhoina atoppa hisingda leiriba nga phaminnabasing adubu khut khatladuna mateng pangbinaba kourammi. Aduga makhoina laktuna ngasing adubu hi ani adu pik thanna hapminnare amasung ngasing adu yammankhibana hising adu lupthaba houraklammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Madu ubada Simon Peter-na Jisugi khuyada tuthajaduna hairak-i, “He Ibungo, eingondagi chatthokpikhro, maramdi eihak pap chellaba mini!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Maramdi makhoina pharakliba yamlaba ngasing adugi maramna Simon amadi mahakka loinaribasing adu yamna ngaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Matou adugumna Simon-gi mapang Zebedee-gi machanupa Jacob amasung Johnsu ingak ngaklammi. Adudagi Jisuna Simon-da hairak-i, “Kiganu, houjiktagi houna nahakna mising pharagani.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Amasung makhoina makhoigi hisingdu kangphalda chingkhatladuna, pumnamak thadoklamlaga Ibungogi tung injare.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna kiningai oiba unsagi lainana naba Nupa mabu phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Adudagi Jisuna sahar amada leiringeida kiningai oiba unsagi lainana naba nupa ama laklammi. Nupa aduna Jisubu ubada leimaida tuthajaraduna haijarak-i, “Ibungo, nahakna yabirabadi, nahakna eibu seng-hanbiba ngammi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Maduda Ibungona khut tingthokladuna mahakpu soklaga hairak-i, “Eina yare, nahak sengjaro.” Khudak aduda nupa adudagi anaba adu phakhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Adudagi Jisuna nupa aduda yathang piraduna hairak-i, “Nahakna masi mi kanadasu haiganu, adubu chatuna nasabu purohitta utcharu, aduga nahak phajare haibadu pumnamakna sakhi oinaba Moses-na yathang pikhiba matung-inna iratpot adu katcharu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Adumakpu Ibungogi pao adu hennadum henna pak-sanna sandokkhirammi amasung yamlaba miyamna Ibungona pao sandokpa adu tananaba amadi makhoigi lainasing adu phahanbinaba Ibungogi manakta laklammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Adubu Ibungona tattana theidoktuna achikpa maphamsingda chattuna haijarammi.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna pangtha sithabagi leinana naba Nupa mabu phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mrk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Nongma Jisuna tambiringeida Galilee amadi Judea-gi khul khudingdagi aduga Jerusalem-dagi lakpa Pharisee-sing amadi Wayel Yathanggi ojasingna manakta phamduna leirammmi. Aduga Ibungoda anaba phahannaba Mapu Ibungogi panggal adu leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Adudagi mi kharana pangtha-sithabagi lainana naba nupa amabu hipnaphamda hiphalladuna puraklammi amasung makhoina anaba adubu Ibungogi mangda thamnabagidamak imungda pusinnaba hotnarammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Adubu miyam adugi maramna mahakpu imungda pusinnabagi lambi leiramde. Maram aduna makhoina yumthakta kakhattuna yumthak adu phaktoklaga mahakpu hipnapham aduga loinana miyamdugi marak Jisugi mamangmaktada tapna tapna thadharaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Makhoigi thajaba adu Ibungona urabada nupa aduda hairak-i, “Nupa, Nahakki napapsing adu kokpirabani.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Adudagi wayel yathanggi ojasing amadi Pharisee-sing aduna makhoi masel hainaba hourak-i, “Tengban Mapubu asumna thina ngangliba asi kanano? Pap kokpiba ngambadi Tengban Mapu mahak khaktani.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Makhoina khallibadu Jisuna khangladuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina nakhoigi thamoida karigi adugumna khallibano? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>‘Nahakki napapsing adu kokpirabani’ haibaga ‘Hougattuna chatlu’ haibaga kanana henna laibage? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Aduga Migi Machanupa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisuna sijinnaba mahakki atop pao mingthol ama.</char></note> aduna taibangpan asida pap kokpinaba matik lei haibadu nakhoina khangnanaba eina nakhoida utkani.” Adudagi Ibungona pangtha-sithabagi leinana naba nupa aduda hairak-i, “Eina nangonda hairi, hougatlu aduga nahakki hipnapham adu loukhattuna nayumda chatlu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Khudak adumaktada nupa aduna makhoi mayamgi mamangda hougatle, aduga mahakki hipnapham adu loukhatlaga Tengban Mapubu thagatladuna mayumda chatkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Maduda makhoi pumnamak angakpa amadi akibana thallammi amasung makhoina Tengban Mapubu thagatladuna hairak-i, “Ngasi eikhoina angakpana thallaba thoudok ama uba phangjare!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Levi-bu kouba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mrk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Madugi matungda, Jisuna mapham adu thadoktuna lakpada maming Levi kouba kanggat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khajna haibani</char></note> khomba nupa amana kanggat thipham loisangda phamduna leiba urabada nupa aduda hairak-i, “Eigi itung illu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Maduda Levi-na hougattuna pumnamak thadoklamlaga Ibungogi matung injare.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Adudagi Jisugidamak Levi-na achouba chaklen ama mayumda sillammi aduga yamlaba kanggat khombasing amadi atoppa mioi kaya amasu chaklen aduda makhoiga chaminnarammi. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char></note>Adubu phariseesing amadi makhoigi kanglupta chanba wayel yathanggi ojasing kharana Ibungogi tung-inbasinggi mathakta wakatladuna hairak-i, “Nakhoina kanggat khombasing aduga atoppa papchenbasing asiga chamin-thakminnariba karigino?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Masa phabasinggidi laiyengba mi mathou tade adubu anabasinggidamaktadi mathou tai. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Eina achumba chatpasingbu kouba lakpa natte adubu pappisingbu pukning honglaknaba kouba lakpani.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chara henbagi maramda wahang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Nongma mioi kharana Jisuda hai, “John amadi mahakki tung-inbasingnadi itat-tattana chara henduna haijei, aduga matou adumna pharisee-singnasu tou-i; adubu nahakki tung-inbasingnadi adumak cha-thaktuna leiriba karigino?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Borgi marup-mapangsingna borga loinaringei matamda nakhoina makhoibu chara helhanba ngambra? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Adubu makhoidagi bor adubu pukhigadaba matam ama lakkani, numitsing aduda makhoina chara hengani.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Jisuna makhoida pandam amasu hairak-i, “Mi kananasu amanba phida ahanba phi machet photchinde, karigumba mahakna photchinlabadi ahanba phi adu segairakkani, aduga ahanba phi machet aduga amanba aduga chunaroi. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Aduga kananasu amanba sawun khaoda anouba yu hapnade, karigumba mahakna haplabadi anouba yu aduna sawun khao adu pokhaihangani amasung yu adu heidokkani aduga khao adusu manggani. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Madugi mahutta anouba yudi ahanba sawun khaosingda hapkadabani. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Aduga kananasu ariba yu thaklaba matungda anouba yu pamloi. Maramdi mahakna haigani, ‘Ariba asina henna phei.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Potthaba numitki Mapu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Aniwa 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Potthaba numit amada Jisuna mahei maronggi loubuk phaoduna chatlammi. Amasung Ibungogi tung-inbasingna gehu charong khara heklaga makhutna noithoktuna charammi. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Maduda pharisee kharana makhoida hanglak-i, “Nakhoina Potthaba numitta touphade haina eikhoigi wayel yathangna haiba adu nakhoina touriba karigino?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3,4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samu 21:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “David amadi mahakka loinabasingna lamlaba matamda David-na kari toukhibage haibadu nakhoina Mapugi puyada padabra? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Levi 24:9</ref></char></note>Mahakna Tengban Mapugi yumda changduna purohitsing khaktana chagadaba Tengban Mapuda katthokkhraba tal adu louduna chakhi amasung mahakka loinabasingdasu pikhi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida haikhi, “Migi machanupa adu Potthaba numitkisu Mapuni.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Potthaba numitta Jisuna anaba phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mrk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Atoppa Potthaba numit amada Jisuna synagogue-ta changduna misingda tambirammi. Amasung mapham aduda yet-thangba makhut pangtha-sithaduna naba nupa ama leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Aduga Pharisee amadi Wayel Yathanggi oja kharana Jisubu aranba tou-i haina maral siba yanaba maram thiduna leirammi. Maram aduna makhoina Potthaba Numitta Ibungona anaba phahanbra haiduna Ibungobu cheksinna yenglammi. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Adubu Ibungona makhoigi wakhaldu khangladuna makhut nama pangtha-sithaba nupa aduda hairak-i, “Hougattuna mamang asida lak-u.” Aduga nupa aduna hougattuna mapham aduda leple. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Ei nakhoida wahang ama hangge, Wayel yathangna potthaba numitta touba yabasi karino: Aphaba thabak toubra nattraga phattaba thabak toubra? Kanagumbagi thawai kanbara nattraga mang-hanbra?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Amasung Ibungona makhoi pumnamakta koina yenglaga nupa aduda hairak-i, “Nahakki nakhut adu tingthok-u.” Aduga mahakna madu toujare, amasung makhuttu hannagum pungpha phajare.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Maduda makhoi mei houna saorammi amasung Jisugi maiyokta makhoina kari touba yabage haiduna amaga amaga wa tanaba houre.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Tung-inba taranithoibu khanba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Madugi matung matam ikan kannadana nongma Jisuna haijanabagidamak ching amada kakhatlammi amasung mahakna ahing chuppa Tengban Mapuda haijaduna mapham aduda leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Amasung ayuk matam oiraklabada Ibungona mahakki tung-inbasing pumnamakpu manakta kourammi amasung makhoi taranithoibu khandoktuna pakhonchatpa haina koure. Makhoising adudi: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Mahakna Peter hainasu kouba Simon amadi mahakki manao Andrew; Jacob, John, Philip, Bartholomew, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matthew, Thomas, Alphaeus-ki machanupa Jacob, Mareibak ningba hainasu kounaba Simon, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Jacob-ki machanupa Judas amasung yeknabagi michang oikhiba Judas Iscariot-ni.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna tambiba amadi anaba phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoiga loinana chingthaktagi kumtharaktuna leitem manaba mapham amada masing yamlaba mahakki tung-inbasing aduga loinana leplammi. Aduga Judea apumbadagi amasung Jerusalem-dagi aduga Tyre amadi Sidon-gi samudra mapandagi yamlaba miyam amasu mapham aduda leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Makhoising adu Ibungogi wa tananaba amasung makhoigi lainasing adu Ibungona phahanbinabagidamak lakpani. Aduga phattaba thawaisingna wahallibasingsu laklammi amasung makhoina madudagi phajarammi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Amasung mipum khudingmakna Ibungobu soknaba hotnarammi maramdi Ibungodagi anaba phahanbagi panggal thoraklammi amasung makhoi pumnamakpu anaba phahanbirammi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaiphabasing amasung Awabasing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasing aduda yengladuna hairak-i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Lairaba nakhoi yaiphabani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Maramdi Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibak adu nakhoigini!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Houjik lamliba nakhoi yaiphabani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Maramdi nakhoibu thalhanbigani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Houjik kaplibasa nakhoi yaphabani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Maramdi nakhoina nokchagani!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref></char></note>Migi machanupa adugi maramgidamak misingna nakhoibu yengthiraba, inthoklaba, ikaiba piraba, aduga nakhoigi ming thinaba hairaba nakhoi yaiphabani! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Mi 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Pakhon 7:52</ref></char></note>Numit aduda nungaijou amadi haraoduna chongkhatchou maramdi swargada nakhoigi mana chao-i. Maramdi matou adugumna makhoigi mapa mapusingna Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingdasu toukhi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Adubu inak-khunba nakhoidi awabanida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">Maramdi nakhoina nungngai yaiphaba adu phangkhre!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Houjik puk thanduna leiriba nakhoi awabanida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Maramdi nakhoina lamgani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Houjik nokliba nakhoi awabanida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Maramdi nakhoina tengtha nao-oigani amasung kapkani!”<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Mi pumnamakna nakhoigi maramda aphaba haiba matamda nakhoi awabanida; maramdi matou asigumna makhoigi mapa mapusingna Tengban Mapugi wa phongdoksinabasingda toukhi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeknababu nungsiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Adubu eigi wahei tariba nakhoida eina hairi: Nakhoina nakhoigi yeknabasingbu nungsiyu, nakhoibu yengthibasingda aphaba toubiyu, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Nakhoibu sirap toubasingbu bor pibiyu, aduga nakhoibu thina toubasinggidamak Tengban Mapuda haijabiyu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Kanagumbana nanggi nakhajai namada khupakna tharabadi atoppa nakhajai nama adusu onsillu; kanagumbana nahakki mapangi phurit adu loukhrabadi, nahakki manunggi phurit adubusu loubada thinganu. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Nangonda nijaba mi khudingmakta pinou, aduga kanagumbana nahakki napot-nachei loukhrabadi amuk hanna piraknanaba hairuganu. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref></char></note>Misingna nakhoida touhanningba adumak nakhoinasu makhoida tou.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Nakhoibu nungsiba mising adukhaktabu nakhoina nungsirabadi nakhoida kari thagatpham leibage? Maramdi papchenbasing phaobana makhoibu nungsibasingbudi adumak nungsi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Aduga nakhoida aphaba thabak touba mising adukhaktada nakhoina aphaba tourabadi nakhoida kari thagatpham leibage? Maramdi papchenbasing phaobanasu adumna adumak tou-i. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Aduga nakhoida amuk singlakkani haina asha touba mising adukhaktada sel puthoklabadi nakhoida kari thagatpham leibage? Maramdi papchenbasing phaobanasu puthokkhiba senpham adu amuk phanggani haina asha touduna papchenbasingda adumak puthok-i. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Adubu nakhoina yeknabasingbu nungsiyu, makhoida aphaba toubiyu, aduga singlakpagi wakhal amuk toudana makhoida puthok-u. Adu oirabadi nakhoigi mana chaogani, aduga nakhoina wangthoiraba Tengban Mapugi asengba machasing oigani. Maramdi toubimal khangdabasing amasung phattabasinggi maphamdasu mahakti chanbi hei. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Aduga nakhoigi napana chanbiheibagum nakhoisu chanbi heiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Misingbu wayendanaba tambiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Kanadasu wayelluganu aduga nakhoibusu wayenbiroi. Kanadasu maral leihanluganu aduga nakhoibusu naral leihanbiroi. Ngakpiyu aduga nakhoibusu ngakpigani. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Piyu aduga nakhoida pinabigani. Ahenba changda, namsinduna, niksinduna, aduga pathokna nakhoigi phigaoda happigani. Maramdi nakhoina olluriba chang adumakna nakhoidasu amuk ollagani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga Ibungona makhoida pandam asisu haikhi, “Mitangba amana mitangba amabu lamjingba ngambra?” Adumna tourabadi makhoi animak komda taroidra? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note>Maheiroi amana mahakki ojadagi henna chaode, adubu mapung phana tamlaba pumnamakna oja adugumna oirakkani.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Aduga karigi nahakki namitta leiba ujao adu khangba ngamdraga nachin nanaogi mamitta leiba apikpa u-makup aduda karigi yenglibano? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Nahakki namitta leiba ujao adu nahakna uba ngamdraga, ‘Ichin inao, nahakki namitta leiba u-makup adu ei louthokpige’ haina nahakki nachin nanaoda nahakna karamna haigani? He, aphasasinnabasa! Nangna ahanbada namitta leiriba ujao adu hanna louthokkho, adudagidi nahakna nachin-nanaogi mittagi u makup adu louthokpada sengna uba ngamgani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maheidagi karamba upalno haiba masak khangba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Maramdi aphaba upalda phattaba mahei pande aduga phattaba upalda aphaba mahei pande. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref></char></note> Upal khudingmakki masak magi mahei adudagi khangngi. Maramdi tingkhang pambidagi heiyit heknade aduga tingkhanggi mongsongdagi anggur heknade. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref></char></note>Aphaba mina mahakki thamoigi aphaba langeidagi aphaba thabak puthok-i, aduga phattaba mina mahakki thamoigi phattaba langeidagi phattaba thabak puthok-i. Maramdi mathamoida leiribasingdu machinna ngangthok-i.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yumsaba ani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Eina haiba adudi toudraga karigi nakhoina eingonda Ibungo, Ibungo haina kouribano? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Eingonda laktuna eigi wa taraga madubu thabak oina touba mahak adu kariga manabage haibadu ei nakhoida utke. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Mahak adudi nungjao mathakta luna touthaduna yumpham thollaga yum sariba mi amagumbani. Aduga ising ichao lakpada ichelna yum aduda saphu kanna yeire, adubu yum adu nungjao mathakta cheksinna saba maramna lenghanba ngamkhide. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Adubu eigi wa taraga madubu thabak oina toudaba mahak adudi yumpham yaodana leibakta yum saba mi amagumbani. Aduga ising ichao aduna yeibada yum adu ture amasung madubu machet tana thugaire.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Rome-gi lanmi chamagi makok amagi thajaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Jisuna pumnamaksing asi misingda tambiba loiraba matungda Capernaum-da amuk chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Matam aduda lanmi chamagi luchingba amagi yamna luna toujaba manai ama kanna naduna leirammi amasung mahak sigadourammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Aduga lanmi chamagi luchingba aduna Jisugi maramda tarabada, Ibungona lakpiduna mahakki manai adubu phahanbinabagidamak haijarunaba Jihudisinggi ahal-lamansingbu tharammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Adudagi makhoina Jisugi manakta laktuna asumna kanna haijare, “Nupa asi nahakna mateng pangbada matik chaba mini. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Maramdi mahak Jihudigi misingbu nungsijaba mini aduga mahakna eikhoigidamak synagogue amasu sabire.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoiga loinana chatminnare. Amasung makhoina yum yousillakkadaba panglap laptraba matam aduwaida lanmi chamagi luchingba aduna mahakki pao puhalladuna mahakki marupsingbu tharaklaga asumna Ibungoda haihallare, “Ibungo, Nahakna eigi yumda amuk lengbiraktuna nasabu amuk wahanbiraganu. Maramdi Ibungobu eigi yumda kousinjaba ei matik chajade. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Aduga ei isamak phaoba Ibungogi nanakta laktuna Ibungobu unajaba matik chajade haina ningjei. Aduna yathang aduta pibiyu aduga eigi inaigi anaba phajagani. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Maramdi ei isamaksu mathakthongba phamnaibasinggi makhada leiba mini, aduga eigi ikhada eigi lanmisingna lei. Makhoigi maraktagi amada ‘Chatlu’ hairaga mahakna chatli aduga amada amuk ‘Lak-u’ hairaga mahakna lak-i. Aduga eigi inaida ‘Madu tou’ hairaga mahakna tou-i.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Madu tabada Jisu ngaklammi amasung mahakki tung-illiba miyam aduda onsilladuna hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida hairibasini, Israelsinggi maraktagi phaoba asigumna asuk yamna thajaba asi eina keidoungeida thengnadri!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Adudagi pao purakpa mising aduna yumda hankhiba matamda naduna leihouba manai adu phaduna leiramba thengnare.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna lukhrabi amagi machabu hinggat-hanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Mathanggi numitta Jisuna Nain kouba apikpa sahar amada chatlammi. Aduga mahakki tung-inbasing amasung yamkhraba miyam amana Ibungoga loinarammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Amasung Ibungona apikpa sahar adugi changpham thong yousillakpa matam aduda asiba hakchang ama aroiba mathou mangam pangthoknabagidamak puthoraklammi. Siriba nupa adu lukhrabi amagi amata ngairaba machanupa oirammi, aduga apikpa sahar adugi yamlaba miyam amasu mama aduga loinaraklammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Nupi adu ubada Ibungona nungsiba pokladuna hairak-i, “Kapkanu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Aduga Ibungona changsinduna ku adu sokpada ku puribasing adu chatpa leplammi. Adudagi Ibungona hairak-i, “Pakhang, Eina nangonda hairi hougatlu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Maduda asiba nupa aduna hougatlaktuna phamlaga wa ngangba houre! Amasung Jisuna mahakpu mamada amuk sinnare.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Maduda makhoi pumnamak akibana thallammi amasung makhoina Tengban Mapubu thagatladuna hairak-i, “Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba matik leiba maichou ama eikhoigi irakta phaorakle, amasung Tengban Mapuna mahakki misingbu kanbinaba lakle!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Adudagi Jisugi pao asina Judea apumba amadi akoibada leiba lam pumnamak sin-thungna sandokhre.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amasung baptize toubiba John</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Baptize toubiba Johngi tung-inbasingna masi pumnamaksing asigi maramda Johnda tamlammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Adudagi John-na mahakki tung-inbasinggi maraktagi anibu kouraduna, “Lengbirakkadouriba mahak adu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Messiah</char></note> Ibungora, nattraga eikhoina atoppa amabu ngaijakhigadra” haina hangnanaba Jisugi manakta tharaklammi.<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Amasung makhoina Jisugi manakta lakladuna hairak-i, “ ‘Lengbirakkadouriba mahak adu Ibungora, nattraga eikhoina atoppa amabu ngaijakhigadra’ haina hangnanaba baptize toubiba Johnna eikhoibu tharakpani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Matam adumaktada Jisuna anaba mi kayabu makhoigi anabadagi, lainadagi amadi phattaba thawai changbadagi phahanbirammi. Aduga mamit tangba kayabusu uhanbirammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref></char></note>Adudagi Jisuna John-gi pao purakpasing aduda khumlak-i, “Nakhoina John-gi manakta chattuna nakhoina uraba amadi taraba pumnamak tammu: Mit tangbasingna uba phangjare, khongtekpasingna chatpa ngamjare, kiningai oiba unsagi leinana nabasingna sengjare, na pangbasingna taba phangjare, asibasingna hinggatchare amasung lairabasingda Aphaba pao sandokle. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Aduga eigi maramda chingnaba leitaba mahak adu yaiphabani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Adudagi John-gi pao pubasing aduna chatkhraba matungda Jisuna miyam aduda Johngi maramda haiba hourak-i, “Nakhoina lamjao lamhangda kari yengba chatlubage? Nungsitna yeibada koihum humba awangba napibura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Singwut, singnang</char></note>? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Nattragana nakhoina lamjao lamhangda kari yengba chatlubage? Atangba phijol setpa mi amabura? Yengngu, mamal yamba phijol setpa amadi ke-mouduna leiba makhoising adudi ningthou konungsingda leibani. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Adubu nakhoina kari yengba chatlubage? Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou amabura? Hoi, eina nakhoida hairibasini, mahakti Tengban Mapugi wa takthokpa maichou amadagisu henna chao-i. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mic 3:1</ref></char></note>Mapugi puyada iduna leiriba asi mahak asigi maramdani, ‘Eina eigi pao pubabu nahakki lambi thourang tounanaba nahakki namang thana thagani.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, mioibasinggi marakta Johndagi henna chaoba kanasu leite. Adubu Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibakta khwadagi henna pikpa mahak aduna John-dagi henna chao-i.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29,30</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi Ibungona haiba adu tarabada kanggat khombasing phaoba yaona, mi pumnamakna John-dagi baptize louduna Tengban Mapugi lambidi achumbani haiba yajakhi. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Adubu Pharisee-sing amadi wayel yathang khang-heibasing adunadi Johndagi baptize loudaduna Tengban Mapuna makhoigidamak thourangbiba adu yajakhide.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Adudagi Jisuna amuk makha tana hairak-i, “Adudi eina miron asigi mising asiga kariga changdamnagadage? Makhoiga kariga manabage? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Makhoidi keithelda sanariba angang machasinggumbani, makhoina amaga amaga kounaduna hai, ‘Eikhoina nakhoigidamak bashi khongngi adubu nakhoina jagoi sade; Aduga eikhoina tengtha nao-oibagi eshei shak-i adubu nakhoina kapte.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Maramdi Baptize toubiba John-na chadana amadi yu thaktana lakle; aduga nakhoina mahakpu lai phattaba leiba mini haibire. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Aduga amuk Migi Machanupa aduna cha-thaktuna lakle aduga nakhoina mahakpu mapuklaoba, yuthakpa, amadi kanggat khomba amasung pappisinggi marupni haibire. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Adumakpu, Tengban Mapugi lousingdi achumbani haibasi mabu lousinjariba pumnamakki punsina utle.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee Simon-gi yumda Jisubu nupi amana thao noibiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Pharisee-singgi maraktagi amana Jisubu mayumda chak chaminnanaba kourammi. Amasung Ibungona pharisee adugi yumda chattuna chananabagidamak phamthare. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37,38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mrk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref></char></note>Apikpa sahar aduda papki punsida hingbi nupi amasu leirammi. Jisuna pharisee gi yumda laktuna chak chabagi pao adu mahakna tarabada manam nungsiba mamal tanglaba thao happa alabaster<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngourunaba nung makhal ama.</char></note> nunggi chaphu ama puraklammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Aduga mahakna Jisugi makhong mayada tunglomda lepladuna hikna hikna kapcharammi. Amasung sintharakliba mahakki pirang aduna Ibungogi makhong adu chothallammi. Adudagi mahakna phamtharaduna Ibungogi makhong adu mahakki masamna theithokcharammi amasung Ibungogi makhong adu chupladuna manam nungsiba thao adu teirammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Amasung Ibungobu mayumda koujariba pharisee aduna madu uba matamda mathanta thamoinungda khanjarammi, “Nupa asina karigumba asengbamak Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou oiramlabadi mangonda sokliba nupi asi kanano, karamba nupino haibadi papchenbini haiba mahakna khanglamgadabani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Maduda Jisuna pharisee aduda hairak-i, “Simon, Eina nangonda haigadaba karigumba khara lei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Mahakna khumlak-i, “Hoi, haibiyu oja Ibungo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Sel puthokpa nupa amada sel tonba nupa anikhak leirammi. Makhoi anigi maraktagi nupa amana denari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denari amana matamdugi mi amagi nongmagi khutsumalni.</char></note> chamanga aduga amana yangkhei tollammi. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Adubu makhoi animakna sel adu singba ngamdrabada nupa aduna makhoina tolliba sel adu kokpire. Adu oirabadi makhoi anigi maraktagi karambana mahakpu henna nungsigadage?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simon-na khumlak-i, “Eina ningjabadadi sendon henna kokpikhipa mahak aduna henna nungsigani.” Jisuna hairak-i, “Nahakna chumna khumle.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Adudagi Ibungona nupi aduda onsilladuna Simon-da hairak-i, “Nahakna nupi asi ubra? Eina nanggi yumda changlakpa matamda eigi khong chamnabagidamak nangnadi ishing pikhide, adubu nupi asinadi mahakki mapina eigi khong chamthokpikhi aduga mahakki masamna khong asi teithokpikhi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Nahaknadi eibu chuppiduna taramna okkhide, adubu nupi asinadi eina hek changlakpadagi houjik phaoba eigi ikhong asi chuppiba leptri. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Nangnadi eigi kokta thao teibide, adubu nupi asinadi eigi khongda tanglaba manam nungsiba thao teibiri. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Eina nakhoida hairi, mahakki pap mayam adu kokpire, maram aduna mahakna thoina henna nungsiba adu utle. Adubu pap khajiktamak kokpikhiba mahak aduna khajiktamak nungsi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Adudagi Jisuna nupi aduda hairak-i, “Nahakki papsing adu kokpire.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Maduda chaklen aduda Ibungoga loinana phamminnaribasing aduna makhoi maselgi marakta hainaba hourak-i, “Pap phaoba kokpiba ngamba mahak asi kanano?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Adudagi Jisuna nupi aduda hairik-i, “Nahakki thajabana nahakpu kanbire; ingthana chatcharo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi tung-injabi nupising</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Masigi matungda Jisuna Tengban Mapugi Ningthou leibakki Aphaba Pao sandoktuna sahar saharda amadi khunggang khunggangda chatlammi. Aduga tung-inba taranithoi adu Ibungoga loinarammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2,3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mat 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mrk 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luk 23:49</ref></char></note>Amasung lai phattaba changlambadagi amadi anaba singdagi Ibungona phahanbikhiba nupi khara haibadi phattaba thawai taret tanthokkhiba Magdalene hainasu koubi Mary, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Herod-ki thabak pannaba Cuza-gi nupi Joanna, Susanna amadi atei nupisingsu Ibungoga loinarammi. Makhoina makhoi masagi leijaba maran mathumdagi Jisu amadi mahakki tung-inbasingbu mateng panglammi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maru hunbagi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mrk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Amasung tongan tonganba saharsingdagi misingna Jisugi manakta laktuna mi chonna tillarabada, Ibungona makhoida pandam asi hairak-i,<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Lou uba nupa amana maru hunba chatlammi. Amasung mahakna marusing adu loubukta asum hullakpada maru kharana lambida tare aduga madu misingna khongna netkhaire amasung atiyagi ucheksingnasu chakthokle. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Maru kharana nung marakta tare aduga madu hek hourakpaga ising inin leitabana thuna kangsille. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Maru kharana tingkang pambi marakta tare aduga tingkhang pambising aduna maduga loinana houminnaraktuna madubu namhatle. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Atei marusing aduna leihao leiba leibak mathakta tare aduga hougatlaktuna thakhiba adugi saruk chama chama henna mahei yalle.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Amasung Ibungona masi hairaba tungda, khonjel houna hairak-i, “Tananaba nakhong panba mahak aduna tasanu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pandam sijinnabagi maram</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mrk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Adudagi Ibungogi tung-inbasing aduna Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Pandam asigi wahanthok karino?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Maduda Ibungona khumlak-i, “Tengban Mapu leibakki athuppa adu nakhoidadi khanghanbire adubu ateisingdadi makhoina una una udanaba aduga tana tana khangdanaba eina pandam oina ngangle.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maru hunbagi pandamgi maramda Jisuna sandokna takpiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mrk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Pandam asigi wahanthokti asini: Maru adu Tengban Mapugi waheini. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Aduga lambida tariba marusing aduna Tengban Mapugi wa tarabasing aduni; adubu makhoina thajaduna kanbiba phangdanaba Devilna laktuna makhoigi thamoidagi Tengban Mapugi wa adu louthokhi. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Nunglakta taba marusing aduna Tengban Mapugi wa taraga haraona lousinbasing aduni, Adubu makhoigi marasingdu luna tadaba maramna makhoina matam khara thajaramlaga changyeng lakpa matamda hekta tukhi. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Tingkhang pambi marakta taba marusing aduna Tengban Mapugi wa tabasing aduni. Adubu punsigi langtaknaba, lanthum amadi punsigi harao nungaibana namhatkhi, amasung makhoigi maheidu keidoungeida heijing phade. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Adubu leihao leiba leibak mathakta taba marusing adudi Tengban Mapugi wa adu taraga aphaba amasung haiba injaba thamoida madubu chetna thamjaduna mahei pandriba phaoba khanglibasing aduni.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thaomeigi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mrk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11:33</ref></char></note>Mi kananasu thaomei than-gatlaga thumokna kupsinde nattraga kangkhada thamnade. Adubu manungda changlakpasing aduna mangal adu unanaba thaomei makhongda thaomei adu thammi.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref></char></note>Maramdi phongdokloidaba arotpa karisu leite, aduga khangloidaba nattraga phongloidaba athuppa karisu leite.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref></char>
    </note>“Maram aduna nakhoina karamna tabage haibadu cheksillu. Maramdi areiba mahak aduda henna pibigani aduga leitaba mangondagi mahakna leijei haina khanjaba khajiktang adu phaoba louthokkani.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi mama amasung machin-manaosing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Adudagidi Jisugi mama amasung manaosingna mahakpu unaba laklammi, adubu miyam adugi maramna makhoina Ibungogi manakta changba ngamlamde. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Amasung kanagumba amana Ibungoda hairak-i, “Ibungogi ima amasung inaosingna Ibungobu unaningbagi mapanda leptuna leiri.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Maduda Jisuna khumladuna makhoi pumnamak aduda hairak-i, “Tengban Mapugi wa taraga madubu inba makhoi adu eigi ima amasung ichil-inaosingni.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna nonglei nungsit khaamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrk 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Nongma Jisuna magi tung-inbasingda hairak-i, “Eikhoi pat asigi wangmada chatsi.” Adudagi makhoina hida kakhattuna hidu hondokle. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Amasung makhoina asum hi honduna lakpada Ibungo tumthakhirammi. Adudagi ikhang khanghoudana akanba nonglei nungsit ama pat aduda humjillakle amasung hi aduda ising hajillaktuna makhoi pumnamak yamna khudongthibada tarammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Matamduda tung-inbasing aduna Ibungogi manakta laktuna mahakpu houdoktuna hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, oja Ibungo! Eikhoi siba tare!” Maduda Ibungona hougatladuna nungsit amasung ithak ipom aduda lepnanaba yathang pirammi. Adudagi nonglei nungshit adu lepkhirammi amasung pumnamak tumin leikhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Aduga Ibungona tung-inbasing aduda hanglak-i, “Nakhoigi thajaba adu kadaino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Maduda makhoina akiba amadi angakpaga loinana amaga amaga hangnarak-i, “Mahak asi karamba mino? Mahakna nungsit amadi ithak-ipomda phaoba yathang pi aduga makhoina mahakna haiba illi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Lai phattaba changba nupa amabu phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mrk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Adudagi Jisu amadi mahakki tung-inbasingna Galilee ipak lanthoktuna Gerasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gadara, Gergesa hainasu inei.</char></note> lamdamda laklammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Amasung Jisuna hidagi kangphalda kumthaba matam aduda sahar aduda leiba lai phattaba changba nupa amaga thengnarammi. Mahak matam kuinadagi maphi marol settana leirammi amasung mayumda leiramde. Adubu mahak mongphamsingda leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Mahakna Jisubu hek ubaga kanna laoraduna Ibugogi khuyakhada tuthajaraga ahouba khonjelda hairak-i, “Jisu, Wangthoiraba Tengban Mapugi Macha, nangga eiga kari mari leinabage? Eina nangonda haijari, eibu awaba pibiganu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Mahakna asumna hairibasi Jisuna hanna phattaba thawai aduda mangondagi chatkhinaba yathang pibagi maramnani. Phattaba thawai aduna mahakpu kayarak hanna pharammi, aduga mahakpu phajinduna makhong makhut yotling phalang chanduna thamlabasu mahakna madu pumnamaktu thadatli aduga phattaba thawai aduna chingduna mahakpu lamhang tumhangda puthok-i.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Adudagi Jisuna mangonda hanglak-i, “Naming kari kou-i?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Maduda mahakna khumlak-i, “Tenggol<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atoppada “ligion” haina i. Ligion amada lanmi lising maridagi lising taruk phaoba lei.</char></note> kou-i.” Maramdi mangonda lai phattaba mayam ama changlammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Adudagi lai phattabasing aduna Ibungoda makhoibu makha naidaba komda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abyss</char></note> chatnanaba yathang pibidanaba hanna hanna haijarammi.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Aduga yamlaba ok sanggu ama manak nakpa chingmai aduwaida machinjak chaduna leirammi. Amasung phattaba laising aduna Ibungoda makhoibu oksing aduda changhanbinaba haijare. Aduga maduda Ibungona yabire. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Adudagi lai phattabasing aduna nupa adudagi thoraktuna oksing aduda changlammi amasung angamba chingmai adudagi patta chentharaklaga iraknaduna sire.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Ok senbasing aduna thokkhiba thoudok adu ubada chenkhiduna saharsing amadi khul khulsingda pao adu talammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Aduga thoudok adu yengnaba misingna thoraklammi. Adudagi makhoina Jisugi manakta lakpa matamda lai phattaba changlambadagi thokkhraba nupa adu maphi settuna wakhal tana Jisugi khuyada phamduna leiba adu makhoina thengnarammi amasung maduda makhoi kirammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Amasung thoudok adubu uhouba mising aduna phattaba lai changba nupa aduna kamdouna phakhibage haibadu mising aduda tamlammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Adudagi Gerasa-gi akoibada leiba miyam apumba aduna Jisuda mapham adu thadoktuna chatpikhinaba haijarammi, maramdi makhoi adukki matik kirammi. Maram aduna Jisuna hida tongladuna mapham adu thadoknaba touba matamda, <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Lai phattaba changlamba nupa aduna Jisuda haijarak-i, “Eihaksu Ibungoga loinana chatchage.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Adubu Jisuna asumna hairaduna nupa adu thakhirammi, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Nahakna yumda handuna Tengban Mapuna nangonda kayada chaoba thabak toubikhre haibadu tamlu”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Aduga nupa aduna chatkhraga Jisuna mangonda kayada chaoba thabak toubikhibage haibadu sahar sinba thungna tamlammi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jairus-ki machanupi amasung ee tabi nupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mrk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Jisuna patki wangmada halakpa matamda miyamna mabu haraona oklammi, maramdi makhoi pumnamakna Ibungobu ngaiduna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Adudagi maming Jairus kouba synagogue-ki luchingba ama laktuna Jisugi khuyada tuthajaduna mahakki yumda Ibungona lakpinaba haijarammi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Maramdi mahakki chahi taranithoi surabi amata pokchabi machanupi sigadourammi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Aduga Jisuna lambida lakpada miyam aduna Ibungogi maikei khudingmakta yomsillammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Makhoisingdugi marakta chahi taranithoi chupna ee taduna naraklabi ama yaorammi. Mahakna laiyengba mi kaya amada mahakki leijaba pumanmak puthoktuna layenglurabasu kana amatana mahakpu phahanba ngamlamde. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Amasung mahakna Ibungogi tungda laktuna Ibungogi phijida sokcharammi aduga khudak aduda mahakki ee taramba adu lepkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Maduda Jisuna hanglak-i, “Kanana eingonda sokhibage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Aduga pumnamakna sokte hairabada, Peter-na Ibungoda hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, Mi pumnamakna Ibungoda omsinduna insinnabanani .”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Adubu Jisuna hairak-i, “Kanagumba amana eibu sokkhre maramdi eingondagi panggal thokkhiba adu ei khangngi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Adudagi nupi aduna lotpa yararoi haiba khanglabada tanik tanikna laklaga Ibungogi khuyada tuthajarammi. Aduga mahakna Ibungoda kari maramgidamak sokkhiba aduga kamdouna mahakki anabadu khudaktuda phakhibage haibadu miyam adugi mangda mahakna haidokle. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Maduda Ibungona mangonda hairak-i, “Ichanupi, Nanggi thajabana nahakpu phahanbire; ingthana chatcharo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Jisuna wa asi hairingei matamduda synagogue-ki luchingba Jairus-ki yumdagi paopuba mi ama laktuna Jairus-ta hairak-i, “Nahakki nachanupi sire, aduna oja Ibungobu amuk wahalluraganu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Hairiba adu tabada Jisuna Jairus-ta hairak-i, “Kiganu, thada thajou aduga mahakpu soidana phahanbigani.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Adudagi makhoina Jairus-ki yumda thunglabada, Jisuna Peter, John, Jacob amadi nupimacha adugi mama mapa nattana kana amatabu manungda changhallamde. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Aduga mi pumnamakna nupimacha adugidamak kaplammi amasung tengtha nawoirammi. Adubu Jisuna hairak-i, “Kapkanu, mahak siba natte, mahak tumlibani.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Maduda makhoi pumnamakna mahak sire haiba khangbana Ibungobu noknarammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Adubu Jisuna mahakki makhuttu pairaduna houna hairak-i, “Nupimacha, hougatlu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Maduda nupimacha adugi thawaidu amuk hallaktuna mahak khudak aduda lepkhatlakle. Adudagi Jisuna nupimacha aduda chananaba karigumba khara pinanaba makhoida hairammi. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Amasung nupimacha adugi mama mapa adu ingak ngaklammi, adubu thokhiba thoudok adu mi kana amatada tamthoktanaba Ibungona makhoida yathang pirammi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Tung-inba taranithoibu thaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Nongma Jisuna tung-inba taranithoibu punna kouraduna lai phattaba pumnamakpu tanthokpa ngamnaba amadi laina makheibu phahanba ngamnaba panggal amadi matik pirammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Adudagi Ibungona makhoibu Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibak sandoknaba amasung anabasingbu phahannaba tharammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10:4-11</ref></char></note>Aduga mahakna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina chatpa matamda khongchat adugidamakta cheisu, khao, chananaba pot, sen amadi phurit phaoba anisuna puganu. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Nakhoina changba yum aduda nakhoina mapham adu hek thadoktriphaoba leiyu. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Pakhon 13:51</ref></char></note>Aduga kanagumbana nakhoibu lousindrabadi nakhoina sahar adu thadokpa matamda makhoigi mathakta cheksin wa oinanaba nakhoigi khongya uphul adu kanthoklammu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Adudagi makhoina mapham adu thadoktuna khunggang khunggangsingda chattuna mapham khudingmakta Aphaba Pao sandoklammi amasung anabasingbu phahallammi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herod-na chamamnaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mrk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7,8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mrk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note>Galilee-gi leingak mapu Herod-na Jisuna touriba pumnamaksing asi tabada mahak yamna chamamnarammi. Maramdi baptize toubiba John asibadagi hinggatkhre haina mi kharana hairammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Aduga atoppa kharana Elijah thorakle hairammi aduga atoppa kharana amuk mamangngeigi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousinggi maraktagi ama sibadagi hinggatlakle haina hainarammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Maduda Herod na hai, “John-di eina mangak kak-hankhrabani; adu oiragadi, eina pao mayam ama tariba mahak asina kanano?” Adudagi mahakna Jisubu unanaba hotnarammi.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mi lising mangabu pijaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Aduga pakhonchatpasingna halaklabada makhoina toukhiba pumnamaksing adu Jisuda tamlammi. Adudagi Ibungona makhoibu puraduna makhoikhaktamak Bethsaida sahargi achikpa mapham amada chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Adubu miyam aduna madu khangladuna Ibungogi matung illaklammi. Amasung Ibungona makhoibu taramna okladuna Tengban Mapu leibakki maramda takpirammi amadi anabasingbu phahanbirammi.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Numit taramdai matamda tung-inba taranithoi aduna Ibungogi manakta changlaktuna hairak-i, “Miyam asina akoibada leiba khungangsingda amadi khunsingda chattuna thungpham chapham thijarunaba makhoibu thabikhro. Maramdi eikhoina leiriba asi mi tadaba lamhangni.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina makhoida chananaba karigumba khara piyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoina chattuna miyam pumnamak asigi chananaba leiruba nattragadi, eikhoida leiriba haibabu tal manga amadi nga ani asida mangaire.”<verse eid="LUK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Maramdi mapham aduda nupa lising mangarom leirammi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Adudagi Jisuna tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, “Mising adubu mi yangkhei yangkheigi kangbu semduna phamhallu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Aduga tung-inbasing aduna adumna touduna makhoi pumnamakpu phamhalle. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Adudagi Jisuna tal manga amadi nga ani adu louraga swargada yengkhattuna Tengban Mapubu thagatchare. Aduga Ibungona talsing amadi nga adu segairaduna miyam aduda yenthoknanaba mahakki tung-inbasingda pire. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Amasung makhoi pumnamakna mapuk thanna chare. Aduga makhoina chabagi lemhouba tal amasung nga machetsing adu Ibungogi tung-inbasingna thumok taranithoi thanna khomgatle.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peterna Jisubu Christtani haina phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mrk 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Nongma Jisuna mathanta haijaduna leirammi. Amasung mahakki manakta tung-inbasing khaktamak mahakka loinarammi. Ibungona makhoida hanglak-i, “Miyamna eibu kanani haina hainabage?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mrk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Mi kharanadi Ibungobu baptize toubiba John-ni hainei, aduga mi kharana Elijah-ni hai, aduga mi khara amanadi mamangeigi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousinggi maraktagi amana amuk hingatlakpani hainei.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi Ibungona makhoida hanglak-i, “Adubu nakhoinadi eibu kanani hainabage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Maduda Peter-na khumlak-i, “Ibungo nahakti Tengban Mapuna thabirakpa Christta aduni.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna awaba nanggadaba amadi sigadabagi maramda phongdokpa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mrk 8:30–9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida madu mi kanadasu haidananaba akanba yathang pirammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Aduga Jisuna makhoida asimasu hairak-i, “Migi Machanupa adu awaba nangba tai aduga ahal lamansing, athoiba purohitsing amasung wayel yathanggi ojasingna mahakpu yadaba tai. Mahakpu hatkani, adubu humni suba numitta mahakna amuk hinggatkani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi mahakna makhoi pumnamakta hairak-i, “Kanagumba amana eigi itung inninglabadi, mahakna masabu yajadasanu aduga numit khuding masagi cross thanggatchaduna eigi itung insanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note>Kanagumba amana mathawai kanjaba pamlabadi madu mangjagani, adubu eigi maramgidamak mathawai mangjarabadi mahakki thawai adu kanba phangjagani. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Mi amana taibangpan apumba phangjaraga mahak masamak mangjarabadi nattraga maithijarabadi, mahakki kari tongjaba leibage? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Kanagumbana eigidamak amasung eigi waheigidamak ikairabadi, Migi Machanupa aduna mahak masagi, Mapagi amadi asengba swarga dutsinggi matik mangalga loinana lenglakpa matam aduda mahak adugidamak ikaigani. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, mapham asida lepliba makhoi kharadi Tengban Mapugi ningthouleibak aduna lakpa udriba phaoba sibagi mahao tangloi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna saklon hongba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mrk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Ibungona waheising asi haikhiba matung numit nipannimukki matungda, Peter, John amadi Jacob-pu puraduna Ibungona ching amada haijananabagidamak kakhatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Aduga Ibungona haijaringeida Ibungogi maithong honglakle aduga mahakki phijondu nganna langna ngourakle. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Amasung ikhang khanghoudana nupa anikhak thoraktuna Ibungoga wari sanarammi. Makhoi ani adudi Moses amasung Elijah-ni. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Makhoina swargagi matik mangalga loinana thoraklammi. Amasung makhoina, Ibungona thuna thunghangadouriba Tengban Mapugi thourang haibadi mahakna Jerusalemda sibigadouba matou adugi maramda Jisuga wari sannarammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Peter amasung mahakka loinabasing adudi ningngaidana tumlammi, adubu makhoina hougatpa matamda Jisugi matik mangal amadi mahakka loinana lepminnariba nupa ani adu ure. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Aduga Moses amadi Elijah-na Jisuga khainaramdai matam aduda Peter-na Ibungoda hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, eikhoina mapham asida leijabasi eikhoigidamak kayada phakhraba! Eikhoina sang ahum, Ibungogi ama, Moses-gi ama, amasung Elijah-gi ama sasi.” (Mahakna haijariba adu kari hairibano haiba Peter-na khangjaramde.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Mahakna nganglingeimaktada leichil ama thoraktuna makhoibu khanjinlammi; aduga leichil aduna makhoibu kupsinba aduda tung-inbasing adu kirammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note>Adudagi leichil marak adudagi khonjel amana hairak-i, “Masi eina khandoklaba eigi nungsiraba Ichanupani, mahakna haiba tao!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Khonjel aduna lepkhraba matungda tung-inbasing aduna mapham aduda Jisukhaktamak leiba urammi. Aduga thokkhiba pumnamaksing adugi maramda makhoi tumin leirammi amasung makhoina ukhibasing adu matam aduda makhoina mi kanadasu tamthoklamde.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phattaba thawai changba nupamacha amabu Jisuna phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrk 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Mathanggi numitta makhoina chingthaktagi kumtharaklammi, aduga yamlaba miyam amana Ibungoga unarammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Aduga miyam adugi maraktagi nupa amana laoraduna hairak-i, “Oja, eina nangonda haijari, eigi ichanupa asibu yengbiyu, mahak eigi amata ngairaba ichanupani. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Phattaba thawai amana mahakpu phajinduna mahakpu khanghoudana lao-khonghalli aduga mahakpu tamthina nikhanduna mayada konggol kahalli. Aduga mahakpu thina asok apan thokhallaga phattaba thawai adu thokningdana mangondagi thokkhi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Eina Ibungogi tung-inbasingda phattaba thawai adubu tanthokpinaba haijarambani, adubu makhoina tanthokpa ngamdre.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “He thajaba leitaba amadi phattaba miron! Kayam kuina eina nakhoiga leiminnaduna khangkhigadage?” Adudagi Ibungona nupa aduda hairak-i, “Nachanupa adu maphamasida pusillak-u.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Nupamacha aduna changlakpa matam adudasu phattaba thawai aduna mahakpu leimaida inthuduna mahakpu tamthina nikhallammi. Adubu Jisuna phattaba thawai aduda yathang piraduna nupamacha adubu phahanbiraga, mahakpu mapada amuk pibirammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Aduga makhoi pumnamakna Tengban Mapugi matik leiraba pangal aduda yamna ngaklammi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Jisuna amuk hanna mahakna sigadabagi maramda phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mat 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mrk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Jisuna toukhibasing aduda miyam aduna ingak ngaktuna leiringeida Ibungona mahakki tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Eina haigadouriba wasing asi pukning changna tao! Migi Machanupa adubu misinggi makhutta pithokkadouri.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Adubu Ibungona hairiba adu karino haiba tung-inbasing aduna khangba ngamlamde. Makhoina madu khangba ngamdanaba wa adugi nunggi oiba wahandok adu lottuna thamlammi. Aduga makhoina madugi maramda Ibungoda hangbasu kirammi.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanana khwaidagi henna chaobage?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adudagi makhoigi marakta kanana khwaidagi henna chaobage haiduna tung-inbasinggi marakta yetnaba hourammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Makhoina khalliba wakhal adu Jisuna khangladuna apikpa angang amabu pairaduna mahakki nakalda lephallaga, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char></note>Makhoida hairak-i, “Kanagumbana apikpa angang asibu eigi mingda lousillabadi eibu lousinbani; aduga kanagumbana eibu lousillabadi eibu tharakpa Ibungo mahakpu lousillabani. Maramdi nakhoigi maraktagi khwadagi tonthajaba mahak aduna khwadagi chaoba oigani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eikhoigi maiyokta leitaba mi adu eikhoigini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mrk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Aduga John-na hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, eikhoina Ibungogi mingda lai phattabasing tanthokpa mi ama ujei amasung eikhoina mangonda madu toknanaba hairammi maramdi mahak eikhoigi irakta yaoba mi natte.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Mahakpu thingluganu, maramdi eikhoigi maiyokta leitaba mahak adu eikhoigini.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samariagi misingna Jisubu yadaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Jisubu swargada loukhatkadaba matam adu naksillaklabada Ibungona Jerusalemda chatnanaba chetna leplammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Aduga Ibungona mahakki thungpham thourang tounanaba pao-pubasingbu mahakki mang thana Samaria-gi khunggangda tharammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Adubu mapham adugi misingna mahakpu lousillamde. Maramdi Ibungona Jerusalemda chatlibani haibadu sengna khanglammi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Ning 1:9-16</ref></char></note> Aduga tung-inba Jacob amadi John-na madu ubada, makhoina Jisuda hairak-i, “Ibungo, Elijah-na toukhibagum makhoibu mang-hannaba eikhoina swargadagi mei kouthaba Ibungona pambibra?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida onsillaktuna makhoibu cheirammi, aduga hairak-i, “Nakhoi karamba thawaigi oiba misingno haibadu nakhoi khangdre. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Maramdi Migi Machanupa adu migi punsibu manghannanaba lakpa natte adubu makhoibu kanbinanaba lakpani.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atoppa larik kharada masi hapte.</char></note> Adudagi Jisu amasung mahakki tung-inbasing aduna atoppa khunggang amada chatkhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tung-inba oibagi changyeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Aduga makhoina lambida asum chatlingeida kanagumba nupa amana Jisuda hairak-i, “Ibungona chatpa mapham khudingda eina Ibungogi tung-injagani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Lamhuisinggi makon lei, aduga atiyagi ucheksingsu mahum lei, adubu Migi Machanupa adugidi makok ngathapham mapham phaoba leite.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Aduga Ibungona atoppa nupa amada hairak-i, “Itung illu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Adubu nupa aduna hairak-i, “Ibungo, eina yumda hanna hanjaduna ipabu leiron chanjarukhige!”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Asibasingna masagi asibasingbu leiron chanjasanu; adubu nahakti chattuna Tengban Mapugi leibak adu sandok-u.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Ning 19:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga atoppa amanasu hairak-i, “Ibungo, eina nanggi natung injagani, adubu eina hanna yumda hanjaduna eigi imung manunggi misingda khainabagi wa haijaruge.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Adubu Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Langgol khutna pairaga tunglomda yengba mi kana amatana Tengban Mapugi leibakkidamak matik chade.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Tung-inba humphutara-nithoibu thaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Madugi matungda Ibungona atoppa humphutaranithoi khandoktuna makhoibu ani ani semlaga mahakna chatkadaba sahar khudingda amadi mapham khudingda mahakki mang thana tharammi. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref></char></note>Aduga Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Lokkadaba loudi yammi, adubu lokpinaba midi yamde; maram aduna mahakki lou lokphamda thabak suba mi thabiraknaba lourok mapuda haijou. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref></char></note> Chatlu! Eina nakhoibu keisalsinggi marakta yao machasinggum thari. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mrk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref></char></note>Nakhoina sengao, khao nattraga sandal puduna chatkanu aduga lambida kanagasu kouna-saknabagidamak panganu. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Adubu nakhoina kanagumbagi yumda changba matamda asumna hanna haiyu, ‘Yum asigi mathakta ingthaba oisanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Aduga imung aduda kanagumba ingthaba pamba mi leiramlabadi nakhoigi ingthabagi yaipha-thoujal adu mahakki mathakta leisanu. Adubu ingthaba pamba mi leiramdrabadi nakhoina pikhiba ingthabagi yaipha-thoujal adu nakhoida amuk halaksanu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Cor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref></char></note>Aduga nakhoibu lousilliba imung aduda makhoina pirakpasing adu cha-thaktuna leiyu maramdi thabak suba mina magi asuman phangba matik chai. Amasung nakhoina yum amadagi amada khoihong hongganu. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Nakhoina sahar amada changba matamda nakhoibu taram taramna lousillabadi nakhoida pija pijaba adu chao. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Aduga mapham aduda leiba anabasingbu phahallammu amasung makhoida haiyu, ‘Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibak adu nakhoida naksillakle.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10,11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Pakhon 13:51</ref></char></note>Adubu nakhoina saharda changba matamda misingna nakhoibu taramna lousindrabadi maphamdugi lambisingda chattuna haiyu, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Eikhoigi khongyada pakliba nakhoigi sahar asigi uphul asiphaoba eikhoina nakhoigi maiyokta kanthoklabani. Adumakpu Tengban Mapugi leibak adu naksillakle haiba asi ningsing-u!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Meihou 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref></char></note> Eina nakhoida hairiba asini, madudi Wayenba Numit aduda sahar adudagidi Sodom-na henna saphagani!<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pukning hongdaba saharsinggi awaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eze 26:1–28:26</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amos 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zec 9:2-4</ref></char></note>He Chorazin, nangdi awabanida! He Bethsaida, nangdi awabanida! Maramdi nakhoida toukhiba angakpa thabaksing adu Tyre amadi Sidon-da touramlabadi makhoina bora phi settuna amadi utta phamduna mamang mamangda paptagi pukning honglamgadabani. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Aduga wayenba numitta nakhoidagidi Tyre amadi Sidonna henna saphagani. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14:13-15</ref></char></note> Aduga he Capernaum! Nangbu swargada thanggatpigadra? Natte, nangdi khamnung leibakta hunthagani.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mrk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingduda hairak-i, “Nakhoigi wa taba mahak aduna eigi wa tarabani; aduga nakhoibu yadaba mahak aduna eibu yadabani; amasung eibu yadaba mahak aduna eibu tharakpa Ibungo mahakpu yadabani.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tung-inba Humphutara-nithoina Halakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Adudagi tung-inba humphutaraithoi aduna haraona halaktuna Jisuda hairak-i, “Ibungo, eikhoina Ibungogi mingda yathang pibada lai phattabasingna phaoba eikhoigi yathang illi!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Swargadagi nongthang kuppagumna Satan-na tarakpa eina urammi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Isei 91:13</ref></char></note>Yengngu, nakhoina lil amadi brichiksinggi mathakta netnanaba aduga Yeknaba adugi panggal pumnamakpu ngamnanaba eina nakhoida matik pire, aduga karigumba amatanasu nakhoibu sok-halloi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Adumakpu, lai phattabasingna nakhoina haiba illi haibagidamak haraoganu; adubu swargada nakhoigi ming ikhre haibagidamak haraojou.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna haraojaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Matam adumaktada Jisu Thawai Asengbagi mapanna haraobana thalladuna hairak-i, “He Ipa, swarga malem pumnamakki Mapu Ibungo! Eina nahakpu thagatchari maramdi nahakna hiramsing asibu asingbasing amadi akhang-aheisingdagi lottuna thambiraga apikpa angangsing asida phongdokpire. Hoi, Ipa, masimak nahakki naphamdadi apenbani.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">Jn 10:15</ref></char>
    </note>“Eigi Ipana hiram pumnamak eingongda sinabire. Aduga Mapa adu nattana kananasu machanupa adubu khangde amasung machanupa adu nattana aduga mapa adubu phongdoknaba machanupa aduna khandokkhraba makhoi adu nattana kananasu mapa adubu khangde.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Adudagi Jisuna tung-inbasing aduda onsillaktuna tonganna makhoikhaktada hairak-i, “Nakhoina houjik uriba asibu uba phangjariba nakhoi kayada yaiphakhraba! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Eina nakhoida hairi, Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou amadi ningthou kayana nakhoina uriba asibu ujaninglammi adubu makhoina uba phangkhide. Aduga nakhoina taba adubu makhoina tajaninglammi adubu makhoina takhide.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aphaba Samaria-gi mi amagi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mrk 12:28-34</ref></char>
    </note>Nongma wayel yathanggi oja amana hougatlaga Jisubu chang yengladuna wahang ama hanglak-i, “Oja Ibungo, lomba naidaba punsi phangnaba eina kari toujagadage?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Wayel yathangna kari haibage? Madu nahakna kamdouna handokpage?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Nupa aduna khumlak-i, “‘Nahakna nahakki Tengban Mapu, MAPU IBUNGO-bu thamoi apumba, thawai apumba, panggal apumba, amadi pukning wakhal apumba yaona nungsigadabani;’ aduga ‘nahakki yumlon keironnababu nasamakkum nungsigadabani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Levi 18:5</ref></char></note>Nahakna chumna khumle; madumak tou, aduga nahakna hinggani.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Adubu wayel yathanggi oja aduna achumba sajaningduna Jisuda hairak-i, “Adudi eigi yumlon-keironnababu adu kanano?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nongma nupa amana Jerusalemdagi Jericho tanna chatlingeida huranbasinggi makhutta tarammi. Makhoina mahakki maphi marol munbire amasung mahakpu sigadaba makhei phubiraga hundoklamduna chatkhre. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Tanja adumaktada kanagumba purohit ama lambi aduda laklammi. Amasung mahakna nupa adubu ubada lambigi nakanda theidoktuna chatkhre. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Matou adugumduna levigi nupa amasu lambi aduda laklaga nupa adubu ubada lambigi atoppa nakanda theidoktuna chatkhre. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33,34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Mi 28:15</ref></char></note>Adubu kanagumba Samaria-gi mi amana lambi adomda asum langphei lakpada nupa adu thengnare amasung nupa adubu ubada mahakki thamoida nungsiba pokle. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Adudagi mahakna nupa adugi manakta changsinduna asokpa mapham aduda thao amadi yu heibiduna phina kisinbire. Aduga mahakna nupa adubu mahak masamakki lola aduda tonghanduna mithungsang amada pusinbiraga mahakpu seba toubire. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Mathanggi numitta mahakna denari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denari ama haibasi matam adugi nongmagi khutsumalni.</char></note> ani louthoktuna mithungsang pannaba nupa aduda piraduna hairak-i, ‘Mahakpu ningthina yengsinbiyu, aduga masidagi henna mangonda chading touba pumnamak eina halakpa matamda singgani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>“Houjik nahakki wakhalda makhoi ahum asigi manungda karambana huranbagi makhutta taraba nupa adugi yumlon-keirolnabani haina khanbage?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Maduda wayel yathanggi oja aduna khumlak-i, “Nupa aduda minungsi utpiriba mahak aduni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Adudagi Jisuna nupa aduda hairak-i, “Chatlu, aduga madugumna nahaksu tou.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Martha amasung Mary-gi mayumda thungba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38,39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jn 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu amasung mahakki tung-inbasingna asum lakpada makhoina khunggang amada thunglammi. Amasung maming Martha koubi nupi amana Ibungobu mayumda taramna kousinjare. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Mahakki manaonupi Mary koubi ama leirammi amasung mahakna Ibungogi khuyada phamduna Ibungona tambiba adu tajarammi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Adubu Martha-na, tougadaba thabak adu yammankhibana warammi. Maram aduna mahakna laktuna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Ibungo, thabak pumnamaksing asibu ei ithantana tounanaba eigi inaonupina eibu thadokliba asibu Ibungona kari amata khanbidabra? Mahakna laktuna eibu mateng pangnanaba khara haibiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Maduda Ibungona mangonda khumlak-i, “Martha, Martha! Nahakna thabak mayam amagi maramda langtaknari amasung wari. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Adubu thabak amakhaktangdi yamna tangaiphadabani. Mary-na madugi aphaba saruk adu khankhre aduga madu mangondagi amuk louthoklaroi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Haijabagi maramda tambiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Nongma Jisuna mapham amada haijaduna leirammi. Amasung mahakna haijaba loibaga mahakki tung-inbasinggi maraktagi amana Ibungoda hairak-i, “Ibungo, John-na magi tung-inbasingda tambibagum eikhoida haijaba tambiyu.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Maduda Ibungona makhoida khumlak-i, “Nakhoina haijaba matamda asumna haiyu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Swargada leiba Ipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Nahakki minglen asengba oisanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Nahakki leibak laksanu.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Eikhoigi nongmagi chananaba chinjak numit khudinggi pinabiyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Eikhoida aranba toubasingbu eikhoina kokpibagum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">eikhoigi pap kokpiyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Amasung eikhoibu athembada tahanbiganu adubu eikhoibu phattaba adudagi kanbiyu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, “Nakhoigi naraktagi kanagumba amana mahakki marup amagi yumda ahing nongyaida chattuna asumna hai haina khallasi, ‘Marup, tal ahumdang pujage. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Langphei lakpa marup ama eigi yumda thunglare, adubu mangonda pijanaba eigi kari amata leitre.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Aduga mahakna imungdagi asumna khumlak-i haina khallasi, ‘Eibu wahanbiraganu. Thong asisu lonkhre aduga eigi ichasingsu eiga loinana phamungda leire. Aduna eina hougattuna nangonda kari amata piba ngamdre.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Adubu eina nakhoida hairi madudi marup ama oibagidamak mahakna hougattuna mangonda tal adu pidraba phaobada, nupa aduna hanjin hanjin hangbada ikaidabagi maramna mahakna hougattuna mathou taba pumnamak mangonda pibigani.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>“Maram aduna eina nakhoida hairibasini: Nijou, aduga madu nakhoida pinabigani; thijou nakhoina phangjagani; thong adu thinjou, nakhoida thong hangdokpigani. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Maramdi nijaba mi khudingna phangjei, thijaba mahak aduna phangjei, aduga thong thinjaba mahak aduda hangdokpigani. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Nakhoigi narakta mapa oiribasa! Karigumba nakhoigi nachasingna nakhoida tal niraga nakhoina makhoida nung oina pigadra? Nattraga nga niraga madugi mahutta lil oina pigadra? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Nattraga makhoina yerum niraga yerumgi mahutta brichik oina pigadra? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nakhoina phattaba oidunasu nachasingda karamna aphaba khudol pigadage haiba khanglabadi swargada leiba nakhoigi napana mangonda nijaba makhoida kayamuk thoidok hendokna Thawai Asengbabu pibigadaba!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amasung Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mrk 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Nongma Jisuna nupa amadagi lonthoktaba lai phattaba ama tanthoklammi. Amasung lai phattaba adu thokakhrabada nupa adu wa nganglakle. Maduda miyam pumnamak ngaklakmi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> Adubu makhoi kharana hairak-i, “Mahakna lai phattabasinggi makok Beelzebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satangi atoppa ming</char></note>-gi mapanna lai phattabasingbu tanthok-i.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mrk 8:11</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi atoppa kharana Jisubu chang yengladuna mahakki matik adu Tengban Mapudagini haiba utnanaba angakpa khudam ama tounanaba hairammi. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Adubu Jisuna makhoigi wakhal adu khangladuna makhoida hairak-i, “Leibak amagi manungda kanglup kanglup tokhai tanajarabadi leibak adu manggani, aduga imung amada tokhai tokhai tanarabadi imung adu leikha tagani. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Satan-gi leibak manungda kanglup masel amaga amaga khatnaba leirabadi, leibak adu kayam kuina leigani? Eina lai phattabasing tanthokliba asi Beelzebul-gi mapanna toubani haina nakhoina haibagi maramna eina masi haibani. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Houjik eina Beelzebul-gi mapanna lai phattabasing tanthoklabadi, nakhoigi tung-inbasingnadi kanagi mapanna lai phattabasingbu tanthokpage? Adunadi nakhoi nasamakki tung-inbasingna nakhoi lalle haibadu utchare. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Adubu eina Tengban Mapugi panggalna lai phattabasingbu tanthoklabadi, Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibak adu nakhoida lakle.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Maramdi akanba nupa amana khulai matikchana paiduna masagi mayumbu ngaklabadi mahakki mapot-machei adu tekta kaidana lei. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Adubu mangondagi henna kanba kanagumba amana mangonda landaduna mahakpu khudum challabadi, mahakna mapan tangjaramba khutlai pumnamak loukhigani aduga mahakki mapot macheising adusu yennakhigani.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mrk 9:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Eigi oidaba mahak aduna eigi maiyokta lei; aduga khomjinbada eibu mateng pangdaba mahak aduna madubu chaithok-i.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phattaba Thawaina Amuk Hanjinlakpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Phattaba thawaina mi amada changlambadagi thokkhiba matamda mahakna pothapham thiduna akangba maphamsingda chatli. Adubu pothapham phangdrabada mahak masa mathanta haijei, ‘Eina eigi hannagi yum aduda amuk hallage.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Asumna mahakna hallakpa matamda hannagi yum adu sit-sengduna ningthina thamlamba thengnare. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Adudagi mahakna chatkhiduna mangondagi henna phattaba thawai taret puraktuna makhoina nupa aduda changduna mapham aduda leire. Adudagi nupa adu hannagi phibam adudagi henna phattaba phibam oirak-i.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asengba yaiphaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Jisuna waheising asi hairingeida miyam adugi maraktagi nupi amana ahouba khonjelda hairak-i, “Nahakpu pokchabi amadi khomlang inbikhiba nama adu kayada yaiphabino?”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlak-i, “Madudagi henna Tengban Mapugi wahei taraga ngaakchaba makhoi aduna henna yaiphabani.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jonahgi khudam piba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mrk 8:12</ref></char>
    </note>Tilliba miyam aduna yamlaklabada, Jisuna wa ngangba hourak-i, “Ngasigi miron asi phattaba mironni, makhoina khudam thidunata lei; adubu Jonahgi khudam adu nattana eina makhoida atoppa khudam amata piraroi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Jn 3:4</ref></char></note>Maramdi Jonah-na Nineveh-gi misingda khudam oikhiba aduga chap mannana Migi Machanupa aduna ngasigi miron asida khudam oigani. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Ning 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Mi 9:1-12</ref></char></note> Wayenba Numitta Sheba leibakki Leimarembina ngasigi miron asiga lepminnagani aduga miron asibu maral pigani, maramdi mahakna ningthou Solomon-gi lousing tanabagidamak lapkhraba maphamdagi lakhi. Aduga, eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairi madudi Solomon-dagi henna chaoba ama mapham asida leiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Jn 3:5</ref></char></note>Aduga Nineveh-gi misingnasu Wayenba Numitta leptuna miron asigi mising asibu maral pigani, maramdi makhoina Jonah-gi paosandokpada paptagi pukning honglammi aduga houjik maphamsida Jonah-dagi henna chaoba ama lei.<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hakchanggi Thaomei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mrk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8:16</ref></char></note>Mi kananasu thaomei thanlaga lotsinduna nattraga thumok makhada thamnade; adubu manungda changlakpa mi pumnamakna mangal adubu unanaba thaomei makhong mathakta thamnei. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Hakchanggi thaomeidi mitni. Maram aduna nahakki mit pharabadi nahakki hakchang apumba mangalna thangani. Adubu mit aduna phattrabadi nahakki hakchang apumba amambana thangani. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Aduna nangonda leiriba mangal adu mamdanaba cheksillu. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Karigumba nahakki hakchang apumba mangalna thallabadi, aduga amamba saruk amata leitrabadi, thaomeigi anganba mangalna nangonda nganbagum, madu pumngan-ngangani.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Pharisee-sing amadi wayel yathanggi ojisingbu maral piba.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Jisuna wa ngangba loibaga pharisee amana Ibungobu mahakka loinanana chaminanaba haijarammi. Maram aduna Ibungona lengsinduna chananaba phamthare. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Adubu Ibungona chakcha mangda khut hamdaba adu ubada pharisee adu ngaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Maduda Ibungona mangonda hairak-i, “Nakhoi pharisee-singnadi pukham tenggotki mapanthanba saruk adu ningthina sengdok-i, adubu manungdadi namja namtheknabana amadi phattabana thalli. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>He, Apangbasa! Mapanthangbabu sembiba Tengban Mapu mahakna manungbusu sembiba nattra? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Adubu pukham amadi tenggot adugi manungda yaoribasing adubu lairabasingda pinou, aduga pumnamak nahakkidamak senggani.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Levi 27:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pharisee nakhoidi awabanida! Maramdi nakhoina nungsihidak, arud<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mahao leihannabagidamak ensangda thakpa amasung hidak oinasu sijinnaba pambi ama. </char></note>, amadi ingkholda houba atoppa mana masing khibikki saruk taragi ama katli adubu achumba wayel amadi Tengban Mapubu nungsiba adubudi thaoide. Adubu nakhoina ahanba adubusu thaoidaba toudana akonba asibusu touramgadabani.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Pharisee-sa nakhoidi awabanida! Maramdi nakhoina synagogue-singda ikai khumnaba misinggi phamphamda phamba aduga misingna nakhoibu keithelsingda ikai khumnabaga loinana koujaba adu nakhoina pammi. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Pharisee-sa nakhoidi awabanida! Nakhoidi misingna khangdaduna mathakta nettuna chatliba uba phangdaba mongphamgumbani.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Adudagi wayen yathanggi oja amana Ibungoda hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, Nahakna wasing asi haiduna eikhoibusu ikaiba pibire.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Maduda Jisuna khumlaki, “Wayen Yathanggi oja nakhoisu awabanida! Maramdi pubada wagadaba potlum kaya ama nakhoina misinggi mathakta thonggatli adubu nakhoinadi makhoibu mateng pangnabagidamak khutsa ama phaoba thanggatte. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Nakhoidi awabanida! Maramdi nakhoinadi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousinggi phajaraba mongpham sai adubu makhoibu hatkhibadi nakhoigi napa napusingnani. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Aduga nakhoigi napa napusingna toukhiba thabak adu nokhoina sougatli haibagi sakhi nakhoi nasamakna oiri. Maramdi makhoina Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpa maichousingbu hatle aduga nakhoina makhoigi mongpham sare. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Maram asimakna Tengban Mapugi lousingna hai, ‘Eina makhoida eigi wa phongdokpiba maichousing aduga pakhonchatpasingbu thagani, adubu makhoina makhoi kharabu hatkani aduga ateisingbuna otpi-neibigani.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Maram aduna taibangpan houngeidagi tarakliba Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou pumnamakki ee-gi cheirak adu ngasigi mirol asigi mathakta tahangani. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Meihou 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Mi 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note>Haibadi Abel-gi ee-dagi houduna iratpung amadi Asengba Maphamgi marakta hatkhiba Zechariah-gi ee phaobagi cheirak pigani. Eina nakhoida hairibasini, masi pumnamakki cheirak adu miron asigi mathakta tagani.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Wayel Yathanggi ojasing, nakhoidi awabanida! Maramdi nakhoina lousinggi so adu loukhre. Adubu nakhoina nasasu maduda changde aduga maduda changlakpasing adubusu nakhoina thingngi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Jisuna mapham adu thadokkhrabada Wayel Yathanggi ojasing amadi Pharisee-sing aduna Ibungobu thamthiba matouga loinana magi mayokta leppa hourammi amasung hiram kayagi wahang hangbasu hourammi. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Maramdi Ibungogi chindagi thorakpa asoiba wahei thiduna mahakpu phananaba hotnarammi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Aphasasinnabagi maiyokta cheksin wa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mrk 8:15</ref></char>
    </note>Talak adumaktada, mioi lising lisingna, amaga amaga netsinnaba makhei tillarabada, Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasing aduda hanna haiba hourak-i, “Pharisee-singgi hamei haibadi makhoigi aphasasinnaba adudagi cheksillu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mrk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char></note>Maramdi phongdokloidaba kupsinba karisu leite, aduga khangloidaba arotpa karisu leite. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Adunadi nakhoina amambada ngangkhiba khuding anganbada tagani aduga nakhoina thong thingjinba kanungda nakongda lonna ngangnakhiba khudingmak yumthaktagi laothokkani.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eikhoina kanabu kigani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Marupsa, eina nakhoida hairibasini, hakchangbu hatlaga matungda madudagi henna karisu touba ngamdaba makhoi adubu kiganu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Adubu nakhoina kanabu kigadabano haibadu eina nakhoida haige. Madudi hatlaba matungda norokta langsingnaba matik leiba Tengban Mapu mahakpu kiyu. Eina nakhoida hairibasini, nakhoina kigadaba adu mahak asini.<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Nakhoina sendrang mangabu peisa anida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rome leibakki khwaidagi pikpa sel</char></note> yonba nattra? Adumak oidunasu Tengban Mapuna makhoi amabusu kaothokpa toude. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Aduga madudagi hendokna nakhoigi kokta houriba sam adu phaoba masing thiribani. Maram aduna kiganu, nakhoidi sendrang mayam amadagisu mamal yamba helli.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtabu yaba amasung yadabasing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Eina nakhoida masimasu hairi, madudi misinggi mangda eigi tung-inbasingni haina phongdokpa makhoi adubu Migi Machanupa adunasu Tengban Mapugi swarga dutsinggi mamangda maduga chap manana makhoida toubigani. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Adubu misinggi mangda eigini haiba yajadaba makhoi adubudi Tengban Mapugi swargadutsingi mangda yabiroi.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mrk 3:29</ref></char>
    </note>“Amasung Migi Machanupa adugi maiyokta wa ngangba mahak adubudi kokpigani, adubu Thawai Asengbagi mathakta thina ngangba mahak adubudi kokpiroi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11,12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mrk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref></char>
    </note>“Aduga nakhoibu wayennaba synagogue-singda, aduga leingak mapusinggi nattraga leingakpasinggi mangda puthokpa matamda nakhoina nasa ngakthokchanaba kari khumgadage amadi kari haigadage haibagidamak karisu waganu. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Maramdi matam aduda nakhoina kari haigadabano haibadu Thawai Asengbana takpigani.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apangba inakhunbagi pandam wari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Adudagi miyam adugi maraktagi nupa amana Jisuda hanglak-i, “Oja Ibungo, Ipana eikhoigidamak thambiramba lanthum adu eiga yenthoknanaba iyambada khara haibiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda khumlak-i, “He Nupa, kanana eingonda nakhoibu wayelnaba nattraga nakhoi anigi lanthum adubu yenthokpinaba matik pibage?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Adudagi Jisuna miyam aduda hairak-i, “Cheksillu aduga makhal khudingmakki kalak mihoubadagi nasabu ngak-senjou; maramdi nahakki punsi adu nahakki lanthum kaya yamna leibage haibaduna chang ongadaba natte.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida pandam asi hairak-i, “Kanagumba inakhunba nupa amagi mahei marong marang kaina thokpa loupham ama leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Mahakna masa mathanta asumna khanjarammi, ‘Eigi mahei marong pumnamak asi peisinnaba mapham leitre. Aduna ei houjik kari tougani?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Amasung mahak masa mathanta haijarammi, ‘Eina asumna tourage, eina eigi kei asi sidoklaga eigi mahei marongsing amadi atei potsing pumnamak thamnanaba henna chaoba kei ama sarage. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Adudagi eina isa ithanta haijagani, Laibakphaba nupa! Nahakna chahi kaya chatlagadaba aphaba pot pumnamak peisille; pothajaro, charo, thaklo amadi nungaijaro.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Adubu Tengban Mapuna mangonda hairak-i, ‘He Apangba! Ngasi ahing asimaktada nahakki thawai louragani. Adu oirabadi nahakna nahak nasagidamak langkhatchariba pumnamaksing asi kanagi oihougadage?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>“Makhoi masagidamak lanthum peikhatchariba adubu Tengban Mapugi mityengdadi inak khundaba makhoising aduda thokkadaba adumak masini.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Langtaknaba amasung Tengban Mapuda thajaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, “Maram aduna eina nakhoida hairi, nakhoina hingnanabagidamak kari chagani aduga hakchanggidamak nakhoina kari setkani haina karisu langtaknaganu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Maramdi hingbana chinjaktagi aduga hakchangna phijoldagi yamna henna maru oi. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Kwaksinggi maramda nakhoi wakhal tou; makhoina marusu hunde, loksu lokte aduga makhoigi machinjak peisinpham kei-su leite; adum oinamakpu Tengban Mapuna makhoibu machinjak pibi! Aduga nakhoidi ucheksing asidagi kayada henna mamal yamliba? <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nakhoi kanana pukning lantaknabana masagi punsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ariba lairik kharada marep khudup ama hainasu i.</char></note> adu mikup ama sangdokhanba ngambra? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Aduga nakhoina asigumba apikpa thabak asi phaoba touba ngamdraga ateisinggi maramda nakhoina karigi langtaknabano? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Ning 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Mi 9:3-6</ref></char></note> Lamlakki leirangsingna karamna houriba, nakhoi wakhal tou. Makhoina thabaksu sude aduga makhoi masagidamak phisu sade. Adubu eina nakhoida hairi, Solomonmaknasu mahakki matik mangal pumnamakka loinana phijet leitenglabasu leising asigi maraktagi amana phajaba adugumna phijet leitengkhide. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Aduga ngasidi houriba, hayengdi leirangda hunjingadouriba loubukki napi phaoba Tengban Mapuna asumna phijet leitengbirabadi, he thajaba watpasa, mahakna nakhoibu kayada henna phijet leitengbiroidra?<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Maram aduna nakhoina kari chagani, kari thakkani haiba adu thiganu, aduga wasu waruganu. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Maramdi taibangpanda leiriba Tengban Mapu thajadaba mi pumnamakna pot pumnamak asi thi, adubu nakhoigi Napana pumnamaksing asi nakhoida mathou tai haiba khangbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Madugi mahutta nakhoina Tengban Mapugi Leibak adu thiyu aduga pot pumnamaksing asi mahakna nakhoida pinabigani.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Swargagi lan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Yao sanggu macha, nakhoi kiganu. Maramdi nakhoida ningthou leibak adu pibiba haibasi nakhoigi Napagi apenbani. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Nakhoigi leijaba pumba yonthoktuna lairabasingda pinou. Aduga nakhoi nasagidamak manthaba naidraba sengao adu thourang toujou, amasung lan-thum hanthaba leiraroidaba, huranbanasu huba ngamlaroidaba, amadi til-kangnasu madubu manghanba ngamlaroidaba mapham swargada nakhoigi lan peisinjou. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Maramdi nakhoigi lan leiba maphamda nakhoigi thamoisu lei.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mitseng khangba manaising</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25:1-13</ref></char></note>Thougal tounabagidamak naphi semduna amadi thaomei thanggatuna leiyu. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mrk 13:34-36</ref></char></note> Luhongbagi chaklendagi mapu aduna halakpa ngairiba misinggum nakhoi oiyu. Madu mahakna halaktuna thong thillaba matamda makhoina khudakta thong adubu hangbagumna oinanabani. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Mapu aduna halakpa matamda mitseng khangduna leiramba manaising adu yaiphabani. Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, madudi mahakna thougal tounaba maphi semgani amasung makhoibu chananaba phamthahangani aduga mahakna makhoibu thougal tougani. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Mahakna ahing nongyaida lakpasu yai natraga madugi matungda lakpasu yai. Adubu mahakna halakpa matamda mitseng khangduna leiramba makhoi adu yaiphabani. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39,40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char></note> Aduga masisu khangngu, karigumba yumbu aduna huranbana lakkadaba pungpham adu khanglamlabadi mahakna mitseng khangduna yum adu sagun touhallamoidabani. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Maram aduna nakhoisu thourang touduna leiyu maramdi nakhoina ningludaba pungphamda Migi Machanupa adu lenglakkani.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thajabayaba amasung thajabayadaba minai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Adudagi Peter-na hanglak-i, “Ibungo, nahakna pandam asi eikhoikhaktada haibiribra natraga mi pumnamaktara?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Maduda Ibungona khumlak-i, “Adu oiragadi, mapu aduna imung manung adugi thabak asin arang tounaba amasung atoppa minaising aduda matam chana makhoigi chananaba sharuk pinanabagidamak pannahalliba thajaba yaba amadi asingba minai adu kanano? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Mapu aduna halakpa matamda asumna touramba thengnaba minai adu kayada yaiphabano? <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Eina nakhoida achumba adu hairibasini, mahakpu mapu aduna mahakki leijaba lanthum pumnamakki mathakta pannaba mi oihanbigani. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Adubu minai aduna mapukningda mapu adu matam kuina halakkhiroi khanduna mahakna atoppa minai nupasing amadi nupising animakpu phuba, thak-chaba amadi yu ngaoba hourabadi, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>minai aduna halakkani ningludaba amadi mahakna khangdaba numit amada mapu aduna hallakani. Aduga mahakpu matup thokna kakthatkani amasung haiba indabasing mapham adu mahakkisu saruk phanghangani.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Amasung mapugi aningba adu khangba minai amana thourang toudrabadi aduga mapugi aningba adu pangthoktrabadi mahakpu cheiphu kayarak phuduna cheirak pigani. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Adubu mapugi aningba adudi khangdaba aduga cheirak phangba yaba aranba kharadi touba mahak adubu cheiphu kharatamak phuduna cheirak pigani. Maramdi yamna pibikhiba mahak adudagi yamna tangani aduga yamna henna sinnakhiba mahak adudagi yamna henna tangani.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tokhai tanaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Eina malem asi mei chakhannaba lakpani; aduga mei adu hannana chakhallamba eina kayada pamjaba! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mrk 10:38</ref></char></note> Adubu eina lougadaba baptize ama lei, aduga madu thungdriba paoba eina kayada wariba? <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Eina taibangpan asida ingthaba piba lakpani haina khanbra? Eina nakhoida hairibasini, natte, adubu khaidok-hannabani. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Ngasidagi houna mi manga leiba imung adu tokhai tokhai tanagani; madudi ahumna anigi maiyokta aduga anina ahumgi maiyokta leigani. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mic 7:6</ref></char></note>Mapana machagi maiyokta leigani aduga machana mapagi maiyokta leigani; mamana machanupigi maiyokta aduga machanupigi maiyokta mamana leigani; manemna mamougi maiyokta aduga mamouna manemgi maiyokta leigani.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Matamgi khudam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Jisuna miyam aduda masimasu hairak-i, “Nakhoina nongchuplomdagi amuba leichil pairakpa ubada nong chugadoure haina nakhoina khudakta haigani aduga madu thok-i. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Aduga khagi nungsit sitlakpa matamda ngasidi omchaknaba numit oigani haina nakhoina hai aduga madu thok-i. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Aphasasinnabasa! Nakhoina atiya malemgi phibam yenglaga nongju nungsagi maramda khang-i; adu oiragadi houjikki matam asigi maramda karamna handokkani haiba khangdriba karigino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nahakki maiyokta leibasingga yasinnaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Achumba adu tounanaba nakhoi nasana karigi wayenjadribano? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Nahakna nahakki maiyokta naral siriba mahakka wayelsangda chatpa matamda, nahakna wayelsang youdringeida yetnaba adu yariba makei yasinnanaba nahakna ngamjaba adu hotnou. Adu nattragadi mahakna nahakpu wayel mapugi mangda chingthokpa yai aduga mahakna nangbu phamnaibada sinnagani aduga nahakpu keisumsangda thajingani. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Eina nangonda hairibasini, nahakna singdokkadaba aroiba senpham adu hek singdoktriba makheidi nahakna mapham adudagi thorakpa yaroi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Paptagi pukning hongba nattraga siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Matam aduda, Galilee-gi misingna Tengban Mapuda iratpot katlingeida Pilate-na makhoibu hatkhibagi maramda Jisuda pao tamlamba mioi khara mapham aduda leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Makhoina asumna sikhiba asigi maramna Galilee-da leiba mi ateisingdagi makhoina henna phattaba papisingni haina nakhoina khanbra? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, madu natte! Adubu nakhoina paptagi pukning hongdrabadi makhoida toukhibagumna nakhoi pumnamaksu manggani. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Aduga Siloam-da leiba awangba yum ningkhaibada nanduna sikhiba makhoi taranipan aduna Jerusalem-da leiriba mising ateidagi henna papchenba misingni haina nakhoina khanbra? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Eina nakhoida hairi, madu natte! Adubu nakhoina pukning hongdrabadi matou adugumna nakhoi pumnamaksu manggani.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mahei pandaba heiyit pambigi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida pandam asi hairak-i, “Kanagumba nupa amagi anggur ingkholda thajaba heiyit pambi ama hourammi. Amasung mahakna laktuna pambi aduda mahei panbra haiduna yenglammi adubu mahakna mahei amata panba thengnaramde. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Maram aduna mahakna mahakki ingkhol koiba nupa aduda hairak-i, ‘Yengngu, chahi ahum eina heiyit pambi asida mahei panbra haina yengba lakli adubu mahei amata phaoba panba thengnadre. Aduna pambisi yanthatkhro, masina lam manghanduna karibu tougadouribano?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Adubu ingkhol koiba nupa aduna khumlak-i, ‘Ibungo, chahi amatangga masi leijakhisanu; eina akoibada touthoktuna leihao hapchage. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Maduda mahei pallabadi phare adubu pandrabadi nahakna masi yanthatpiyu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna nupi amabu potthaba numitta phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Nongma Potthaba numit amada Jisuna synagogue amada tambirammi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Mapham aduda phattaba thawai amana soinaihallabi nupi ama leirammi. Mahakna chahi taranipan manam ponduna tingkhatchaba ngamdana leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Jisuna mahakpu ubada kouthokladuna hairak-i, “Nahakki anaba adudagi nahakpu thadokpirabani.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Adudagi mahakna nupi aduda khut thambiba khudak aduda nupi adu tingkhatchaba ngamjarammi amasung Tengban Mapubu thagatchakhi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9">Khong 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Aniwa 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char>
    </note> Adubu Jisuna Potthaba numitta anaba phahanba aduda synagogue-ki phamnaibasing aduna saoraduna miyam aduda hairak-i, “Hapta amada misingna thabak sunaba numit tarukni lei. Maram aduna numitsing aduda nakhoigi anaba phahanbinaba lak-u, adubu potthaba numitadi lakkanu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Maduda Ibungona mangonda khumlak-i, “He, Aphasasinnabasa! Nakhoi khudingmakna Potthaba numitta nakhoi nakhoigi sal laba nattraga lolabu sanggoldagi thadoktuna ising pithaknaba puthoktabra? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Adu oirabadi Abrahamgi charon suron oiribi Satan-na chahi taranipan punduna leirurabi mahakpudi Potthaba Numitta pulliba adudagi thadokpipham thoktra?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Ibungogi paokhum asina mahakki yeknaba pumnamak ikaiba nanghallammi aduga Ibungona toukhiba angakpa thabaksing adugidamak miyam pumnamak haraojarammi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hangam marugi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Adudagi Jisuna hairak-i, “Tengban Mapugi Leibak adu kariga manabage? Madu eina kariga changdamnagadage? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Madu mi amana louraga mahakki ingkholda hunkhiba hangam marugumbani. Madu houraktuna achouba pambi oirak-i aduga atiyagi ucheksingna madugi masada mahum sai.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hameigi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Jisuna amukka hanna hairak-i, “Tengban Mapugi Leibak adu kariga manabage? Madu eina kariga changdamnagadage? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Madu nupi amana louduna yam thumok amada yansinduna anoiba yam pumnamak aduna kamkhattriphaoba thamba hameigumbani.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akhuba thong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Aduga Jisuna Jerusalem tamna chatpada sahar amadi khunggangsing phaora phaoraduna misingbu tambirammi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Matam aduda kanagumba amana Ibungoda hairak-i, “Ibungo, mi khara khaktamak kanbiba phanggadabra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Akhuba thong aduda changnanaba kanna hotnou. Eina nakhoida hairibasini, mi kaya amana maduda changnaba hotnagani adubu ngamloi. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Aduga yumbu aduna hougattuna thong adu thingjinkhrabadi, nakhoina mapanda lepkani aduga nakhoina thong thinduna haijagani, ‘Ibungo, thong asi eikhoida hangdokpiyu.’ Adubu mahakna nakhoida haigani, ‘Nakhoi kanano aduga kadaidagi lakpano haiba ei khangde.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Adudagi nakhoina haigani, ‘Eikhoina nahakka chaminnakhi amasung thakminnakhi aduga nahakna eikhoigi lambisingda tambikhi.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Isei 6:8</ref></char></note> Adubu mahakna amuk haigani, ‘Nakhoi kanano aduga kadaidagi lakpano haiba ei khangde. He phattaba thabak toubasa! Nakhoi pumnamak Eingondagi chatthokhro.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28,29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mat 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char></note>Aduga nakhoina Abraham, Isaac, Jacob amasung Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou pumnamakna Tengban Mapugi leibakta uraga nakhoibuna mapanda hundokpiba matam aduda nakhoina kapkani amasung naya krak-krak chikkani. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Misingna nongpok, nongchup, kha amadi awangdagi lakkani aduga makhoina Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibakki chaklen aduda phamgani. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mrk 10:31</ref></char></note>Aduga yengu! Houjik akonba oibasing aduna ahanba oigani aduga houjik ahanba oibasing aduna akonba oigani.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Jerusalem-gidamak tengthaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Matam adumaktada Jisugi manakta Pharisee khara laktuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nahak mapham asi thadoktuna mapham kadaidano ama chatkhro, maramdi Herod-na nahakpu hatpa pamli.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Chatlu aduga lamhui aduda hairu, ‘ngasisu hayengsu eina lai phattabasingbu tanthokhigani aduga anabasingbusu phahankhigani aduga humnisuba numitta eina eigi thabak adu loisingani.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Adum oinamakpu, ngasisu, hayengsu aduga hangchitsu eina eigi lambi aduda adumak chakhiba tari; maramdi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou kanabusu Jerusalemda nattana atei maphamda hatte.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Ho Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingbu nahakna hatli aduga Tengban Mapuna nangonda thakhiba pao pubasingbu nungna thai! Yenbina machasingbu mathanungda konsinjabagum eina nanggi nachasingbu kayada toina konsinjaba pamjaramba! Adubu nahakna eingonda kolhankhide. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Isei 118:26</ref></char></note>Houjikti yengu, nahakki yum thadoktuna thanamlabani. Aduga eina nakhoida hairibasini, ‘MAPU IBUNGO-gi mingda lenglakliba mahak adu yaiphabani’ haina nakhoina haidriba matam adu phaoba nakhoina eibu amuk hanna uba phanglaroi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna anaba nupa amabu phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Nongma Potthaba Numit amada Jisuna Pharisee-singgi luchingba amagi mayumda chaklen chanaba lengsinba matamda misingna mahakpu kupna yenglammi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Aduga mapham aduda phugamna naduna makhong makhut pomthokpa nupa ama Ibungogi nakta laklammi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Maduda Jisuna Wayeng Yathanggi ojasing amadi Pharisee-sing aduda hanglak-i, “Potthaba Numitta anaba phahanbasi wayel yathangna yabra nattraga yadabra?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Adubu maduda makhoina paokhum amata piramde. Aduga Ibungona nupa aduda khut thambiduna naba phahanbiraga thakhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12:11</ref></char></note>Adudagi Ibungona makhoida hanglak-i, “Nakhoi kanagumbagi nachanupa nattraga sal laba ama Potthaba Numitta komda tarabadi, nakhoina Potthaba Numit oirabasu khudak aduda madubu loukhatloidra?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Adubu wapham asida makhoina paokhum amata khumba ngamlamde.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nollukpagi maramda tambiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Aduga chaklen aduda lenglaklibasing aduna ikaikhumnabasinggi phamphamsing adu khanba adu Jisuna ubada mahakna pandam ama piraduna hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Pao 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note>Kanagumbana nakhoibu luhongbagi chaklenda kourabadi ikaikhumnabasinggi phampham aduda phamganu maramdi nangondagi henna maruoiba mi ama thouramduda kourambasu yai? <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Karigumba kouramlabadi, yumbu aduna laktuna nangonda haigani, ‘Phampham asida nupa asibu phamhansi.’ Maduda nangna ikaiba nangbaga loinanana hanthaba phamphamda amuk phamgani. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Madugi mahutta thouram yaobinaba nahakpu kourabadi, thoubu aduna laktuna nangongda, ‘Marup, henna phaba phampham asida kakhatpiyu’ haina hainanaba nahakna chattuna khwaidagi hanthaba phampham aduda phammu. Maduna chaklen aduda nahakka phamminariba pumnamakki mamangda nahakpu ikai khumnagani. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk 18:14</ref></char></note>Maramdi masana masabu chaohanjabasing adubu nollukhangani aduga masana nollukchabasing adubuna chaohanbigani.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakpu lakpinaba koujariba yumbu aduda hairak-i, “Nahakna ayukki chaklen nattraga numidang charagidamak chakkouba matamda nahakki marup-mapang nachin nanao, sagei natei nattraga inakhunba yumlon keironnaba gi mibu kouganu maramdi makhoinasu nahakpu amuk kouraktuna nahakna toukhiba adugi laman hallakpasu yai. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Adubu nahakna chaklen langba matamda laira-anangsing, soinairabasing, khongtekpasing amadi mitangbasingbu kou. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Aduga makhoina nangongda amuk laman singba ngamjadaba maramna nahak yaiphaba oijagani. Maramdi achumba chatpasingna hinggatpa numit aduda Tengban Mapuna nangongda amuk hanbigani.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Achouba chaklengi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Jisuga chaklen aduda phamminnariba amana madu tabada Jisuda hairak-i, “Tengban Mapugi leibakki chaklen aduda phamgadaba makhoising adu kayada yaiphaba!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Kanagumba mi amana achouba chaklen ama langladuna mi mayam ama koujare. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Aduga chaklen adugi matam laklabada, mahakna manaising tharaduna mahakna lakpinaba haijakhibasing aduda asumna haihankhi, ‘Lakpiro, pumnamak thourang touduna leire.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Adubu makhoi pumnamak chap manana leithokpa houraklammi. Ahanba aduna hairak-i, ‘Eina loubuk ama leisillure aduna eina chattuna madu yengluba tare; aduna eibu ngakpinaba haijari.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Atoppa amana amuk hairak-i, ‘Eina sal laba pabot manga leirure aduna madu chang yenglunaba ei chatlibani. Aduna eibu ngakpinaba haijari.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Adudagi atoppa amana amuk hairak-i, ‘Ei luhongbada ngairi, maram aduna ei lakpa ngamlaroi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Adudagi minai aduna handuna pumnamaksing asi mapu aduda tamlare. Maduda mapu aduna saoraduna mahakki minai aduda hairak-i, ‘Houjikmak sahargi lambi lambida aduga leirak leirakta thuna chattuna laira-anangsing, soinaibasing, mit-tangbasing amadi khongtekpasingbu mapham asida purak-u.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Madu pangthoklaba matungda minai aduna laktuna hairak-i, ‘Ibungo nahakna haibadu toujare adubu houjiksu mapham hangli.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Maduda mapu aduna minai aduda hairak-i, ‘Nakhoina khullakki lambising amadi leirak leirakta chattuna yum asi thannanaba misingbu mapham asida changhallak-u. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Eina nakhoi pumnamakta hairi, madudi eina hanna lakpinaba haijakhiba makhoi amatana chaklen asigi mahao tangba phangloi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tung-inba oibagi mamal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Adudagi yamlaba miyam ama Jisuga loinana chatminnarammi. Aduga Ibungona makhoida onsillaktuna hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref></char></note>Eigi inakta lakpa mi amana mahakki mama-mapa, nupi-angang, machin-manao, machal-mache aduga masamakki punsidagi phaoba henna eibu nungsidragadi mahakna eigi tung-inba oiba ngamloi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mrk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref></char></note>Aduga kanagumba masagi crosspu pujadaba aduga eigi itung illaktaba mahak aduna eigi tung-inba oiba ngamloi. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Nakhoigi maraktagi kanagumba amana awangba yum ama saninglabadi nahakna phamthaduna madu saba loisinba phaobada konnagadaba nahakki sel leigadra haina changgadaba adu hanna pathokloidra? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Maramdi nahakna madu toudragadi, yumphamdi hougatlaga awangba yum adu saba loisinba ngamloi; aduga madu awuba misingna nahakpu noknaduna haigani, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>‘Nahakna yum sabadi hougatlamlaga loisinbadi ngamdrene.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Aduga lanmi lising tara leiba ningthou amana lanmi lising kun puduna lakpa atoppa ningthou amaga lanthengnaba chatlabadi, chattringeigi mamangda mahakna ningthou aduga maiyoknaba ngamgadra haina mahakna hanna phamthaduna khantharoidra? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Aduga mahakna maipakloidaba oiragadi, atoppa ningthou aduna lapna leiringeida karamba phibhamda ingthaba purakpa yagadage haina hangnabagidamak mahakki pao pubasingbu manakta thagani. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Matou asigumna nakhoigi maraktagi kanagumbana mahakki areiba pumnamaksing adu hek thadoktriba makeidi mahakna eigi tung-inba oiba ngamloi.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mahao mangkhraba thum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mrk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Thumdi aphaba potni, adubu mahakna mahao mangkhrabadi madubu amuk karamna mahao leihangadage? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Mahao yaodraba thumdi leibakkidamaksu aduga leihaogidamaksu karisu kannade. Amasung madu langthoknei. Tannanaba manakong panba mahak aduna tajasanu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Mangkhraba yaogi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1,2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29">Luk 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref></char>
    </note>Nongma kanggat khomba amadi atoppa papchengba pumnamakna Jisuna tambiba tananabagidamak mahakki manakta laklammi. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Maduda pharisee-sing amadi wayel yathanggi ojasingna marum marum sonduna hainarak-i, “Nupa asina papisingbu taramna ok-i amasung makhoiga chasu chaminnei!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Maduda Jisuna pandam asi makhoida hairak-i,<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Nakhoigi marakta yao chama leiba kanagumba amagi yao ama mangkhrabadi nahakna kari tougani? Nahakna atoppa yao maraphutara mapan adubu lamhangda hundoklamduna mangkhraba yao adubu phangdriphaoba thiroidra? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Aduga nahakna madubu phangba matamda adukki matik haraoduna nahakna madubu lengbanda thonggatli. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Aduga nahakna yumda halaktuna nahakki marup-mapangsing amadi keirol-leikaisingbu kouraduna makhoida hai, ‘Eina eigi mangluraba yao adu amuk hanna phangjare, aduna eikhoi haraominnasi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Eina nakhoida hairi madudi, matou adugumduna pukning hongba mathou tadaba achumba chatpa makhoi maraphutara mapandagi papchenba amana pukning hongbada swargada henna haraoba oigani.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mangkhraba senmayekki pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Nattraga lupagi senmayek tara leibi nupi amagi senmayek ama mangkhrabadi mahakna thaomei chukhattuna amadi yumdu sumjit sittuna senmayek adu phangdriba phaoba cheksinna thiroidra? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Aduga mahakna madu phangba matamda mahakna magi marup-mapangsing amadi keirol-leikaisingbu kouraduna hai, ‘Eina eigi mangluraba senmayek adu amuk phangjare, aduna eikhoi haraominnasi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Eina nakhoida hairi madudi matou adugumduna pap chengba amana paptagi pukning hongba matamda Tengban Mapugi swargadutsingna harao-i.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mangluraba machanupagi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Jisuna makha tana hairak-i, “Kanagumba nupa amagi machanupa ani leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Aduga machanupa atomba aduna mapada hairammi, ‘Ipa, Eigi phangpham thokpa lanthumgi saruk adu eingonda pibiro.’ Adudagi mapa aduna mahakki areiba lanthum adu makhoi anida yenthokpire. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Madugi matung numit kharagi matungda machanupa atomba aduna mahakki lanthumgi saruk adu yonthoktuna senpham adu puraga mayum thadoktuna chatkhre. Aduga mahakna arappa leibak amada chatuna cheksindaba punsi mahing amada hingduna maran-mathum pumnamak manghallammi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Amasung mahakki leijaba pumnamak adu sijinnathokhraba matungda leibak aduda sathina chak tangba thokle aduga mahak awatpana thallakle. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Adudagi mahakna lam aduda leiba mi amagida chattuna mahakpu thabakta sijinnabinaba haijarure amasung nupa aduna mahakpu ok sennanaba thare. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Aduga mahak adukki matik mabuk lamlammi madudi okta pijariba okchak adu chaduna mabuk thalhanninglammi. Adubu kana amatana mangonda kari amata pibiramde. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Mameithangda mahakna wakhal tarakladuna masa mathanta haijarammi, ‘Eigi ipagi anekpa minaisingna phaoba chananaba lem pana lei aduga eina maphamsida lambana sigadoure! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Eina hougattuna ipagi manakta chatlaga haigani, Ipa, eina Tengban Mapu amadi nahakki maiyokta pap toukhre. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Eihak amuk hanna nahakki nachanupa koubada matik chadre; eihakpu nahakki anekpa minai amagumna lousinbiyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Adudagi mahakna hougattuna mapagi manakta halakle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Aduga mahakna mayum yougadaba thaplingeidagi mahakna lakpa adu mapana urammi. Amasung thamoida nungsibana thalladuna mahakna machagi manakta chenthoraklaga mahakpu konsinduna chupkhi. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Matamduta machanupa aduna hairak-i, ‘Ipa, Eina Tengban Mapu amadi nahakki maiyokta pap toukhre. Eihak amuk hanna nahakki nachanupa koubada matik chadre.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Adubu mapa aduna mahakki minaisingbu kouraduna hairak-i, ‘Thuna mahakkidamak khwaidagi phaba phijol puraktuna setchinbiyu, khutsada khudop sijinbiyu amasung makhongda khong-up tongsinbiyu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Aduga masa noiba sa ama puraktuna hatlu. Eikhoina chaklen ama sinduna harao nungaiba phongdoksi. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Maramdi eigi ichanupa asi sirurabani adubu amuk hinglakle; mahak manglurabani adubu amuk phangjare.’ Adudagi makhoina harao nungaiminaba houre.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Matam aduda machanupa ahal adudi loubukta leirammi. Aduga mahakna halaktuna yum naksilaklabada isei-nongmai amasung jagoi sabagi makhol tarammi. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Adudagi mahakna manaising amabu kouduna mapham asida touribasing asi karino haina hanglammi. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Maduda manai aduna khumlak-i, ‘Nahakki nanaonupa aduk amuk halakle, aduga mahakna asoi angam karisu yaodana halakpa adugidamak nahakki napana masa noihallaba sa ama hatlibani.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Maduda machanupa ahal adu adukki matik saorammi amasung mayumda changlamde. Maram aduna mapa aduna thoraktuna mahakpu yumda changlaknaba haijarammi. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Adubu mahakna mapada hairak-i, ‘Yengngu, chahi kaya asi eina minai amagumna nahakkidamak thabak surakli aduga nongmatasu nahakki yathang indaba toukhidri. Adubu eigi marup mapangsingga chaminnaduna haraominnanaba hameng macha amatang phaoba nahakna eingonda keidoungeidasu pikhidri. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Adubu nahakki naral nathum apumba oktabi nupisingda hundokluraga halakpa nahakki nachanupa asigidamaktadi nahakna anoiba sa hattuna haraoba phongdokli.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Maduda mapa aduna mangonda khumlak-i, ‘Yengu, ichanupa, nahakti matam pumnamakta eihakka leiminnari aduga eigi areiba pumnamaksisu nahakkini. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Aduga asumna harao nungaiminnabagi thouram asisu pangthokpada matik chai, maramdi nahakki nanaonupa asi sirurabani adubu amuk hinglakle; mahak manglurabani adubu amuk phangjare.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Heisingba asin-arang touba migi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Jisuna pandam asimasu mahakki tung-inbasingda hairak-i, “Kanagumba inakhunba nupa amagi thabak asin-arang touba nupa ama leirammi. Amasung mahakki asin arang touba nupa asina mahakki maran mathum manghalle haiduna inakhunba nupa aduda kanagumba amana tamlammi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Maram aduna mahakna thabak asin-arang touba nupa adubu kouraduna hairak-i, ‘Eina nanggi maramda taribasi karino? Nahakna yumgi thabak asin arang toubagi chaga-chading pumnamak piyu maramdi nahak makha-tana eigi asin aran touba mi oiba yararoi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Maduda thabak asin arang touba nupa aduna mathanta khanjarammi, ‘Eina houjik kari tougani? Eigi mapu asina eibu thabaktagi louthoklagani. Leibak touba ngambagi panggalsu eingonda leite aduga nibasu ikaijei. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Um! Houjikti mana eibu thabaktagi louthoklaba tungda misingna eibu makhoi makhoigi mayumda lousinbinanaba eina kari tougadage haibadu ei khangle.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Maram aduna mahakna mahakki mapugi lal tonba makhoi khudingmakpu kourammi. Aduga mahakna ahanba aduda hanglak-i, ‘Nahakna Ibungogi lal kaya yamna tollibage?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Nupa aduna khumlak-i, ‘Chorphon thao gallon chanipan tolli.’ Maduda mahakna nupa aduda haikhi, ‘Nahakki ayiba che adu sida leire, thuna phamthaduna madu chamari yangkheida oihallo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Adudagi mahakna atoppa amada amuk hanglak-i, ‘Aduga nahakkina kaya tollibage?’ Nupa aduna khumlak-i, ‘Gehu bora lising amamuk tolli.’ Maduna mahakna nupa aduda haikhi, ‘Nahakki ayiba che adu sida leire, madu nahakna chanipanda oihallo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Madugi mahei oina mapu aduna pukchel sengdaba thabak asin arang touba nupa adubu asigumba heisingba thabak asigidamak thagatlammi. Maramdi taibangpan asigi machasingna makhoigi mirol asida mangalgi machasingdagi henna sing-i.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, asumna nakhoina taibangpanbagi lan thum sijinnaduna nakhoi nasagidamak marup semmu aduga langi kanapham leitraba matam aduda makhoina nakhoibu lomba naidaba yumda lousinbigani. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Khajiktada thajaba yaba mahak adu ayambadasu thajaba yabani aduga khajiktada pukchel sengdaba mahak adu ayambadasu pukchel sengdabani. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Aduga nakhoina taibangpanba asigi lan-thum sijinnabada thajaba yaba oidrabadi kanana nakhoida asengba lan adu sinnabada thajagadage? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Aduga atoppa misinggi lanthumda nakhoibu thajaba yaba oidrabadi kanana nakhoida nasagi oiba lan-thum pibigani?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref></char></note>Minai kananasu mapu anigi thougal touba ngamde. Maramdi mahakna amabu tukachagani aduga amabuna nungsigani nattraga amabu luna ningjaraga amabuna thaoiroi. Nakhoina Tengban Mapu amadi lan animakpu punna thougal touba ngamloi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi atei paotak khara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mrk 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Pharisee-singna masi pumnamaksing asi tabada makhoina Jisubu noknarammi maramdi makhoi sel-thumda ngaojarammi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina misinggi mamangda achumba chatpa sasinnei adubu Tengban Mapuna nakhoigi thamoi khang-i. Maramdi misingna mamal leina loujaba potsaksing adu Tengban Mapugi mityengdadi tukkachaningaini.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Baptize toubiba Johngi matam adu phaoba Moses-ki wayel yathangsing amadi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousinggi wa adu sandoklammi. Adubu houjikti Tengban Mapu leibakki aphaba pao adu sandokli aduga mipum khudingna maduda changnanaba hotnari. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat 5:18</ref></char></note> Wayel yathanggi khwaidagi pikpa saruk ama mangkhibadagidi swarga amadi malem taibangpan mangkhibana henna lai.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Cor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char>
    </note>“Kanagumba nupa amana mahakki nupibu khainaraga atoppa nupi amaga luhonglabadi mahakna lannabagi thabak tou-i; aduga mapuroibaga khainarabi nupi louba nupa adusu lannabagi thabak tourabani.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inakhunba nupa amadi Lazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Matam amada atangba masaknaiba mangra machu amadi mugamanbigi phirol setpa kanagumba inak-khunba nupa ama leirammi. Mahakna matam pumba awatpa leitana nungai yaiphana pallammi. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Aduga mahakki thongalda Lazarus kouba masa pumba patpa lairaba nupa amasu hiptuna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Mahakna Inak-khunba nupa adugi chanaba phandagi tarakpa acha athak makup matasing adu chajanaba asha toujarammi. Aduga huisingna laktuna mahakki apatpa adu leklammi. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Adudagi nongma lairaba nupa adu sirammi amasung swargadutsingna mahakpu Abrahamgi mathada pukhre. Aduga inak-khunba nupa adusu siraduna phumle. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Amasung khamnung leibakta mahakna awaba khangduna mathakta yengkhatpa matamda thapna Abraham amasung mahakki nakanda Lazarus leiba urammi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Maduda inak-khunba nupa aduna laorak-i, ‘Ipa Abraham! Eibu nungsibiyu aduga Lazarus-na mahakki khudombi isingda luptuna eigi irei asibu ingthahanbinaba mahakpu thabirak-u, maramdi meiri marak asida ei yamna ware.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Adubu Abrahamna khumlak-i, ‘Ningsing-u ichanupa, nahakna hinglingei matamda aphaba pot pumnamak phangkhi aduga Lazarus-nadi phattaba pumnamak phangkhi. Adubu mahakna houjikti mapham asida nungngaiba phangle aduga nahakna awa meichak khangli. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Pumnamak asigi mathakta mapham asidagi nakhoigi manakta chatningba misingna chatpa ngamdanaba aduga mapham adudagi eikhoigi inakta lakningbasingna lakpa ngamdananaba lukhraba kom ama lei.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Maduda inak-khunba nupa aduna hairak-i, ‘Adu oirabadi eina nangonda haijari, Ipa Abraham, nahakna Lazaras-pu eigi ipagi yumda thabiyu. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Maramdi eigi ichin-inao manga lei, aduga makhoina awa meichakki mapham asida laktananaba makhoida mahakna cheksin-wa haihanbiyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abraham-na hairak-i, ‘Nahakki nachin-nanaosinggi maphamda cheksin wa hainabagidamak Moses amasung Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousing lei, makhoigi wa adu nahakki nachin-nanaosingna tasanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Inak-khunba nupa aduna khumlak-i, ‘Natte ipa Abraham, madukhaktanadi yaroi! Adubu asibasinggi maraktagi kanagumba amana makhoida chatlabadi makhoina paptagi pukning honggani.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Adubu Abrahamna mangonda hairak-i, ‘Makhoina Moses amadi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousinggi wa tadrabadi kanagumbana sibadagi hinggatlabasu makhoibu thajahanba ngamloi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Pap amasung kokpibagi maramda tambiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Nongma Jisuna mahakki tung-inbasingda hairak-i, “Misingbu papta tahanba athembasingdi adumak lakkani, adubu masi thok-halliba mahak adudi awabanida! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Mahakna apikpa angangsing asigi maraktagi amabu papta tahallabadi, mahakki mangakta achouba chakri nung ama yansillaga achouba ipakta thadabana mahakkidamak henna phei. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref></char></note>Maram aduna nasamak cheksillu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Karigumba nahakki nachin nanaona pap tourabadi mahakpu warak watembiyu. Aduga mahakna pukning honglabadi mahakpu kokpiyu. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Mahakna nahakki nathakta nongmada pap taretlak touraba aduga atouba khudingmakta mahakna nagonda laktuna, ‘Ei pukning hongjare’ haijarabadi nahakna mahakpu kokpigadabani.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thajaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Pakhonchatpasing aduna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Eikhoigi thajaba hengathanbiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Maduda Ibungona khumlak-i, “Nakhoida hangam marumuk chaoba thajaba leirabadi nakhoina kabrangchak pambi asida nasana maru phukchaduna achouba ipakta houru haibada pambi asina nakhoigi yathang ingani.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minai amagi mathoudang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Nakhoigi maraktagi amagi lou khoiba nattraga yao senba minai ama lei haina khallasi. Aduga minai aduna loubuktagi halakpa matamda nahakna minai aduda thuna laktuna chak chananaba phamlo haigadra? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Hairoi nattra! Madugi mahutta mahakna minai aduda haigani, ‘Eigi chaklen thourang tou, aduga thourang toujaduna eina chari thaklingeida eibu thougal tou; aduga madu loiraga nahak amuk chaba yagani.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Aduga minai aduna mangonda tounaba haibasing adu inbagidamak mapu aduna mahakpu thagatkadra? Thagatkani haina eina khande. <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Maram aduna, matou asigumduna nakhoida tounanaba haikhiba pumnamaksing adu pangthokpa matamda nakhoinasu haiyu, ‘Eikhoi matik chadaba minaisingni, eikhoina eikhoigi ithoudangsing adu pangthokchaba khaktani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mioi tarabu anaba phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Adudagi Jisuna Jerusalem tamna asum lakpada Samaria amadi Galilee-gi tainapham maphamdu phaoduna chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Aduga mahakna khunggang amada changlakpa matamda tamthiba unsagi leinana naba makhoi taraga thengnarammi. Amasung makhoina lapna lepladuna, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>khonjel houna kouraduna hairak-i, “Jisu! Ibungo! Eikhoibu nungsibiyu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Levi 14:1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga Ibungona makhoibu ubada makhoida hairak-i, “Chatlu aduga nakhoi nasamakpu purohitta utcharu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Amasung makhoina lambida asum chatlingeida makhoigi anaba adu sengjare. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Aduga makhoigi maraktagi amana mahakki anabadu Jisuna phahanbire haibadu ujabada mahakna Ibungogi manakta halaktuna khonjel houna Tengban Mapubu thagatlak-i. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Mahakna Jisugi khuyakhada tuthajaduna mahakpu thagatcharammi. Amasung nupa adu Samaria-gi mi oirammi. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Eina makhoi taramakpu senghanbikhiba nattra? Aduga atoppa mapan adudi kadai? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Atoppa phurupki nupa asi nattana Tengban Mapubu thagatnanaba atei kana amata halaktrabra?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Adudagi Jisuna nupa aduda hairak-i, “Hougattuna chatcharo, nahakki thajabana nahakpu phahanbire.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi Leibak lakpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Nongma pharisee kharana Tengban Mapugi leibak adu karamba matamda lakkadage haina hangbada Jisuna khumlak-i, “Tengban Mapugi Leibak adu uba ngamba phibamsingga loinana lakte. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Aduga mi kana amatana ‘Yengu, asisa leire nattraga maduda leire’ haina haiba ngamloi; maramdi Tengban Mapugi leibak adu nakhoigi nungda lei.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Adudagi Ibungona mahakki tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, “Migi Machanupa adugi numitsing adudagi numit amabu nakhoina yamna ujaningba matam ama lakkani, adubu nakhoina madu uroi. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Amasung misingna nakhoida haigani, ‘Yengu mahak asida leire, nattraga yengu mahak aduda leire!’ Adubu nakhoina madu yengnabagidamak chatthokkanu, makhoigi matung inganu. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Maramdi atiyagi nakal amada nongthang kuppada nakal adudagi atoppa nakal amagi ngamkhei phaoba nganbagumna Migi Machanupa adugi numit adusu matou adugumna oigani.” <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Adubu ahanbada mahakna awa-anang kaya khangba tai amasung miron asina mahakpu inthokpa tai. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Meihou 6:5-8</ref></char></note>Noah-gi haktakta oikhiba adugumna migi Machanupa adugi numit adusu adugumna oigani. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Meihou 7:6-24</ref></char></note>Noah-na hijao adugi manungda changdringei matam adu phaoba misingna cha-thaktuna, luhongduna amadi luhongnabagidamak piduna leirammi. Adudagi ising ichao laktuna makhoi pumnamakpu manghankhi. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28,29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Meihou 18:20–19:25</ref></char></note>Matou adugumduna Lotki matamdasu thokkhi. Misingna cha-thaktuna, lei-yonduna, mahei-marong thaduna amadi yum saduna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Aduga Lot-na Sodom thadokpa numit aduda atiyadagi mei amadi kantrukki nong taraktuna makhoi pumnamakpu manghankhi. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Asumna Migi Machanupa adubu phongdokpa numit adudasu oigani.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mat 24:17</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mrk 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char></note>Numit aduda yumthakta leiba mahakna mapot-machei lounanaba imungda amuk kumthadasanu; matou asigumduna loubukta leiba mahakna yumda amuk halaktasanu. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Meihou 19:26</ref></char></note>Lot-ki nupibu ningsingu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mrk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char></note>Kanagumba mathawai kanjaningba mahak aduna madubu mangjagani, aduga mathawai mangjaba mahak aduna madubu phangjagani. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, ahing aduda phamung amada mi ani hipminnagani, aduga mi amabu pukhigani aduga amabuna thanamgani. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Nupi ani chakkri takminnagani, amasung nupi amabu pukhigani aduga amabuna thanamgani.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Mi ani loubukta thabak suminnagani; amabu pukhigani, aduga atoppa amabu thanamgani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lairik kharada verse asi hapte.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Maduda tung-inbasingduna hanglak-i, “Masi kadaida thokkadabano, Ibungo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Jisuna khumlak-i, “Asiba hakchang leiba mapham aduda langjasingna tingani.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Wayen Mapu amasung lukhrabigi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakki tung inbasing aduda, matam pumnamakta haijagadabani aduga keidounungda pukning hantharoidabani haiba tambinaba pandam ama hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>“Karigumba Sahar amada Tengban Mapu kidaba migidamak karisu khandaba wayel mapu ama leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Aduga sahar adumaktada lukhrabi amasu leirammi. Mahakna wayen mapu aduda tattana laktuna, ‘Eihakki yeknabagi mathakta achumba wayel toubiyu’ haina haijarammi. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Matam kuina wayen mapu aduna yaramde adubu mameidadi mahak masa mathanta haijarammi, ‘Eina Tengban Mapubu kidrabasu aduga migidamak karisu khandrabasu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>lukhrabi asina eingonda awaba piduna leibagi maramna mahakkidamak ei achumba wayel tourage. Eina masi toudragadi mahakna asum laktuna eibu yetlaragani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Adudagi Ibungona makha tana hairak-i, “Wayel chumdaba mapu aduna haiba adu tao. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Adunadi Tengban Mapuda ahing nungthil animakta mateng panbinaba haijariba Ibungo masamakki khandokkhraba mising adugidamak mahakna achumba wayel toubiroidra? Mahakna makhoibu mateng pangbada thinthaduna leigadra? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, mahakna makhoigidmak achumba wayel thunamak toubigani. Adubu Migi Machanupa aduna lakpa matamda malem asida mangonda thajaba mi mahakna phanggadra?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee amasung kangat khomba migi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Adudagi Jisuna masa mathantabu achumba chatpani haina thajajaba aduga mi ateibuna hanthana khanba makhoising aduda pandam asimasu hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Nupa anikhak Mapugi Sanglenda haijanabagidamak kakhatlammi. Nupa amana phariseeni aduga amna kanggat khombani. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Adudagi pharisee aduna lepkhattuna masagi maramda asumna haijakhi, ‘Tengban Mapu, eina nangbu thagatchari, eidi atoppa misinggumna namja-namtheknaba, pukchel sengdaba, amasung nupi lannaba mi natte aduga mapham asida leiriba kanggat khomba mi asigumbasu natte. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Eina chayol amada anirak chara helli aduga eigi leijaba pumnamakki saruk taragi ama nangonda pi.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Adubu kanggat khomba adunadi lapna leplaga mamai phaoba swargaromda yengkhatchaba ngamjadana leirammi aduga mahakna mathabak yeijaraduna hairak-i, ‘Tengban Mapu, papchenba eibu chanbiyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref></char></note>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, madudi pharisee adu nattaduna kanggat khomba adubu Tengban Mapuna achumba chatpa oina singthanabiduna mayumda hankhirammi. Maramdi masa mathantabu chaohanjaba mi adubu nollukhangani aduga masa mathanta nollukchaba mi adubu chaohanbigani.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna angangsingbu yaipha thoujal pibiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Nongma mioi kharana makhoigi apikpa angangsingbu Jisuna khut thambiduna yaipha-thoujal pihannabagidamak Jisugi nakta puraklammi. Ibungogi tung-inbasing aduna madu ubada makhoida cheirammi. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Adubu Jisuna makhoibu kousinduna hairak-i, “Apikpa angangsingna eigi inakna lakchasanu, makhoibu khamganu, maramdi Tengban Mapugi leibak adu makhoi asigumbasinggini. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, apikpa angang amagumna Tengban Mapugi leibak adubu lousindaba kanagumba amatana Tengban Mapugi leibakta khak changloi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inakkhunba nupa amana lomnaidaba punsi thiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mrk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Nongma Jihudigi luchingba amana Jisuda asumna hanglammi, “Aphaba Oja Ibungo, lomba naidaba punsi phangjanaba eina kari toujagadage?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Karigi nangna eingonda aphaba haina kouribano? Tengban Mapu nattana aphaba kana amata leite. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Khong 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Aniwa 5:16-20</ref></char></note>Nahakna Tengban Mapugi wayel yathangsing asi khang-i: ‘Mitu-miwa lannaganu, mi hatkanu, huran-ganu, aranba sakhi piganu, amasung nama napabu ikai khumnou.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Nupa aduna khumlak-i, “Eina angang oiringeidagi houna hairiba wayel yathang pumnamaksing asi ngakcharak-i.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Jisuna mahakki paokhum adu tarabada nupa aduda hairak-i, “Houjik nahakna tougadaba ama watli. Nahakki leijaba pumba yonthoklaga sel adu lairabasingda pithok-u, adu oirabadi swargada nahakki lan leigani; aduga lak-u, eigi itung illu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Adubu nupa aduna madu tabada pukning yamna warammi, maramdi mahak inak yamna khunlammi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Maduda nupa aduna pukning yamna waba adu Jisuna uraduna hairakki, “Inakkhunba misingna Tengban Mapugi leibakta changba kayada lukhrabano! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Inakkhunba mi amana Tengban Mapugi leibakta changbabudi ut amana yetum manada litpana henna lai.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Maduda wa adu taba mising aduna hairak-i, “Adu oirabadi kanana kanbiba phangba ngamgadage?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Jisuna khumlak-i, “Mioibagi maphamda oithoktaba adu Tengban Mapugi maphamdadi oithokpa ngaktani.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Maduda Peter-na hairak-i, “Yengbiyu, eikhoina eikhoigi leijaba pumnamak thadoktuna Ibungogi tung injari.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, Tengban Mapu leibakkidamak mayum-makei, nattraga mama-mapa, nattraga machin-manao, nattraga nupi- angang thadoklaga <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>mahakna taibangpanda leiringei matamda madudagi saruk yamna henna phangloidaba amasung lakkadaba matam aduda lomba naidaba punsi phangloidaba mi kana amata leite.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mahakna sigadabagi maramda ahumlaksuba oina phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Adudagi Jisuna tung-inba taranithoi adubu tonganna puthokladuna makhoida hairak-i, “Yengu, eikhoina Jerusalem-da chatli, aduga Migi Machanupa adugi maramda Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingna irambasing adu thunglagani. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Mahakpu Jihudi nattaba phurupsinggi makhutta pithokkani. Makhoina mahakpu noknagani, ikaiba pigani amasung tin sitchingani. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Makhoina mahakpu phugani amasung mahakpu hatkani, aduga humnisuba numitta mahakna amuk hinggatkani.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Adubu tung-inbasing aduna hairibasing adu amata khangba ngamlamde. Waheising adugi nunggi oiba wahandok adu makhoida lotlammi amasung Ibungona hairiba adugi maramda makhoina khangba ngamkhide.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna mamit tangba chakniba amabu phahanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Aduga Jisuna Jericho naksillaklabada mimit tangba nupa ama chakniduna lambi mapanda phamduna leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Mahakna miyam amana lambi aduda chatpagi khonjel adu tabada, mahakna kari thoklabage haiduna hanglammi.<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Maduda makhoina mangonda hairak-i, “Nazareth-ki Jisu chatli.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Maduda mahakna laoraduna hairak-i, “David-ki Machanupa, Jisu! Eibu chanbiyu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Maduda mang thaduna chatlibasing aduna cheiraduna mahakpu tumin leinanaba hairammi. Adubu mahakna hennadum houna laorak-i, “David-ki Machanupa! Eibu chanbiyu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Maduda Jisuna chatlambadagi lepladuna mahakpu puraknaba yathang pirammi. Aduga mahakna manakta laklabada, Jisuna mangonda hanglak-i, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Eina nanggidamak kari toubiba nahakna pambage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Mahakna khumlak-i, “Oja Ibungo, eihakna mit ujaba pamjei.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Nahak uba phangjaro, nahakki thajabana nahakpu phahanbire.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Khudak adumaktada nuba adu uba phangjare, aduga Tengban Mapubu thagatchaduna Jisugi tung injare. Aduga madu ubada miyam adunasu Tengban Mapubu thagatcharammi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu amadi Zacchaeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Adudagi Jisuna Jericho-da changduna sahar adu phaoduna chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Aduga mapham aduda maiming Zacchaeus kouba kanggat khombasinggi makok oiba inak-khunba nupa ama leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Mahakna Jisu kanano haibadu yengnanaba hotnarammmi adubu miyam adugi maramna mahakna Jisubu uba phanglamde. Maramdi mahak marep nemba mi oirammi <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Maram aduna mahakna mang thana chenkhiduna Jisubu unanaba lambi mapanda houba heibong pambi amada kakhatle, maramdi Jisu lambi aduda lakkadourammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Aduga Jisuna mapham adu yourakpa matamda mahakna mathakta yengkhatladuna hairak-i, “Zacchaeus, thuna khumtharak-u, ei ngasi nanggi yumda thungba tare.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Adudagi Zacchaeus-na kumtharaktuna Ibungobu yamna haoraobaga loinana taramna okchare. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Aduga madu uba mi pumnamakna murum murum sonba hourak-i, “Nupa asina pappi asigi yumda thungnanaba chatkhre!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Adudagi Zacchaeusna hougatladuna Ibungoda hairak-i, “Yengbiyu, Ibungo, Eina eigi leijaba lan-thumgi saruk tangkhai ama lairabasingda pijagani, aduga eina kanagumbabu kanggat louba matamda minamlabadi eina mangonda senpham adu saruk mari hanbigani.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Ngasi imung asida aran-khubham lakle, maramdi nupa asina mahak masamak Abrahamgi asengba machani haibadu utchare. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mat 18:11</ref></char></note>Maramdi Migi Machanupa adu mangkhraba adubu thinaba amadi kanbinaba lakpani.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minai Taragi Pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Miyam aduna Ibungona haibadu taringeida makha tana makhoida pandam amasu hairammi. Maramdi Ibungona Jerusalem naksillaklammi, amasung Tengban Mapugi leibak adu thuna uragani haina makhoina khallammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Maram aduna Ibungona hairak-i, “Kanagumba awangba pham paiba nupa amana ningthou khubam lourunaba aduga amuk halaknaba thourangduna arappa leibak amada chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Mahakna chatringeida mahakki manai tarabu kouraga sanagi senmayek amamam piraduna hairak-i, ‘Eina chatkhringeida masina sel kaya tanba ngambage haibadu yeng-u.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Adubu mahak masamakki misingna mahakpu yengthirammi aduga mahakna eikhoigi ningthou oiba pamde haina haihallunabagidamak mahakki tungda pao pubasing tharammi.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Adudagi nupa aduna ningthou phamthol phanglaba matungda mayumda halaklammi. Aduga mahakna sel piramba manaising aduna sel kaya kaya yamna tonglabage haibadu khangnanaba makhoibu manakta kouraknaba yathang pirammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Aduga ahanba manai aduna laktuna hairak-i, ‘Ibungo, eina nahakna piramba sanagi senmayek ama aduna tara tongba ngamjare.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Maduda mabungo aduna hairak-i, ‘Nahakna yamna phajana toure, eigi aphaba inai. Nahakna thabak machada thajaba yabagi maramna sahar taragi mathakta mapu oijaro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Adudagi anisuba manai adu laktuna hairak-i, ‘Ibungo, eina nahakna piramba sanagi senmayek ama aduna manga tongba ngamjare.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Maduda mabungo aduna hairak-i, ‘Nahaksu sahar mangagi mathakta mapu oijaro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Aduga atoppa manai ama laktuna hairak-i, ‘Ibungo, yengbiyu, nahakki sanagi senmayek adu asida leijare; eina masibu phi macha amada lottuna thamlambani. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Maramdi nahak sathiba mi oibanina eina nangbu kijarammi. Nahakna nahakki nattaba adu lou-i aduga hunkhidaba adu lok-i.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Maduda mabungo aduna hairak-i, ‘He phattaba manai! Nahak nasamakki wahei aduna eina nahakpu wayengani. Nahakna eibu eigi nattaba adubu louba aduga eina hunkhidaba adubu lokpa shathiba mini haiba khanglibanine? <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Adu oirabadi karigi nangna sel adu sel tungsinphamda thamlamdribano? Adu oiramlabadi eina halakpada madu sendoiga loinana phanglamgadabani.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Adudagi mahakna leplibasing aduda hairak-i, ‘Minai asidagi sanagi sen mayek adu louthoktuna sanagi senmayek tara leiba mangonda piyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Adubu makhoina mangonda hairak-i, ‘Ibungo, mahakki senmayek tara hanna leire.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mrk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char></note>Maduda mahakna hairak-i. ‘Eina nakhoida hairibasini madudi areiba mi khudingmakta hennadum henna pibigani, aduga leitaba mahak adudagi mahakki areiba khara adu phaoba louthokkani. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Aduga eina ningthou oiba pamdaba eigi yeknabasing adubu mapham asida puraktuna makhoibu eigi imang asida hatlu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna lola tongduna Jerusalem-da changba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Jisuna wa asi hairaba matungda mang tharaduna Jerusalem maikei panglammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Aduga Ibungona Chorphon Chingda leiba Bethphage amasung Bethany naksillaklabada, tung-inba anibu mangjounana wa asi hairaduna tharammi, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>“Nakhoigi mangda leiriba khun aduda chatlu, aduga nakhoina maduda hek changbaga mi kana amatana tongdriba lola macha ama punduna leiba nakhoina thengnagani. Madu thouri thoktuna eigi nakta purak-u. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Aduga kanagumbana nakhoida karigi madu thouri thoklibano haina hanglaklabadi, Ibungona masi mathou tai haina mangonda haiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Aduga makhoina chatkhiduna Jisuna makhoida haikhiba adumak thengnare. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Amasung makhoina lola macha adu thouri thoklingeida mapusingna laktuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina lola macha adugi thouri adu karigi thoklibano?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Ibungona masi mathou tai” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Aduga makhoina lola macha adu Jisugi nakta purakle. Adudagi makhoina lola adugi mathakta makhoigi maphi thaduna Jisubu tonghalle. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Amasung Ibungona asum chatlingeida miyam aduna makhoigi maphising lambi aduda tharammi.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Aduga Ibungona Jerusalem nasillaklabada, chorphon chinggi kumthapham lambi leiriba mapham aduda Ibungogi tung-inba miyam aduna makhoina ukhiba matik leiba thabaksing adugidamak haraona Tengban Mapubu khonjel wangna thagatpa hourak-i:<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Isei 118:26</ref></char></note>MAPU IBUNGO-gi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehovah</char></note> mingda lenglakliba ningthou adu yaiphabani!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Oire swargada ingthaba amadi Tengban Mapuda matik mangal!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Adudagi miyam adugi maraktagi pharisee kharana Jisuda hanglak-i, “Oja Ibungo, nahakki tung-inbasing asibu tuminna leinaba cheibiyu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida hairibasini, karigumba makhoina tuminna leirabasu nungsing asina laorakkani.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Jerusalem-gidamak tengthaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Adudagi Jisuna sahar adu naksillaklammi amasung mahakna sahar adu ubada sahar adugidamak kapladuna, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>hairak-i, “Numit asida, nahak khaktana oiraba phaoba, ingthabagi lambi adu khanglamlabadiko! Adubu houjikti madu nahakki mityengdagi lotkhre. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Maramdi Nahakki yeknabasingna nahakki akoibada pal khajingadaba, nahakpu thattuna amasung maikei pumnamaktagi nahakpu koisinduna thamgadaba numitsing adu lakkani. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Makhoina nahakpu amadi chekpal manungda leiriba nachasing pumnamakpu pummang manghallagani, makhoina nung amaphaoba maphamduda lonnaduna thanamloi. Maramdi Tengban Mapuna nahakpu kanbiba lakkhiba matam adu nahakna khangkhide.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Mapugi Sanglen sengdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mrk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Adudagi Jisuna Mapugi Sanglenda changduna lalonbagi thabak touriba masing adubu tanthokpa horammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note>Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Mapugi puyada masi iduna lei, ‘Eigi yumbu haijanabagi yum kougani’ adubu nakhoina masibu huranbasinggi makon oihalle.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk 21:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Numit khudinggi Ibungona Mapugi Sanglenda tambirammi. Adubu athoiba purohitsing, wayen yathanggi ojasing amadi miyamgi luchingbasingna Ibungobu hatnanaba hotnarammi. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Adumakpu makhoina madu pangthoknaba lambi amata phanglamde, maramdi mi pumnamakna Ibungogi ngangba adu wahei amata phaoba chithadana adumak tadunata leirammi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisugi matikki maramda wahang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mrk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Nongma Mapugi Sanglenda Jisuna miyamda tambiduna amadi aphaba pao sandoktuna leiringeida, athoiba purohit amadi wayen-yathanggi ojasingna ahal lamansingga loinana punna lakladuna, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Ibungoda hairak-i, “Nahakna kari matik leiduna pumnamaksing asi touribano? Eikhoida haiyu. Kanana nangonda matik adu pibage?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i. “Eisu nakhoida wahang ama hangge, nakhoi eingonda khummu, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>John-na baptize toubagi matik adu swargadagira nattraga misingdagira?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Maduda makhoina makhoi masel khannaraduna hainarammi, “Eikhoina kari haigadage? Eikhoina swargadagini hairagadi, mahakna eikhoida haigani, ‘Adu oirabadi nakhoina mahakpu karigi thajadribano?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Aduga eikhoina madu misingdagini hairagadi mi pumnamakna eikhoibu nungna thagani, maramdi mi pumnamakna Johnbu Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou amani haina lou-i.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Maram aduna makhoina khumlak-i, “Eikhoina madu kadaidagino haiba khangde.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Adu oirabadi, eina karamba itik leiduna pumnamaksing asi touribano haibadu einasu hairaroi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angur ingkholgi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adudagi Jisuna mising aduda amuk onsillaktuna pandam asi hairak-i, “Kanagumba nupa amana anggur ingkhol ama koirammi. Aduga mahakna madu sandoklamlaga mayum thadoktuna arappa lam amada matam kuina chatkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Adudagi anggur mahei lokpa matam youraklabada mahakna mahakki manai amabu anggur ingkhol koibasing adudagi mahakki angur saruk lourunaba tharammi. Adubu makhoina manai adubu phuraga khut hangna halhankhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Maram aduna mahakna atoppa manai ama amuk tharammi; adubu mahakpusu phuduna ikaiba piraga khut hangna thakhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Adudagi mahakna ahumsuba manai ama amuk tharammi; aduga makhoina mahakpu thina asok-apan nanghanduna mapanda langthoklammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Adudagi anggur ingkholgi mapu aduna mathanta hangjarak-i, ‘Eina houjik kari tousige? Eina eigi nungsijaraba ichanupabu tharage, mahakpudi makhoina ikai khumnabibasu yai.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Adubu ingkhol koibasing aduna mahakpu ubada makhoi masel tanaduna hainarammi, ‘Mahak asi yulep charani. Eikhoina mahakpu hatlasi, adu oirabadi mahakki lan adu eikhoigi oihouragani.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Maram aduna makhoina mahakpu anggur ingkholgi mapanda chingthoklammi aduga mahakpu hatlammi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Adu oiragadi ingkholgi mapu aduna makhoida houjik kari tougadage? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Mahakna chattuna ingkhol koibasing adubu hattuna anggur ingkhol adu atoppa ingkhol koibasingda pithokkani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Hairiba adu tabada, mising aduna hairak-i, “Madu keidounungda oidasanu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Isei 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga Jisuna makhoida yengladuna hairak-i, “Adu oiragadi Mapugi puyada iduna leiriba wa asigi wahandok adu karino?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Yumsabasingna kanadare haiduna langsekpa nung adu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">Oirakle khwaidagi maruoiba chithekki nung.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Nung aduda tuba mi khudingmakna machet tana kaigani aduga nung aduna nanba mahak aduna makup tana takkhaigani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanggat thibagi maramda wahang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrk 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Wayen yathanggi ojasing amadi athoiba purohitsingna Ibungobu khudakta phananaba lambi thirammi maramdi pandam adu Ibungona makhoigi mathakta haibani haiba makhoi khanglammi. Adubu makhoina misingbu kirammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Maram aduna makhoina khudongchaba ama yengduna leirammi. Aduga makhoina Ibungogi waheida asoiba thiduna mahakpu phaduna Rome-gi leingak mapugi pangal amadi matikta pithoknanaba pukchel sengba mi sasinnaba lanjabasing tharammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Aduga lanjabasing aduna Jisuda hairak-i, “Oja Ibungo, Nahakti achumba ngangi amasung chumna tambi, aduga nahakna michang mikhai naide adubu Tengban Mapugi lambi adu chumna tambi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Eikhoida haibiyu, eikhoina Caesar-da kanggat thiba asi eikhoigi wayel yathanggi maiyoktara, nattabra?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Adubu Jisuna makhoigi lounam adu khangladuna makhoida hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Eingonda denari ama utlu. Yeng-u, masida namliba saktam amasung maming asi kanagino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Maduda makhoina khumlak-i, “Caesar-gini”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Phare, adu oirabadi Caesar-gi oiba aduna Caesar-da katlo aduga Tengban Mapugi oiba aduna Tengban Mapuda katlo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Aduga Ibungogi paokhumda asoiba phangdabana miyam mangda makhoina Ibungobu phaba ngamkhide. Amasung makhoina Ibungogi paokhum aduda ingak ngakladuna tuminna leikhi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sibadagi hinggatpagi maramda wahang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Pakhon 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adudagi sibadagi hinggatpa haibasi leite hairiba sadducee-sing khara Jisugi manakta laktuna hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Aniwa 25:5</ref></char></note>Oja Ibungo, Moses-na eikhoigidamak yathang asi ibirammi madudi: ‘Kanagumba nupa amana macha amata thamlamdana magi nupibu thanamlaga sikhiba thoklabadi, hairiba nupa asigi charol-surol thamlamnabagidamak magi machil-manaona lukrabi asibu amuk lougadabani.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Adu oirabadi, nupa amagi machin manao taret leirammi. Adudagi mayamba ahal adu nupi thire adubu macha amata thamamdana sikhre. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Aduga nupi adu machin-manao anisuba aduna amuk loure, adubu mahaksu macha thamamdana sire. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Adudagi ahumsuba adunasu mahakpu loure. Matou adugumna makhoi taretmakna loure, aduga macha amata thamamadana sire. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Aduga ikon konbada nupi adusu sire. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Adu oirabadi, houjik asibasingna hinggatlakpa numit aduda nupi asi kanagi nupi oigadage, maramdi makhoi taretmakna mahakpu makhoigi nupi oina lourammi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Chak asidadi misingna luhong-i, aduga machasingbu luhongnaba thajei-yonjei. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Adubu sibadagi hinggatpada amadi lakkadaba matam aduda leibada matik chaba nupa nupising adunadi maduda luhonglaroi. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Makhoina amuk hanna siraroi, maramdi makhoi swardutsinggum oigani. Makhoi Tengban Mapugi machasing oigani maramdi makhoina sibadagi hinggatle. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Khong 3:6</ref></char></note>Aduga asiba misingna hinggatli haibadu Mosesmaknasu mayek sengna utkhre. Mei chakpa mongsong yaoba Mapugi Puyagi saruk aduda Moses-na Mapu Ibungoda Abraham-gi Tengban Mapu, Isaac-ki Tengban Mapu, amasung Jacob-ki Tengban Mapu haina koukhi. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Maram aduna mahakti asibasinggi Tengban Mapu natte adubu ahingbasinggi Tengban Mapuni maramdi mahakki maphamdadi pumnamak hing-i.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Maduda wayen-yathanggi oja kharana hairak-i, “Ibungo, nahakna yamna phajana haire” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Madugi matung mi kana amatana Ibungoda wahang hangnabagi thouna leiramde.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtagi maramda wahang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-37">Mrk 1:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida hanglaki, “Makhoina kamdouna Christta adu David-ki machanupani hairibano? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42,43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Isei 110:1</ref></char></note>Maramdi David masamakna Thagat Iseigi lairikta asumna phongdok-i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘MAPU IBUNGO-na eigi Ibungoda hai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Phammu, nahakna eigi yet thangbada,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>Oihandriphaoba eina nahakki yeknabasingbu, nahakki khonggi khongnetpham.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>David-na mahakpu ‘Ibungo’ haina kourabadi, Kamdouna mahakna David-ki macha oigadouribano?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayel yathanggi ojasinggi phattaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Aduga miyam aduna Ibungogi wa taringeida Ibungona mahakki tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Wayel yathanggi ojasing adudagi cheksillu. Makhoina achonba phi settuna koina chatpa amadi keithelnachingba maphamsingda misingna makhoibu ikai khumnabaga loinana koubirakpa adu pammi, Aduga Jihudisinggi tinnapham sanglen synagogue-singda akhannaba phamphamda phamba amadi chak khangphamda ikai khumnaba misinggi phamphamda phamba makhoina pammi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Makhoina lukhrabisingdagi khudongchaba louduna mayum-makei mulli, aduga misingna unanaba tousinaduna Tengban Mapuda haijaba adu sangna haijei. Asigumba mising asina henna kanba cheirak phanggani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Lukrabigi katchaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mrk 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Jisuna Mapugi Sanglenda koina yengbada inak-khunba misingna Mapugi Sanglengi sel thadaphamda makhoigi khudolsing thadaba urammi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Aduga yamna lairabi lukhrabi amanasu apikpa korigi senmayek ani thadaba Ibugona urammi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Maduda Ibungona hairak-i, “Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, lairabi lukhrabi asina atei pumnamaktagi khwaidagi henna yamna katchare. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Maramdi ateising aduna makhoigi marang kaiba langeidagi khaidoktuna saruk kharatamak pire; adubu nupi asinadi lairajarabasu mahakki leijaba pumnamak haibadi mahakki hingbada changliba areiba pumba katchare.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mapugi Sanglen thugaigadaba mangjounana phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mrk 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Aduga ningthiraba nungsingna amadi Tengban Mapuda katlakpa khudolpotsingna kayada phajana leitengliba Mapugi Sanglenno haina Ibungogi tung-inbasing kharana Mapugi Sanglengi maramda wari sanarammi. Adubu Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Nakhoina uriba pumnamaksing asi pummang manglagadaba matam adu lakli. Matam aduda lonnaba nung amata ningkhaihandana maphamsida thanamloi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba matamgi awa-ana madi ot-neiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mrk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Maduda makhoina Jisuda hangjarak-i, “Oja Ibungo, hairibasing adu karamba matamda thokkadage? Aduga pumnamaksing asi thokkadoure haibagi khudamsing aduna karino?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoibu serannana chingdanaba cheksillu. Maramdi mi kayana eigi mingda laktuna, ‘Ei Christtani’ aduga ‘Matam adu lakle’ haigani. Adubu nakhoina makhoigi matung inganu. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Aduga nakhoina lan amadi lal houba tarabada kiganu. Maramdi hairibasing asi hanna thokkani adubu aroiba matam adu matam adumaktadi lakloi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Aduga Ibungona makhoida makha tana hairak-i, “Phurup amana phurup amagi mathakta, ningthou leibak amana ningthou leibak amagi mathakta lal hourakkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Aduga mapham kayada akanba yuhar haba, chak tangba amasung sathiba laina kaya thokkani amasung kiningngai oiba thoudoksing amadi atiyada achouba angakpa khudamsing ugani. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Aduga hairibasing asi thoktringeigi mamangda nakhoibu phagani amasung ot-neigani; nakhoibu wayennabagidamak synagogue-singda pithokkani amasung keisumsangda thamgani. Aduga eigi minggi maramgidamak nakhoibu ningthousinggi amadi leingak mapugi mangda puthokkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Adubu masina nakhoigidamak aphaba wapao sandoknabagi khudongchaba oigani. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14,15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char></note>Aduga nakhoina nasabu ngakthokchanaba kari haigadage haina hanna wadanaba napukningda leppu. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Maramdi nakhoina hairibasing adubu kakthatpa amadi yetpa ngamloidaba wahei amadi lousing eina nakhoida pibigani. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Aduga nakhoigi nama-napa, nachin-nanao, mari-mata amadi marup-mapangsingna nakhoibu pithokkani. Amasung nakhoi kharabu makhoina hatpa phaoba hatkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Aduga mi pumnamakna nakoibu eigi maramgidamak tukkatchagani. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Adubu nakhoigi kokki samna ama phaoba mangloi. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Nakhoina chetna lepchabana nakhoina hingba phangjagani.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem mang-takpagi maramda mangjounana phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mrk 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Nakhoina Jerusalem-bu lanmisingna koisinba urabadi, sahar adu thuna mang taklagani haiba nakhoina khang-u. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Adudagi Judea-da leibasing aduna chingjaosingda chensanu; saharda leibasing aduna sahar thadoksanu, aduga leibak adugi mapanda leibasingna leibak aduda amuk changdasanu. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref></char></note>Maramdi masi Mapugi puyana haikhiba ‘Cheirak Pibagi Numitsing’ adu thungbagi matam aduni. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Aduga numitsing aduda naopuribising amadi chajellibisinggidamaktadi kayada awaba oiragaba! Maramdi lam asigi mathakta tamthiba awa-anang lakkani amadi lam adugi misinggi mathakta Tengban Mapugi Cheirak lakkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Makhoi kharabu thangsangna hatkani aduga makhoibu leibak pumnamakta lanpha oina pugani. Aduga Jihudi nattaba phurupsinggi matam aduna loidriba phaoba atoppa phurupsingna Jerusalem-bu khongnetnagani.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Migi Machanupa aduna lenglakpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mrk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eze 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Phong 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char></note>Matam aduda numit, tha amadi thawanmichaksingda angakpa khudamsing ugani. Aduga malem asida leiriba leibak pumnamakki misingna samudragi iraokhon amadi kallaba ithak-ipomsingda kiduna chamamnaba thokkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Akiba amadi malem asida kari thoklagadage haiba khanbada misingna wanthagani maramdi atiyada leiba panggal pumnamak nikkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Phong 1:7</ref></char></note>Adudagi Migi Machanupa aduna achouba panggal amadi matik mangalga loinana leichilakta lenglakpa adu makhoina ugani. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Pumnamaksing asina thokpa hourakpada, lepkhattuna na-ngak adu thanggatlu, maramdi nakhoibu handokpibagi matam adu nakle.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Heiyit pambigi pandam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mrk 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida pandam ama hairak-i, “Heiyit pambi amadi atei upalsingda yeng-u. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Makhoina yening hullakpa matamda nakhoina kalentha naksillakle haiba khang-i. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Maduga chap manana pumnamaksing asi nakhoina thokpa uba matamda Tengban Mapugi leibak adu naksillakle haiba khang-u.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Eina nakhoida tasengnamak hairibasini, miron asina houkhidringeigi mamangda thoudok pumnamaksing asi thokkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Atiya amadi malemdi mangkhigani adubu eigi waheisingdi keidounungda manglaroi.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mitseng khangbagi kannaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Nakhoi cheksillu! Chaman thakmanbana, yu ngaoba, amadi punsigi oiba langtaknabana nakhoigi thamoibu khudum chalhanganu, nattrabadi Numit aduna langgi matougum khanghoudana nakhoibu phagani. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Maramdi numitsing aduna malem asida leiriba mipum khudingmakki mathakta lakkani. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Aduga thokkadouriba pumnamak asida nakhoina nanthokchaba ngamnanaba amadi Migi Machanupa adugi mangda lepchaba ngamnanaba nakhoina mitseng khangduna amadi matam pumnamakta haijaduna leiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisuna nungti numit khudinggi Mapugi Sanglenda tambirammi aduga numidang lakpa khudingda Chorphon Chingda ahing lennanaba chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Aduga Ibungogi wa tananabagidamak ayuk anganba khudingda miyam pumnamakna Mapugi Sanglenda laklammi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu hatnaba khujin-thourang touba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mrk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Khong 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Matamdu Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangba haina kouba Hamei yaodaba talgi chakkhangba kumheigi matam naksillaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Aduga athoiba purohitsing amadi wayel yathanggi ojasingna Jisubu hatnanaba aronba lambi thirammi; maramdi makhoina Jisubu phongna phaba matamda misingna kari tourakkadage haina misingbu kirammi.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Judasna Jisubu pithokpada yanaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mrk 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Adudagi tung-inba taranithoigi maraktagi ama oiriba Judas Iscariotta Satan-na changlammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Maram aduna Judas-na chatkhiduna athoiba purohitsing amadi Mapugi Sanglen ngakliba luchingbasingga karamna mahakna Jisubu makhoida pithokkadage haina hairammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Maduda makhoi haraorammi amasung makhoina mangonda sel pibada yanarammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Aduga Judas-na maduda yarammi amasung miyam leitaba matamda Jisubu makhoida pithoknaba khudongchaba yengduna leirammi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna lanthokpibagi chakhangbagi chaklen thourang touba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mrk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Adudagi Lanthokpibagi Chakhanggi yao macha adu hatkadaba numit haibadi Hamei yaodaba Talgi chakkhangba numit adu lakle. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Maduda Ibungona Peter amadi John-bu mangjounana tharaduna hairak-i, “Nakhoina chattuna eikhoina chananaba Lanthokpibagi chaklen thourang tou.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Maduda makhoina Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Eikhoina mapham kadaida chaklen adu thourang touba Ibungona pambibage?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Ibungona khumlak-i, “Nakhoina sahar aduda hek changbaga ising pun puba nupa ama nakhoina thengnagani. Nakhoina mahakna changba yum adu phaoba matung induna chatlu. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Aduga yum adugi yumbu aduda asumna haiyu, ‘Eina eihakki tung-inbasinga loinana Lanthokpibagi chaklen chagadaba ka adu kadaidano?’ haina Oja Ibungona naphamda hanglak-i. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Aduga mahakna, sem-saduna thourang pumnamak loiraba, chaoraba mathakki ka ama nakhoida utlakkani. Maphamduda eikhoigidamak chaklen thourang tou.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Adudagi makhoina sahar aduda chatkhirammi aduga Jisuna makhoida haikhibagumna pumnamak adu phangladuna makhoina mapham aduda Lanthokpibagi Chaklen thourang toure.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibungogi chakkhangba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mrk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Aduga pungpham aduna laklabada Jisuna pakhonchatpa taranithoi aduga loinana chananaba phamtharammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Aduga Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Eina awa ana khangdringeigi mamangda eina nakhoiga loinana Lanthokpibagi chaklen asi chaminnaba adukki matik pamkhi. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Maramdi eina nakhoida hairibasini, madudi Tengban Mapugi Leibakta Lanthokpibagi Chakkhangba asigi mapungphaba wahanthok adu thungdriba phaoba eina masi amuk hanna chararoi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Adudagi mahakna tenggot adu louraduna Tengban Mapubu thagatcharaga asumna hairak-i, “Masi louduna nakhoigi narakta lannou. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Eina nakhoida hairibasini, Tengban Mapugi Ningthou Leibak aduna laktriba phaoba eina anggur mahi asi amuk hanna thaklaroi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Adudagi Jisuna tal ama louduna Tengban Mapubu thagatcharaga machet machet settuna makhoida piraga hairak-i, “Masi nakhoigidamak pithoklaba eigi hakchangni. Eibu ningsingnabagidak nakhoina masi pangthok-u.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Aduga madu chaba loiraba matungda, maduga chap manana Ibungona tenggot adu louraduna hairak-i, “Tengot asi nakhoigidamak tabikhraba eigi eena chum namlaba Tengban Mapugi anouba warepnabani.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Isei 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Adubu, yengu! Eibu pithokkadouriba mahak adu eiga loinana table asida leiminnari. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Aduga Migi Machanupa aduna Tengban Mapuna mahakkidamak warepkhraba adugi matung-inna sigani adubu eibu pithokkadouriba mahak adudi awabanida!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Maduda, makhoigi marakta thabak asi tougadouriba mahak adu kana oigadouribano haiduna makhoi masel hangnaba hourammi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Khwaidagi henna chaoba adu kanano?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">10:35-45</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:1-17">Jn 13:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mrk 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9:46</ref></char>
    </note>Aduga makhoigi marakta kanana khwaidagi henna chaobage haiduna yetnarammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25,26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mrk 10:42-44</ref></char></note>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Atoppa phurupsingi ningthousingna makhoigi leibak miyamgi mathakta mapu oina palli, aduga makhoigi mathakta matik leiribasing aduna masana masabu Miyamgidamak khanbasing haina koujei. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mrk 9:35</ref></char></note>Adubu nakhoidi asumna oidasanu. Madugi mahutta nakhoigi marakta khwaidagi chaoba mahak aduna khwaidagi tonba oisanu aduga luchingba mahak aduna thougal touba mi oisanu. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Jn 13:12-15</ref></char></note>Maramdi chananabagidamak tableda phamliba mahak aduga thougal touriba mahak aduga kanana henna chaobage? Tableda phamliba mahak adu nattra? Adubu nakhoigi narakta eina thougal touba mi ama oina leiri.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Nakhoidi eibu changyengba khudingmakta eiga loinana lepminnakhrabasingni. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Aduga Eigi Ipana eingonda leingaknaba matik pibiba adugumna einasu nakhoida chap manaba matik adumak pibigani. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref></char></note>Nakhoina eigi Leibak aduda eigi tableda chagani amasung thakkani, aduga Israel-gi salai taranithoigi mathakta pannanaba phambanda phamgani.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter-na mahakpu yaroidaba adu Jisuna manjounana phongdokpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mrk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Simon, Simon! Yengngu! Satan-na nakhoibu gehudagi maham humdokpagumna humnaba, nakhoi pumnamakpu changyengnaba ayaba phangkhre. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Adubu Simon, nahakki thajaba adu mangdanaba eina nahakkidamak haijare. Aduga nahakna eingonda amuk halakpa matamda nahakna nahakki nachin-nanaosingbu pangal kankhathallak-u.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Maduda Peter-na khumlak-i, “Ibungo, Eihakna nahakka loinana keisumsangdabu oirabasu nattraga siba tarabasu chatnanaba sem sajare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Adubu Jisuna hairak-i, “Peter, eina nangonda hairi, ngasi nahakna eibu masak khangde haina ahumlak haidriba phaoba yenbarabana khongloi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sengao, khao, amadi thangsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mat 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mrk 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char>
    </note>Adudagi Jisuna tung-inbasing aduda hairak-i, “Eina nakhoibu sengao, khao, aduga sandal yaodana thaba matamda nakhoigi karigumba awatpa leikhibra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Maduda makhoina haikhi, “Kari amata leikhide.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Adubu houjikti sengao amadi khao leiba mahak aduna madu pusanu; aduga thangsang leitaba mahak aduna maphi yonduna thangsang leisanu. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char></note>Maramdi eina nakhoida hairi madudi Mapugi Puyada, ‘Aduga mahak ayon-aran toubasinggi marakta masing challe’ haina phongdokpiramaba adu eingonda thunglaba tare. Maramdi eigi maramda irambasing adu thunglare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Maduda tung-inbasingduna hairak-i, “Yengbiyu Ibungo, Mapham asida thangsang ani leire.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Aduga Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Maduna okle.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna chorphon chingthakta haijaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrk 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Adudagi Jisuna sahar adu thadoktuna mahousagumna Chorphon Chingda chatlammi amasung mahakki tung-inbasingsu mahakki matung illammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ibungona mapham adu yourabada mahakna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina athembada tadanaba haijou.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Adudagi mahakna makhoidagi nungna hunbamuk lappa maphamda chatthoklaga khuru-khudak kunduna haijare, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>“Ipa, nahakna yabirabadi, awa-anagi tenggot asi eingondagi louthokpiyu. Adumakpu eihakki aningba oidaduna nahakki aningba adumak toubiyu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Adudagi swargadagi dut ama thoraktuna Ibungobu kanhathanbirammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Aduga pukning wakhal wamankhibana, Ibungona henna pukning hakchang yaona haijarammi; amasung mahakki humang adu ee marikna leimaida tabagumna tarammi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Adudagi Ibungona haijarambadagi hougattuna tunginbasinggi manakta halakpada, tung-inbasing adu pukning wamanbana tumduna leiramba thengnare. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Maduda Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoi tumduna leiriba karigino? Hougatlu aduga nakhoina athembada tadanaba haijou.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu phaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jn 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Amasung Jisuna wa nganglingeida, Yengu, tung-inba taranithoigi manungda ama oiriba Judasna chingduna miyam ama tunglare. Aduga Judasna Ibungobu chupnanaba manakta changsillammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Maduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Judas, nahakna Migi Machanupa adubu chuptuna pithoklibra?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Jisuga loinariba tung-inbasingduna thokkadouriba adu ubada hairak-i, “Ibungo, eikhoina eikhoigi thangsang asi sijinnarasira?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Aduga makhoigi maraktagi amana Purohitlengi minai adubu thangna yanduna yetthangba mana adu kakthatle.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Adubu Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Masina yare, okle.” Adudagi Ibungona nupa adugi mana adu sokladuna phahanbire.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Adudagi Jisuna mahakpu phaba lakliba athoiba purohitsing, Mapugi Sanglen ngakpa loisanggi phamnaibasing, aduga ahal-lamansing aduda Jisuna hairak-i, “Nakhoina eihakpu leibakki wayel pathap thugaiba tamthiba mi ama phagadoubagumna thangsang amadi cheitup paiduna laklibra? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note>Eina nakhoiga loinana Mapugi Sanglenda numit khudinggi leiminnarammi aduga nakhoina eibu phakhide. Adubu amambagi panggalna panba pungpham asi nakhoigi pungphamni.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peterna Jisubu yadaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mrk 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jn 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Adudagi makhoina Ibungobu pharaduna puthoraklaga Purohitlengi yumda purakle aduga Peter-na laptakna makhoigi tung illaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Sumang adugi mayaida makhoina mei hougatladuna madugi akoibada phamlammi. Aduga makhoising adugi marakta Peter-su yaosillammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Peter-na mapham aduda phamba adu kanagumbi minai leisabi amana uraduna mangonda munna yengladuna hairak-i, “Nupa asisu Jisuga loinarambani.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Adubu Peterna maduda yaramde amasung mahakna hairak-i, “Nupi, eina mahakpu masakphaoba khangde.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ngaihak leiraba matungda nupa amanasu mahakpu amuk uraduna hairak-i, “Nahaksu makhoigi marakta amani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Adubu Peterna khumlak-i, “Natte Nupa, ei natte.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Pung amamuk leiraba matungda atoppa nupa amanasu yamna kanna takladuna hairak-i, “Tasengnamak nupa asi Jisuga loinarambani, maramdi mahaksu Galilee-gi mini.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Adubu Peter-na khumlak-i, “Nupa, nahakna hairibadu karino ei khangde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Khudak aduda Peterna wa nganglingei maktada yenbarabana khonglaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Matam adumaktada Ibungona leithoraktuna Peterda yenglaklammi, aduga Peterna Ibungona mangonda haikhiba “Ngasi nahakna eibu masak khangde haina ahumlak yadriba phaoba yenbarabana khongloi” haibadu ningsinglaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Adudagi Peterna mapanda thokkhraga thamoi sokna kapkhi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu noknabiba amadi phubiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mrk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Adudagi Jisubu sennariba mising aduna mahakpu noknarammi amasung phubirammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Makhoina Ibungobu mamit punsinduna mamaida phuraduna, “Nahakpu kanana phubano? Phongdok-u” haiduna hanglammi. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Aduga makhoina atoppa athiba wa kaya amasu nganglammi.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu Pilate amadi Herod-ki mangda pukhatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mrk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jn 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Nong hek nganbaga athoiba purohitsing amadi Wayel-Yathanggi ojasing yaona leibakki ahal-laman punna tinnare. Aduga Jisubu makhoigi Sanhedrin-gi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:66: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luchingba humphutaranithoina saba Jihudisinggi khwaidagi panggal amadi matik leiba wayellup</char></note> mangda puthokladuna, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Makhoina hairak-i, “Nahak Christta adura? Eikhoida haiyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Maduda Jisuna makhoida khumlak-i, “Eina nakhoida hairabasu nakhoina eibu thajaroi. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Aduga eina nakhoida wahang ama hanglabasu nakhoina paokhum pirakloi. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Adubu houjiktagi houduna Migi Machanupa aduna matik leiba Tengban Mapugi yet thangbada phamgani.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Maduda makhoi pumnamakna hanglak-i, “Adu oirabadi nahak Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adura?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ibungona makhoida khumlak-i, “Eini haibadu nakhoina haire.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Adudagi makhoina hairak-i, “Eikhoina atei sakhi ama amuk karigi mathou taribage! Maramdi eikhoi isamakna madu mahakki machinmaktagi tare.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu Pilate mamangda pukhatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mrk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Adudagi miyam apumba aduna hougattuna Jisubu Pilate-ki mamangda purakle. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Aduga makhoina Ibungobu maran siba houraduna hairak-i, “Nupa asina leibak miyambu lanna lamjingle. Mahakna miyamda Caesar-da<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ningthourel haibani.</char></note> kanggat thidanaba hai aduga masana masabu Christta ningthouni haijei.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Maduda Pilate-na Ibungoda hanglak-i, “Nahak Jihudigi ningthou adura?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Jisuna khumlak-i, “Nahakna hairiba aduni.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Adudagi Pilatena athoiba purohitsing amadi miyam aduda hairak-i, “Eina nupa asida maral amata phangde.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Adubu makhoina henna kanna taksinduna hairak-i, “Galilee-dagi houduna Jerusalem phaoba, Judea sinba-thungna mahakna tambiduna miyam marakta irang sagatli.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu Herod manakta thaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Madu tabada Pilate-na mangonda hanglak-i, “Mahak asi Galileegi mira?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Makhoina Jisubu Galilee-gi mini hairabada Pilate-na mahakpu Herod-ki manakta tharammi maramdi Galilee asi Herod-ki leingak makhada leirammi. Matam aduda Herod masamaksu Jerusalem-da leirammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herodna Jisubu uba matamda yamna haraojarammi, maramdi mahakna Ibungogi maramda pao tarammi amasung matam kuinadagi Ibungobu uba pamlammi. Aduga Jisuna angakpa thabak touba khara mahakna ujagani haina asha tourammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Maram aduna Herodna Jisuda wahang kaya ama hanglammi adubu Ibungona mangonda paokhum amata pikhide. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Aduga athoiba purohitsing amadi Wayen Yathanggi ojasingna lepkhattuna Ibungoda akanba maral sirammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Adudagi Herod amadi mahakki lanmisingna Jisubu noknarammi amasung karemnarammi. Aduga Ibungobu phajaba phijol ama setpiduna Pilate-ki manakta amuk hanna thakhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Numit adumaktada Herod amadi Pilate marup oikhi, madugi mamangda makhoi ani yeknarammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu sibagi yathang piba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mrk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Adudagi Pilate-na athoiba purohitsing, luchingbasing, amadi misingbu punna kouraduna, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina nupa asibu eigi inakta puraktuna misingbu lanna lamjingngi hairi. Aduga yengngu, eina nakhoigi namangmaktada mahakpu wahang paohang toure, adubu nakhoina mangonda siriba maral asigi maramda maral amata phangdre. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Aduga Herodnasu mahakki maral amata phangdre maramdi mahakna nupa asibu eikhoida amuk hanna tharakle. Mahakna sibagi cheirak phangba yaba karigumba thabak amatasu toukhide. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Maram aduna eina mahakpu cheirak khara piraga thadoklagani.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Maramdi Chakkhangba kummei khudinggi miyamgidamak Pilatena phadok amabu thadokpa tarammi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atoppa lairik ayambada wahei pareng asi yaode </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Adubu miyam apumba aduna laorak-i, “Mahakpu hatlu! Aduga Barabbaspu eikhoigidamak thadok-u!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>(Barabbas asi sahar aduda leibak irang thokhanbada saruk yabagi amadi mi hatlubagidamak keisumsangda thambani.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Aduga Pilate-na Jisubu thadokningduna miyam aduda amukka hanna hairammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Adubu makhoina, “Cross-ta hatlu! Cross-ta hatlu!” haiduna laoduna leirammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Ahumlaksuba oina Pilatena makhoida hairammi, “Karigi mahakpu hatkadouribano? Mahakna kari phataba toukhrabage? Eina mangondagi sibagi cheirak piba yaba maran amata phangde. Maram aduna eina mahakpu cheirak khara piraga thadoklagani.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Adubu makhoina houna lao-laoduna Ibungobu crossta pang tingduna hatnanaba taksillammi, aduga makhoigi khonjel aduna ngamkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Maram aduna Pilate-na makhoigi apamba adu pinanaba Jisubu hatnanaba laothoklammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Aduga mahakna makhoina thadoknaba nijaba, leibak irang thokhanba amadi mi hatpagidamak keisumsangda thamliba Barabaspu thadoklaga makhoigi apambagi matunginna Jisubu makhoigi makhutta pithoklammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu cross-ta hatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Adudagi lanmisingna Jisubu puthokkhibada khunggangdagi sahar aduda changlakpa Cyrene-gi Simon-ga thengnare. Aduga makhoina mahakpu phaduna cross adu thonggatlaga Jisugi matung innaduna puhallammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Aduga Ibungogidamak kaplibi amadi tengtharibi nupising yaona yamlaba miyam amana Ibungogi matung illammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Adubu Jisuna makhoida onsilladuna hairak-i, “Jerusalemgi machanupising! Eihakkidamak kapkanu; adubu nakhoi nasagidamak amadi nachasinggidamak kappu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Maramdi ‘Chaboktabising, naopudabi nupising amadi khom-indabi nupising adu yaiphabini’ haigadaba matam adu lakli. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Phong 6:16</ref></char></note>Matam aduda misingna chingjaosingda haigani, ‘Eikhoigi ithakta tasinbiro’ aduga makhoina chingsingda haigani, ‘Eikhoibu kupsinbiro.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Asangba upalda misingna asigumna touragadi akangba upaldadi kari thokkadage?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Aduga wayel thugaiba nupa ani amasu Ibungoga loinana hatnanaba puthoklammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Aduga makhoina “Kokki saru akangba” kouba mapham aduda laklabada makhoina Ibungobu amadi phattaba touba makhoi anibu amana Ibungogi yetta amana oida crossta pang tingkhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Isei 22:18</ref></char></note>Adudagi Jisuna hairak-i, “Ipa, makhoibu kokpiyu, maramdi makhoina kari touribano haibadu makhoina khangjade.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Aduga lanmising aduna Ibungogi phironsing adubu laibak chang yengnaduna yennarammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Isei 22:7</ref></char></note>Miyam aduna leptuna yenglammi amasung Jihudigi luchingbasing aduna Ibungoda keramnarammi. Makhoina hairak-i, “Mahakna atoppa misingbudi kanbikhi. Mahak asi Tengban Mapuna khandoklaba, Christa adu oirabadi mahak masasu kanjasanu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Isei 69:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga lanmising adusu laktuna Ibungobu noknarammi. Makhoina Ibungoda asinba yu piraduna, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>hairak-i, “Nahakna Jihudigi ningthou oirabadi nasamakpu kanjou.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Amasung Ibungogi kokthaklomda “Masi Jihudigi ningthouni” haina Greek, Latin amadi Hebrew londa iba ayiba ama thetlammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Aduga Ibungogi nakanda yalliba phattaba toubasing adugi maraktagi amana Ibungobu thina ngangladuna hairak-i, “Nahakna Christa oirabadi nasabusu amadi eikhoibusu kallu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Adubu atoppa phattaba touba ama aduna mahakpu cheiraduna hairak-i, “Nahak Tengban Mapubu kidabara? Mahakna phangba cheirak adumak nahaknasu chap manana phangli. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Adumakpu eikhoinadi achumba cheirak adu phangli maramdi eikhoina toujaruba thabakki phangbada matik chaba adu eikhoina phangjari. Adubu nupa asinadi aranba kari amata toukhide.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Aduga mahakna Jisuda hairak-i, “Jisu, nahakna nahakki ningthou leibak changbada eibu ningsingbiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Maduda Jisuna mangonda hairak-i, “Eina nangonda tasengnamak hairibasini, ngasi nahakna eiga loinana Paradise-ta leiminnagani.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu siba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Khong 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Matam adu chaorakna pung taranithoimuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lairik kharada taruksuba pung haina i, Maramdi Israelgi oina ayukki pung taruktagi pung masing thiba hou-i.</char></note> tarammi. Aduga amambana lam adu sinba tungna pung ahum taba phaoba kupsillammi, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>maramdi numitki mangal mangkhirammi. Aduga Mapugi Sanglen-gi maikhanphi adu anithokna segairammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Isei 31:5</ref></char></note>Adudagi Jisuna ahouba khonjelda laorak-i, “Ipa! Eina eigi thawai asi nanggi khutta sinajari.” Asi hairamlaga Ibungona thawai thakhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Aduga lanmi chamagi luchingba aduna thokkhiba adu ubada, Tengban Mapubu thagatladuna hairak-i, “Tasengnamak mahak achumba chatpa mini.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Amasung thoudok adu yengnanabagidamak tilliba miyam aduna thokkhiba adu urabada thabak yeiraduna hannakhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char></note>Adubu Ibungoga khangnaba makhoising haibadi Galilee-dagi mahakki tung illakpi nupising adu yaona makhoi pumnamakna thaptakna lepladuna yenglammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisubu Leirol Chanba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:38-42">Jn 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Aduga maming Joseph kouba aphaba amasung achumba chatpa mi ama leirammi. Mahak sanhedringi mioisinggi maraktagi ama oirammi, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>adubu mahakna makhoigi warep amadi thabak adu yaninglamde. Mahak Judea-gi Arimathea lamdagini aduga mahakna Tengban Mapugi leibak aduna lakpa khourangna ngaijarammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Mahakna Pilate-ki manakta chattuna Jisugi hakchang adubu nijarammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Adudagi mahakna hachang adubu loutharaduna linengi phina yomsillaga nungjaoda haktuna thamba mi kana amata thamnadriba mongpham amada thamkhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Numit adu thourang langba numit oirammi amasung Potthaba Numit hougadourammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Aduga Galilee-dagi Jisugi tung illakpising aduna Joseph-ki tung illaktuna mongphamda Jisugi hakchang adu karamna thambage haibadu yenglammi. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Khong 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Aniwa 5:14</ref></char></note>Adudagi makhoina halaktuna hakchang adugidamak manam nungsiba machal amadi teinanaba thao thourang toujare.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Adubu potthaba numit adudi wayel yathang matung-inna makhoina pottharammi.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Jisu hinggatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Chayolgi ahouba numitki ayuk anganbada nupising aduna makhoina thourang langkhraba manam nungsiba machalsing adu puduna mongphamda laklammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Aduga makhoina mongpham changphamgi nung adu inthoklamba makhoina thengnare. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Adubu makhoina manungda changba matamda Ibungo Jisugi hakchang adu leiramdre. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Aduga makhoina madugi maramda chamamnaduna leiringeida, ikhang-khanghoudana langna-nganba phijol setpa nupa anina makhoigi manakta leplare. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Maduda makhoina kimankhraduna leimaida mamai nonthaduna kuntharaga leirammi. Adudagi nupasing aduna makhoida hairak-i, “Karigi nakhoina asibasinggi marakta ahingba mahakpu thiribano? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6,7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mrk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> Mahak mapham asida leitre; mahak hinggatkhre. Mahakna Galilee-da nakhoiga leiminnaringeida kari hairambage haibadu ningsingu: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Migi Machanupa adubu pappisinggi makhutta pithokkani, mahakpu cross-ta hatkani aduga humnisuba numitta amuk hanna hinggatkani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Adudagi nupising aduna mahakna waheising asi haikhibadu ningsinglaklammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Aduga makhoina mongphamdagi halaklaga thokhibasing pumnamak adu tung-inba taramathoi amadi atei pumnamaksing aduda tamlammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Pakhonchatpasing aduda thokhibasing pumnamak adubu tamkhiba nupising adudi Magdalene-gi Mary, Joanna, amadi Jacob-ki mama Mary oirammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Adubu nupising aduna hairibasing adu makhoina pangangda ngangbani haina lourammi aduga makhoina nupising adubu thajakhide. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Adumakpu Peterna hougattuna mongpham aduda chenkhirammi. Aduga mahakna lukthaduna yengbada Ibungobu mongphamda thambada yetkhiba linen phi adukhakta taduna leiba ure. Adudagi mahakna kari thokkhrabajatno haina ngakpaga loinana amuk hankhirammi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna Emmauski lambida uhanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mrk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Numit adumaktada Jisugi tung-inbasinggi maraktagi makhoi anina Emmaus kouba Jerusalem-dagi mile taretmuk lappa khunggang aduda chatlammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Amasung thokhiba thoudok pumnamaksing adugi maramda makhoina chatna chatna lambida wari sanarammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Aduga makhoina thokkhibasing adugi maramda wari sanaduna khannaringeida ikhang khanghoudana Jisu masamak makhoigi manakta changsillaktuna makhoiga loinana chatminnarammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Adubu Tengban Mapuna makhoida Ibungobu masak khanghallamde. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Adudagi Jisuna makhoida hanglak-i, “Nakhoina chatna chatna kari maramda khannaribano aduga karigi pukning waribano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Maduda makhoigi maraktagi maming Cleopas kouba amana Ibungoda khumlak-i, “Houkhiba numit kharani asigi manungda thokkhiba thoudoksing asi khangdaba Jerusalemda thunglaba misi nahak khakta oiramgadra?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Maduda Ibungona makhoida hanglak-i, “Kari kari thoudok thokkhrabage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Makhoina Ibungoda khumlak-i, “Thokkhibasing adu Nazareth-ki Jisugi maramdani. Mahak Tengban Mapu amadi misinggi mangda wahei amadi thabakta matik leiba Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichou amani. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Adubu eikhoigi athoiba purohitsing amadi leingakpasingna mahakpu sibagi maral pinanaba khusinnakhi aduga makhoina mahakpu cross-thakta pang tingduna hatkhi. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Eikhoinadi Israel-bu maning tamhanbigadaba misak adu Ibungomakni haina asha toujarambani! Pumnamaksing asi thokkhiba ngasina humni subani. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Adugisu mathakta eikhoigi maraktagi nupi kharana ngasi ayuk nganta mongphamda chatluraga angakpa pao puduna halaktuna makhoina eikhoibu ngakhallare. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Makhoina Ibungogi hakchang adu mangkhre, aduga makhoida ‘Jisu hinggatkhre’ haina hairakpa swarga dut ani thengnarak-i, haiduna eikhoida tamkhi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Aduga eikhoigi maraktagi makhoi kharana madu yengnanabagidamak chatlubada nupising aduna haikhiba aduga chap manana ahangba mongpham adu thengnakhi adubu makhoina mahakpudi uba phangkhide.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Maduda Jisuna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoisi kayada pangkhraba! Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingna hairambasing adu thajabada kayada thinthariba! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Christtana matik ma-ngal phangdringeigi mamangda awa anang pumnamaksingsi khaanggadaba nattabra? Christtana awa anang pumnamak asi khanglaga matik mangal phanggadaba nattabra?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Adudagi Jisuna Moses-ki lairik amadi Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousinggi lairiktagi houraga mahak masamakki maramda puya pumnamakta hairibasing adu sandokna makhoida taklammi.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Aduga makhoina chatliba khunggang adu naksillaklaba matamda, Jisuna mapham adudagi makha tana chatkhigadabagi matou makhoida utlammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Adubu makhoina Ibungoda kanna taksinduna haijakhi, “Numit asi thengjillakkhre, aduga mamsu mamsillakle, aduna eikhoiga loinana leiminnarasi.” Maduda Ibungona makhoiga loinana leiminnanaba changminnare. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Aduga Ibungona makhoiga loinana chaminnanaba phamthaba matamda, mahakna tal adu louraduna Tengban Mapubu thagatcharammi. Adudagi mahakna tal adu machet setladuna makhoida pirammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Matam aduda makhoigi mamit pangthok-hallammi amasung makhoina Ibungobu sak khanglaklammi. Aduga Ibungona makhoigi mityengdagi mangkhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Adudagi makhoi masel hainarak-i, “Mahakna lambida eikhoida wari saringei amadi Tengban Mapugi Puya eikhoida sandokna taklingei matamda eikhoida nunggi harao-nungaibana thankhidra?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Adudagi makhoina khudak adumaktada hougattuna Jerusalemda amuk halakle. Amasung makhoina mapham aduda tung-inba taramathoi amadi makhoiga loinaramba ateising pulap tinnaramba thengnare. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Aduga makhoina, “Ibungo tasengnamak hinggatkhre amasung Simon-da uhanbikhre” haiba adu tare.<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Adudagi makhoi aninasu lambida thokkhiba thoudoksing, amadi Ibungona tal thugaiba matam aduda makhoina kamdouna Ibungobu sak khanglakkhiba haibadu makhoida tamle.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna tung-inbasingda uhanbiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Pakhon 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Makhoi anina thoudoksing adu tamlingeimaktada, ikhang khanghoudana Ibungona makhoigi marakta leplare aduga mahakna makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoida ingthaba leisanu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Maduda makhoina uribadu thawaini haina khanduna makhoi adukki matik kirammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Adubu Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Nakhoina karigi aduk kiribano? Nakhoigi thamoida karigi chingnabasing asi laklibano? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Eigi khut asida yeng-u! Eigi khong asida yeng-u! Eimakni. Eibu soktuna yengu, maramdi eina lu-tong panba nakhoina uriba asigumna thawaigidi lu-tong pande.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Mahakna masi haiduna makhoida mahakki makhut amadi makhong adu yenghallammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Amasung makhoina haraobagi amadi ngakpagi maramna thajaba ngamdaduna leiringeida Ibungona makhoida hanglak-i, “Mapham asida nakhoigi karigumba chananabaga leibra?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Maduda makhoina mangonda nga ayaiba machet ama pire, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>aduga mahakna madu louraduna makhoigi mamangda chare.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Adudagi Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Eina nakhoiga leiminnaringei matamda haikhiba wasing adu asimakni. Moseski Wayel Yathangda, Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpibasinggi lairikta, amasung thagat iseigi lairikta eigi maramda hairamba wa khudingmak thungba tai.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Adudagi makhoina Mapugi puya adu khangnanaba Ibungona makhoigi pukning hangdokpikhi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Aduga Ibungona makhoida hairak-i, “Masi iduna leiribasing aduni: Christana awaba khaangba tai aduga humni suba numitta sibadagi hingatpa tai. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Aduga Jerusalemdagi houduna phurup khudingmakta, paptagi pukning hongbagi amadi pap kokpibagi pao adu mahakki mingda sandokkadabani. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Nakhoina pumnamaksing asigi sakhini. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Pakhon 1:4</ref></char></note>Aduga Ipana wasakpikhiba adu eina nakhoida tharakkani. Adubu mathaklomdagi panggal aduna nakhoigi nathakta laktriba phaoba nakhoina sahar aduda ngaiduna leiyu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisuna swargada kakhiba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mrk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Pakhon 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50,51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Pakhon 1:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adudagi Ibungona makhoibu Bethany phaoba chingbiraklaga khut thangattuna makhoibu yaipha-thoujal pibire. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Aduga Ibungona makhoibu yaipha-thoujal piringeida makhoibu thadoklamduna Ibungobu swargada pukhatkhre. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Aduga makhoina Ibungobu khurumjaraga haraobana thanbaga loinanana Jerusalemda hankhirammi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Amasung makhoina Mapugi Sanglenda makha tana leiduna Tengban Mapubu thagattuna leirammi. Amen.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
